translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Bet_Dialogue_7eafd3a3:

    # e "Hey, Cone. How's the Tavern doing."
    e "嘿，科恩。酒馆最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Bet_Dialogue_7aec70a5:

    # c "Ya want me to tell ya my name again? No way."
    c "想让我再告诉你一遍我的名字？没门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Bet_Dialogue_434ac25b:

    # e "I already know your name. I just wanted to talk..."
    e "我早就知道你的名字了。我只是想聊聊天……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Bet_Dialogue_846eda6c:

    # c "Look, come here next time and ya can talk all ya want. Respect the bet integrity ya dink donk."
    c "听着，下次再来，你想聊多久都行。尊重赌约的完整性，小笨蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Bet_Dialogue_5fd10514:

    # e "Ok..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_be413ed6:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "欢迎光临夜夜椿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_24681cce:

    # c "Yer little lion friend is there, see him?"
    c "你那位小狮子朋友就在那儿，看见他了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_129df83f:

    # e "Hmm... what did you do?"
    e "嗯……你把他怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_b7d99f15:

    # c "I don't know, he voluntarily betted with me. It's not my fault he lost or something."
    c "我哪知道，他是自愿跟我打赌的。他输了什么的可不能怪我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_bf6f0d3d:

    # e "A-alright..."
    e "行、行吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_be413ed6_1:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "欢迎光临夜夜椿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_61d79fdb:

    # c "Yer two little fuckmates are waiting for yer ass, come go join them."
    c "你那两个小炮友正等着你呢，快去找他们吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_f0083db0:

    # e "Hmm... you mean Ole and Sebas?"
    e "嗯……你是指奥利和塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_af7646ac:

    # c "Aye. Lion is always here. But I didn't know lizards eat bread until now, colour me surprised."
    c "没错。狮子总在这儿。不过我也是现在才知道蜥蜴会吃面包，真让我吃惊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_bf6f0d3d_1:

    # e "A-alright..."
    e "好、好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_97de7bb1:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trun-...?"
    c "欢迎光临夜夜——……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_5a926dc3:

    # e "Hello, Cane."
    e "你好，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_8d5cef73:

    # c "Ya really think I'd take the bait here, [e]."
    c "你真以为我会在这儿上钩吗，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_a9f0941c:

    # e "What are you talking about, Cane."
    e "你在说什么啊，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_c6408ae7:

    # c "Cover yer cock, ya dink. I'm not serving some donks who goes out naked in the public."
    c "把你那根鸡巴遮好，你这蠢货。我可不招待在大庭广众下裸奔的蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_5e0eccfc:

    # c "Welcome, welcome, [e]. Fancy helping with our plates and mugs 'ere? We're gettin' a lil busy now."
    c "欢迎，欢迎，[e]。想不想来帮忙端端盘子、收收杯子？现在我们这儿可有点忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_2f1aa10e:

    # c "Welcome [e]. Just so ye know, some patrons requested private shows from yer ass."
    c "欢迎，[e]。先告诉你一声，有些客人点名要你私下给他们表演屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_b4e09a22:

    # c "Aye, welcome again, [e]. How's it going, my lad."
    c "哎呀，又见面了，[e]。最近过得怎么样，我的小伙子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_b1f8c8df:

    # e "Very good, actually. Thank you, Cane."
    e "其实好得很。谢谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_690a2e4e:

    # c "I've been feelin' better, since that night I spent wit' ye."
    c "自从和你共度那晚后，我感觉好多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_dcba56b5:

    # c "Ye was still a good lad, just that I hadn't been myself for years, forgot what that means."
    c "你一直都是个好小伙，只是我已经好多年不像自己了，连那是什么感觉都忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_e53b2d07:

    # e "I understand, Cane. Don't fret about it."
    e "我明白，凯恩。别放在心上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_bb98a8ed:

    # c "I'm glad to have ye around. Visit m' more often, lad."
    c "有你在身边我很高兴。以后常来看看我，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_7f00dddd:

    # e "Of course, don't ye worry, Cane. I'll be here helping you out."
    e "当然，别担心，凯恩。我会留在这里帮你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_4c4d442d:

    # c "Welcome, [e]. The nocturnal trunk always welcome ye cute lil face here, lad."
    c "欢迎，[e]。夜夜椿酒馆永远欢迎你这张可爱的小脸蛋，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_5a926dc3_1:

    # e "Hello, Cane."
    e "你好，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_9df12cda:

    # c "I heard ye running into some werewolves folks there, I wanna worry for ye, but..."
    c "我听说你在那里遇上了几个狼人，本来想替你担心，可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_568f3a0b:

    # c "Well, always be careful."
    c "总之，一定要小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_04f273db:

    # c "For m' and everyone who cares for ye, alright?"
    c "为了我，也为了所有关心你的人，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_c6cadae6:

    # c "For everyone 'ere, right? We don't wanna lose a good lad to them scoundrels."
    c "为了这里的每一个人，好吗？我们可不想让那些混蛋夺走一个好小伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_2e7e7811:

    # e "I will! How else can I come back to see you, Cane."
    e "我会的！不然我还能怎么回来见你，凯恩？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_8ed25211:

    # c "Welcome, [e]. Gettin' used to 'ere now?"
    c "欢迎，[e]。现在已经习惯这里了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_8c471278:

    # e "I do, Cane."
    e "习惯了，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_07e3f88e:

    # c "That party the lion threw was somethin' else. Been a while since we see everyone in the same place."
    c "那头狮子办的聚会真不一般。我们已经有段时间没见大家聚在同一个地方了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_2e899f8e:

    # e "Yeah, I think despite some hiccups, everyone had fun, I saw you talking with Rahim there too."
    e "没错，我觉得尽管中间出了些小岔子，大家都玩得很开心，我还看到你在那里和雷希姆聊天呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_90e46722:

    # c "Heh, everything can change in seconds, but that stubborn old bull's still the same, after all those years."
    c "呵，世事几秒钟就能改变，但这么多年过去，那头固执的老公牛还是老样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_f8661faa:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk, m' lad."
    c "欢迎来到夜夜椿酒馆，我的小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_2f047327:

    # e "Hey, how's it going?"
    e "嗨，最近过得咋样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_60d7a2b7:

    # c "Good, tavern's gettin busier with a bard by the hearth, but I've got no goddamn idea what he's singing about."
    c "好，酒馆里有个吟游诗人在炉边，客人是多起来了，可我他妈完全听不懂他在唱啥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_9beb1783:

    # e "Oh, Pirkka? He does have a thick accent when he's singing sometimes."
    e "哦，皮尔卡？他有时候唱歌时口音确实挺重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_4aa3e2e3:

    # c "Aye, he's upstairs right now, told him about private shows and all that. Lad has a good heart, wonder if he'll stay for long."
    c "是啊，他现在就在楼上。我跟他说了私人演出什么的。这小伙子心肠不错，不知道他会不会待很久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_a36f13f2:

    # c "Maybe I'll pay for him to stay even. Rumor says he has a way with his mouth."
    c "或许我还会掏钱让他留下。听说他那张嘴可有点本事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_f8661faa_1:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk, m' lad."
    c "欢迎来到夜夜椿，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_29735ad3:

    # c "Heard some banging upstairs that other day, turns out the regular's been playing cards again."
    c "前几天我听见楼上砰砰响，结果原来是那位老客又在打牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_f147b6dc:

    # e "Oh, they've been sitting there for a while."
    e "哦，他们已经在那儿坐了一阵子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_54dc1a9b:

    # c "The card and table gettin messier everytime they borrow from m' shelves. But they stay up for days there."
    c "每次他们从我货架上借东西，牌桌就弄得更乱。不过他们能在那儿一待就是好几天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_017f22fa:

    # c "Just don't break m' tables when ye... go upstairs, lad. Or straight up don't owe money. They've got more up their sleeves than ye think."
    c "你上楼时可别把我的桌子弄坏了，小伙子。还有，千万别欠他们钱。他们可比你想的更有手段。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_bad59a76:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk, outsider."
    c "欢迎来到夜夜椿，外乡人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_fd021e87:

    # e "Why are you calling me that name?"
    e "你为什么叫我那个名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_7332b894:

    # c "Well are ya not an outsider? Why can't I call ya outsider, outsider?"
    c "你难道不是外乡人吗？我怎么就不能叫你外乡人呢，外乡人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_3729b96c:

    # e "Hmmph..."
    e "哼……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_79858a9a:

    # c "How about [e], does that sound better?"
    c "[e]怎么样？这样听起来好点了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_d2c9a869:

    # e "Yes... Thank you.. Cane."
    e "是……谢谢你……凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_be413ed6_2:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "欢迎来到夜夜椿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Normal_Talk_9b502ad2:

    # c "Whatcha going for, [e]?" nointeract
    c "今儿想来点啥，[e]？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Normal_Talk_58e0fbb5:

    # "As you are about to ask, you realise you are not putting on the right clothes to judge..."
    "你正要开口，却意识到自己还没穿上那套适合评判的衣服……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_b9eb2c1d:

    # e "Cane, Can I get some work here?"
    e "凯恩，我能在这儿找点活干吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_482cb8d8:

    # c "What'cha thinkin. Ya be a Server or show yer patron some ass?" nointeract
    c "你觉得呢？是去当服务员，还是去给客人露屁股？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_76aa60a3:

    # e "Hey, Cane! Can I... ask if I can work on the private show?"
    e "嘿，凯恩！我能……问问能不能接私人演出吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_392c40f8:

    # c "Yer in luck, my lad! Or rather, we've got a lucky patron."
    c "你可走运啦，我的小伙子！不，应该说，今天有位走运的客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_572c9742:

    # c "Ye've a patron waitin' for ye in the backroom."
    c "包间有位客人在等你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_46f4825c:

    # c "I'll hand ye the pay once yer done."
    c "等你完事，我就把钱给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_d4392b56:

    # e "I'll need to think more, thanks Cane."
    e "我还得再想想，谢谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_99900951:

    # c "Eh... Alright. don't leave 'em hanging for too long, lad."
    c "呃……好吧。可别让客人等太久，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_e0696090:

    # e "O-ok! Thank you, Cane."
    e "好、好的！谢谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_0c1134d3:

    # e "Hey... Cane. You talked about working in the tavern, right?"
    e "嘿……凯恩。你之前说过可以在酒馆工作，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_7121ebe1:

    # c "Yeah?"
    c "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_774f4ade:

    # e "It looks pretty interesting, how is the wage here?"
    e "看起来挺有意思的，这里的工钱怎么算？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_a80432ec:

    # c "Aye, its 50 gold for 4 hours, I'd pay more if yer work hard enough." nointeract
    c "没错，四小时五十枚金币；只要你干得够卖力，我还会多付些。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_d2ecfc50:

    # e "I'll think about it, Cane."
    e "我会考虑的，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_b6ca98b4:

    # c "All good. Well then, enjoy yer stay in the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "没问题。那就好好享受你在夜夜椿的时光吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_adc10916:

    # e "Hey... Cane. Can I work in the tavern again?"
    e "嘿……凯恩。我还能再来酒馆工作吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_1a1b7af6:

    # c "Aye, same wage. Its 50 gold for 4 hours." nointeract
    c "没错，还是四小时五十枚金币。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_d2ecfc50_1:

    # e "I'll think about it, Cane."
    e "我会考虑的，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_b6ca98b4_1:

    # c "All good. Well then, enjoy yer stay in the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "没问题。那就好好享受你在夜夜椿的时光吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_e120c034:

    # c "Mister [e], ya had already served the whole village 'ere. Come back after a few hours ya thirsty lad."
    c "先生[e]，你已经把整个村子的人都招待过一遍了。过几个小时再来吧，口渴的小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Work_62ea5a76:

    # e "...Ok, Cane."
    e "……好的，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_740b1efb:

    # e "I want to order something from you..."
    e "我想找你点点东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_109d0e69:

    # c "Of course ya dink donk, we've got beer for 15, and our new Ale for 20 gold. Want one?"
    c "当然了，小笨蛋。我们有啤酒，15枚金币；还有新出的艾尔啤酒，20枚金币。想来一杯吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_ab6d13e9:

    # c "Of course ya dink donk, we have some beer right now, takes ya 15 gold. Want one?"
    c "当然了，小笨蛋。现在有啤酒，15枚金币一杯。要来一杯吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_ba9a6668:

    # e "hmmm...." nointeract
    e "嗯……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_45375577:

    # e "I'll take one beer."
    e "我要一杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_bc6178b0:

    # c "Good, here's yers, enjoy."
    c "好，给你，慢慢享用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_40dce0df:

    # e "I'll take one."
    e "我要一杯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_da44e24e:

    # c "Uhh... Ya dummy, look at yer pouch, [pc.gold] gold is not enough for a beer, mister."
    c "呃……你这个笨蛋，看看你的钱袋，[pc.gold]枚金币可不够买一杯啤酒，先生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_6b1d6423:

    # e "Oh... sorry about that."
    e "哦……抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_11ec3786:

    # e "I'll take an ale."
    e "我要一杯艾尔啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_8ef0a3d3:

    # c "Good, here's yer ale, enjoy."
    c "好，给你麦酒，慢慢享用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_40dce0df_1:

    # e "I'll take one."
    e "我要一杯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_f6000285:

    # c "Uhh... Ya dummy, look at yer pouch, [pc.gold] gold is not enough for an ale, lad."
    c "呃……你这笨蛋，看看你的钱袋，[pc.gold]枚金币可不够买一杯麦酒，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_6b1d6423_1:

    # e "Oh... sorry about that."
    e "哦……真抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_1c150e2e:

    # e "I'll think about it later."
    e "我晚点再想吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Order_2acac5fa:

    # c "Ya better."
    c "那你最好说到做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_316f8d81:

    # c "Hey, lad. Right 'ere!"
    c "嘿，小子，这边！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_904cca39:

    # "Cane shouts from behind you as you go upstairs, you turn around and see him quickly leaves his usual counter."
    "凯恩在你上楼时从身后喊道，你转过身，看见他迅速离开了平日待着的柜台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_3e8fb334:

    # e "Oh! Cane, I was about to ask you about what's up there."
    e "哦！凯恩，我正想问你楼上有什么呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_3ef666e8:

    # c "Well. And I was about to tell ya."
    c "是啊。我正准备告诉你呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_4d7e00bc:

    # c "Just renovated the place. With the pink bear lad's help too. We re-decorated everything from scratch, and cleaned up old tables for use."
    c "刚把那地方翻修了一遍。粉红熊小子也帮了忙。我们从头重新布置了一番，还把旧桌子收拾好拿来用了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_c5423812:

    # e "Isn't it the same as down here?"
    e "不是和楼下一样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_354be2d4:

    # c "Well, lad. For what it's worth, my knee's been sore for the better part of m' life, I can't keep handing out dishes and beer up there and down. That's why we'd closed off the floor at first."
    c "嗯，小子。说实话，我这辈子大半时间膝盖都疼，没法一直把餐盘和啤酒端上端下。所以一开始我们才把楼层封起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_db61eaf7:

    # e "What changed your mind?"
    e "是什么让你改变了主意？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_8832ad98:

    # "Your curiosity causes the old bat to smile nervously. A kind of friendliness that you seldom see with other patrons."
    "你的好奇让这老家伙紧张地笑了起来。这种友善，是你在其他客人身上很少见到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_028a213e:

    # c "I ought'a thought with yer help and everyone else, somethin' getting me all excited about..."
    c "我早该想到，有了你的帮忙，还有大家伙儿一起，总会有些让人兴奋的事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_717a2b3d:

    # c "Cane smiled warmly at you, his eyes twinkling with affection."
    c "凯恩热情地朝你笑了笑，眼中闪烁着亲昵的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_09818526:

    # "Cane chuckles again."
    "凯恩又咯咯笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_e991bf3d:

    # c "W-well, the tavern. It's gettin' quite filled 'ere. "
    c "呃——这个，酒馆。这里快坐满了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_4420776c:

    # c "The regulars understands and they'll get what they want themselves, so I thought, why not let 'em have their fun, y'know, bringing in all 'em customers and gold."
    c "常客们都明白该怎么做，也会自己拿到想要的东西，所以我就想，何不让他们玩个痛快呢？你懂吧，这样还能招来更多客人和金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_a42030c2:

    # e "That's really good to know, Cane. I'll do my best to help."
    e "知道这些真是太好了，凯恩。我会尽力帮忙的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_fde0982a:

    # c "Aye, after all, upstairs' reserved for the most loyal regulars and visitors..."
    c "是啊，毕竟楼上是留给最忠实的常客和访客的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_6db7f304:

    # c "...and the finest lad right 'ere. Haha, c'mon then, give ye old bat a hug."
    c "……还有眼前这位最棒的小子。哈哈，来，抱抱我这只老蝙蝠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_fa45db30:

    # "Without thinking, Cane steps forward and wraps his arms around you on his giant belly."
    "不假思索地，凯恩向前走去，用双臂将你搂在他那巨大的肚子前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_6f89fa7d:

    # "You are momentarily startled, but quickly recovers and returns the hug warmly."
    "你一时有些惊讶，但很快恢复过来，热情地回抱了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_1bc9bd8b:

    # c "I'm gonna miss ye little sleazy ass when yer away."
    c "你不在身边时，我会想念你这个小浪荡鬼的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_a3abc292:

    # e "Cane, I'm not going anywhere else."
    e "凯恩，我哪儿也不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_364f609d:

    # "You talk right inside of Cane's intimate embrace, his purple fur strokes your cheeks as you dig your head deeper into him."
    "你埋头更深，脸颊拂过凯恩的紫色毛发，就这样在他的亲密拥抱中说着话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_96aeb4a8:

    # c "Lad, I still haven't forgot that time we were in my room..."
    c "小子，我还没忘记那次我们在我房间里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_b2139233:

    # e "You trust me, right?"
    e "你信我，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_35c0e700:

    # c "I do, lad. I really do."
    c "当然信，小子。真的信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_15f36ae2:

    # c "And I can't let you go that easily."
    c "我可不能这么轻易放你走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_93312a6f:

    # "You can feel him hugging you tighter, one with an irrational amount of regret."
    "你能感觉到他抱得更紧了，仿佛怀着多得不合常理的遗憾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_8349da6f:

    # c "Mhmm... I wish ye'd stay with me, and the tavern every day."
    c "嗯……我真希望你能每天陪着我，待在酒馆里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_efa06011:

    # c "But it's impossible to ask for an adventurer like ya."
    c "不过，像你这样的冒险者，可不是想求就能求来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_1bf3e661:

    # c "So, this is the second greatest thing I'd wish for..."
    c "所以，这就是我第二大的愿望了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_9fdbebdd:

    # "You can feel him hugging you tighter, savouring what's happening in the present."
    "你能感觉到他抱得更紧了，尽情感受着当下发生的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_60dc01e6:

    # "He doesn't speak, instead he hugs you tighter, savouring what's happening in the present."
    "他没有说话，只是抱得更紧，尽情感受着当下发生的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_0961af11:

    # "Eventually, you two pull away from each other, you don't know if it's his unique odor or his cheeky smile, but a sense of warmth can still be felt across your body seconds later."
    "过了一会儿，你们才彼此分开。你不知道是他独特的气味，还是那副顽皮的笑容在作祟，但几秒后，温暖依旧传遍了你的全身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_3b406514:

    # c "Ya better be."
    c "最好如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_1605dbc6:

    # "His smile widens, his hand raises above your head, playfully scruffling your hair."
    "他的笑容咧得更开了，抬手越过你的头顶，顽皮地揉乱你的头发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_f195d2e0:

    # c "There's no rules upstairs, and some of 'em I know, are... mischievous. So keep yer eyes out for me, ye?"
    c "楼上可没什么规矩，而且我知道其中有些人……很会捣蛋。所以替我留意着点，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_1fc00be2:

    # e "I will."
    e "会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_105503ff:

    # c "Good, 'en I'll leave it up to ye."
    c "好，那就交给你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_121212ee:

    # "Cane turns away, and returns to take care of his business."
    "凯恩转过身去，继续忙自己的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_Time_Upstairs_8f745cfa:

    # "You unwittingly smiles at the kindness of the tavernkeeper, and quickly runs upstairs."
    "你因酒馆老板的善意而不自觉地笑了笑，随后快步跑上楼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_96e7e6c7:

    # "You walk over a table in the corner, it seems to be scattered with coins and bags, almost as if you've stumbled upon a treasure trove."
    "你走到角落的一张桌子旁，桌上似乎散落着金币和袋子，简直就像撞见了一座宝藏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_a6918201:

    # "As usual, it's the three regulars, playing and bantering around the table."
    "像往常一样，三个常客围着桌子玩牌说笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_34a031fd:

    # "They take notice of your prescence rather quickly, and wave their cards at you."
    "他们很快注意到你的身影，朝你挥了挥手里的牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_0c39021e:

    # fokk "Well, well well. Look who he is! Our all and mighty server of the tavern."
    fokk "哎呀，哎呀，看看这是谁！我们酒馆无所不能的服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_9b6a07a5:

    # gato "Bet this sorry arse' coming to ruin our fun again not even sitting down"
    gato "敢打赌，这个倒霉蛋又来扫我们的兴了，连坐都不肯坐下"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_df882dcf:

    # "Fokk chuckles, and motions you to sit on the chair."
    "福克笑了笑，示意你在椅子上坐下"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_3179e8cb:

    # fokk "Changed ye mind? There's always an empty chair for ye to sit on."
    fokk "改变主意了？这儿总有一把空椅子给你坐"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_91e7badb:

    # e "Well... I'll pass."
    e "呃……还是算了吧"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_e0bf7eee:

    # coit "What a party stopper ye're, get me some bread at least on yer way down, would ya?"
    coit "你可真会扫兴，至少下楼时给我带点面包回来，行不行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_c3dd5e41:

    # gato "Or, get yer arse beaten fer wasting our time."
    gato "不然就因为浪费我们的时间，让你屁股挨顿揍"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_a9eb95ce:

    # "Fokk awkwardly smiles."
    "福克尴尬地笑了笑"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_dd26be17:

    # fokk "Alright then, the chair's not going away anytime soon."
    fokk "好吧，那把椅子短时间内还不会消失"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_8e215a7a:

    # fokk "And Coit's joking, he doesn't eat bread."
    fokk "科伊特是在开玩笑，他不吃面包"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_eff65e66:

    # fokk "Well, well, well. Look who it is! Our server here on the table."
    fokk "哎呀，哎呀，哎呀！瞧瞧这是谁来了！我们的服务员也到桌边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_fdf80f23:

    # e "Hey, are you all playing cards?"
    e "嘿，你们是在打牌吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_cfb72ac5:

    # fokk "Playing cards we are, just taking a break to count the coins and talk about yer arse."
    fokk "我们是在打牌，只是暂时歇下来数数硬币，再聊聊你的屁股"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_8e5e615d:

    # gato "Bet'cha he's coming for the bloody table."
    gato "我敢说，他是冲着那张破桌子来的"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_163e5d1a:

    # coit "If ye want to be the tavern's cum rag, we can always, ye know, skip to the main course."
    coit "如果你想当酒馆的精液抹布，我们当然可以直接跳到主菜，懂吧"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_6e11ba0a:

    # gato "His pucker must be clenching so hard right now, keepin' it tight fer us to use right 'ere."
    gato "他现在屁眼肯定夹得死紧，好让我们在这儿用个痛快"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_063199c4:

    # fokk "'ey, ye tosspots, don't scare our precious server away with ye blabbering mouth, we can always go for a round of Cumrag, first."
    fokk "喂，你们这群酒鬼，别用那张喋喋不休的嘴把我们宝贝侍者吓跑了；我们也可以先来一轮“精液抹布”"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_95b823c3:

    # "You nod, getting yourself seated between the three large men."
    "你点了点头，在三个高大男人之间坐了下来"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_d6d49b94:

    # gato "'bout time! Let's get everything started Fokk."
    gato "可算来了！福克，咱们开始吧"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_c22b45d5:

    # "The fox shuffles the cards, and hands each of you a stack of card before putting the rest in the center."
    "狐狸洗了洗牌，给你们每人发了一叠牌，然后把剩下的牌放到中央"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_219dcfa0:

    # fokk "Good t' go."
    fokk "可以开始了"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_08542825:

    # coit "Get ready, server. And may the best player wins."
    coit "准备好，侍者。愿最厉害的玩家获胜"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_e73cdb83:

    # e "Uhm, I think I'll pass."
    e "呃，我想我还是算了吧"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_c5ec60cb:

    # fokk "'ight then."
    fokk "好吧"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_2464a6dc:

    # fokk "Either way I'll teach these two sods to behave around ya more, with their wallets."
    fokk "不管怎样，我都会教会这两个混蛋怎么对你规矩点，当然得动用他们的钱包"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_4740eedd:

    # coit "Well, server ye be'ter not stay around. Gettin' me distracted and what not. Or-"
    coit "侍者，你最好别待在这儿。你在这儿搞得我分心什么的。否则——"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_255d7122:

    # gato "Let's say we've seen which spot hits ye with the most pleasure, we'll make ye leak right away, heh."
    gato "假设我们已经找到了哪个地方能让你最舒服，那就马上让你漏出来，嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_4ebd3450:

    # fokk "Playing cards we are, wanna join?"
    fokk "我们正在打牌，想加入吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_fa9bb8c8:

    # coit "Aye, don't think ye can escape us that easily! Ye're hooked now, like a fish on a line. Ye'll be back for more, mark me words!"
    coit "哎，别以为你能这么轻易逃掉！你已经上钩了，就像线上上钩的鱼。记住我的话，你还会回来再玩的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_f85ee25f:

    # fokk "I've come t' respect this scruffy lad a li' more, ye be shi'ing ye pants he's winning all yer money, along with me."
    fokk "我开始更佩服这个邋遢小子了；等他把你所有的钱连我的那份也赢走时，你可别吓得拉裤子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_95b823c3_1:

    # "You nod, getting yourself seated between the three large men."
    "你点了点头，在三个高大男人之间坐了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_8881975a:

    # e "I must admit, the game was quite addicting. Count m' in, you lots."
    e "我得承认，这游戏还真让人上瘾。算我一个，各位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_0aea5d93:

    # gato "Ah, there's the spirit! I hope ye'v been practising, caus' we won't go easy on ya this time."
    gato "啊，这才对嘛！希望你已经练过了，因为这次我们可不会对你手下留情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_c22b45d5_1:

    # "The fox shuffles the cards, and hands each of you a stack of card before putting the rest in the center."
    "狐狸洗了洗牌，给你们每人发了一叠牌，再把剩下的牌放到中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_219dcfa0_1:

    # fokk "Good t' go."
    fokk "可以开始了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_08542825_1:

    # coit "Get ready, server. And may the best player wins."
    coit "准备好，服务生。愿最厉害的玩家获胜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_e73cdb83_1:

    # e "Uhm, I think I'll pass."
    e "呃，我想我还是不玩了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_c5ec60cb_1:

    # fokk "'ight then."
    fokk "那就算了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_0dc0c4b4:

    # coit "What a stinker, ye be'ter be back next time yer' free from passing plates and mugs."
    coit "真扫兴。下次你不用端盘子、送杯子的时候，可得回来玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_1295bfad:

    # patron2 "How did ye even get those 3 drifters in a row!"
    patron2 "你到底是怎么连续拿到三张流浪牌的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_6322873c:

    # patron2 "Ah, bugger me with a rusty sword! My bloody pockets are emptier than a beggar's arse."
    patron2 "啊，拿把生锈的剑捅我吧！我的口袋空得简直比乞丐的屁股还干净。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_5cb37b08:

    # "The table was cluttered with an assortment of playing cards and shimmering coins."
    "桌上堆满了各种各样的扑克牌和闪闪发光的硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_10c6e11d:

    # "Amongst which were the three men chattering, echoed with a symphony of gruff, deep voices of casual banters."
    "其中，三个男人正在闲聊，粗哑低沉的嗓音交织成一曲随意闲谈的合奏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_e97eda7f:

    # patron "Ain't that the truth, Gato? We need a feckin' miracle to turn this shite around."
    patron "说得没错，加托？我们得来个该死的奇迹，才能扭转这局面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_78f0edac:

    # "One of the tavern regular frowns, tossing the rest of his cards on the table without a care."
    "酒馆里的一名常客皱起眉头，毫不在意地把剩下的牌扔到桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_bf9c79db:

    # gato "Well, bugger me sideways! My purse's always drier than the desert sands. And it's all lost to this smug lil ol' bastard Fokk."
    gato "哎呀，真是见鬼！我的钱包总是比沙漠的沙地还干瘪。钱全输给这个自鸣得意的小混蛋福克了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_d11610ee:

    # "The alligator shakes his head, pointing his finger towards the Lemur."
    "鳄鱼摇了摇头，伸手指向那只狐猴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_ed3e25d4:

    # fokk "Hold your bloody horses, ya gits! Hand m' yer coins before opening ye mouth would ya?"
    fokk "你们这帮蠢货，急什么！先把硬币交出来再开口，行不行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_9055d445:

    # "The Lemur exclaims, glancing at the purse with his large round eyes."
    "狐猴惊叫一声，瞪着一双大大的圆眼睛看向钱包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_0eedb887:

    # gato "Oi, ye tosspot. Don't get on ye high horse. A change of pace is what I need. Somethin' that brings back lady luck to m' side. What say ye, Coit?"
    gato "喂，你这个酒鬼。别得意忘形。我要换换运气，好让幸运女神重新站到我这边。你说呢，科伊特？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_bfb5c1a3:

    # "Another regular, a beefy wolf-like Coyote smirks."
    "另一名常客——一只身材魁梧、长得像狼的郊狼——咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_cb177be9:

    # coit "Aye, A change of pace, Huh. A feckin' kick in the bollocks will change his pace perfectly fine."
    coit "嗯，换换节奏是吧？给他裆下来一脚，保证立马就能换换节奏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_d6abf5b2:

    # fokk "No change of pace will fix yer damn stinky mouth won't ya."
    fokk "不管换什么节奏，都治不好你那张该死的臭嘴，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_39a8ad82:

    # "Sensing unknown presence, the alligator turns his head around, and notices your glance."
    "察觉到陌生的存在，鳄鱼转过头来，注意到了你的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_ac4607fc:

    # gato "Hey, you there."
    gato "喂，说你呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_03fa3b03:

    # gato "Aren't you the server downstairs? I could've sworn I've seen yer pretty face around here."
    gato "你不是楼下那个侍者吗？我敢发誓，肯定在哪儿见过你这张漂亮脸蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_5883777d:

    # fokk "Ye be carrying plates and mugs around the tavern don't ye. I've seen what's under that measly little cloth of yours."
    fokk "你是在酒馆里端盘子递杯子的，对吧？我可见过你那点寒酸布片底下藏着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_0dfdbbbd:

    # "The regular speaks with mischievous glint, flipping a coin on the table as he speaks."
    "那名熟客眼中闪着恶作剧般的光，说话间在桌上翻转着一枚硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_70a97851:

    # fokk "What's ye name again, server?"
    fokk "我再问一遍，你叫什么来着，侍者？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_6d629ae0:

    # e "Hey, I've only served plates downstairs, I'm [e]."
    e "喂，我只是在楼下端端盘子，我叫[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_573a89ed:

    # "You retort nervously, but the three patrons don't even give you another sign except for a quiet chuckle."
    "你紧张地回嘴，可三名客人除了低声轻笑，连个回应都没给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_f1efda5b:

    # coit "Aye, that means yer nothing but a glorified mug carrier, so get yer ass over here. We could use some extra luck, or feast fer m' eyes will suffice."
    coit "是吗？那你不过就是个被抬举的端杯工，赶紧滚过来。我们正缺点好运气——当然，能让我饱饱眼福也行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_e710df45:

    # e "I was just looking around, I'm not actually working right now."
    e "我只是随便看看，现在并没有真的在工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_01ffa467:

    # fokk "Ye, and maybe ye should start working full-time under our table. That'd be what Cane hired you for innit?"
    fokk "是啊，说不定你该开始在我们桌下全职干活了。凯恩雇你不就是干这个的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_978fbf38:

    # "Their tease was rather playful, yet much more intimidating with their throaty voices."
    "他们的嗓音低沉沙哑，让这番调侃虽显得玩笑，却更具威慑力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_32206766:

    # e "But I've never played this game before, wouldn't I just lose?"
    e "可我以前从没玩过这个，不是只会输吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_110c7ef6:

    # gato "Sit yer arse down and play the bloody game, for gods' sakes. We'll teach ye."
    gato "看在诸神的份上，坐下玩这该死的游戏吧。我们会教你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_43d1f534:

    # e "W-well, I'll just pass."
    e "呃——那我就不玩了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_f90f2b88:

    # coit "Oh, listen to Mr. High and Mighty! Thinks he's too good for our little game, eh?"
    coit "哟，听听这位高高在上的大人物！觉得我们这小游戏配不上他了，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_09f00923:

    # coit "Well, suit yourself. We'll manage just fine without your fancy help."
    coit "行，随你便。没你这份花哨的帮助，我们也能应付得好好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_7efe1d3c:

    # gato "Don't let the door hit you on the way out, server."
    gato "出去时可别让门撞着你，侍者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_ec1eaf92:

    # fokk "Oi, server. These two are just sour about losing to the best card player of all time. If ye change yer mind, there's always a chair for yer to sit on, or under."
    fokk "喂，侍者。这两个家伙只是输给了史上最强牌手，心里酸着呢。你要是改变主意，永远都有椅子给你坐——或者坐到椅子底下也行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_95b823c3:

    # "You nod, getting yourself seated between the three large men."
    "你点点头，在三个魁梧男人之间坐了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_49c45232:

    # coit "'bout time, let's see if yer as skilled with cards as you are with mugs."
    coit "早该如此了。来看看你端杯子的本事，放到牌上是不是也一样厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_1bca7125:

    # e "Alright, I'm interested. How do I get started?"
    e "好吧，我有兴趣了。要怎么开始？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_07325e0e:

    # gato "That's the bloody spirit! Now, let's get down to business. We'll be playing a game of {i}Cumrag{/i}, ye know the rules I suppose?"
    gato "这才像话！现在进入正题。我们要玩的是{i}精液抹布{/i}，你应该知道规则吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_1cd0bf11:

    # e "W-what are you talking about? Cum Rag?"
    e "你、你在说什么？精液抹布？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_b3b7eb80:

    # gato "It's the name of the game. The loser is the cum rag, metaphorically."
    gato "这是游戏的名字。输家就叫“精液抹布”，只是比喻说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_d9a3008e:

    # e "Ah, then who's last game's cum rag?"
    e "那上局的精液抹布是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_6bc6001c:

    # "You notice two hands pointing their fingers towards the one in front of you."
    "你注意到两只手正用手指指向你面前的那个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_25215995:

    # coit "Feck off, I ain't do nothin' to ye sorry lot, we're paying with real gold 'ere anyway."
    coit "滚开，我才没对你们这群可怜虫做什么呢，反正咱们这里用的是真金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_3a4cd9bc:

    # "The alligator squints his eyes towards you."
    "那只鳄鱼朝你眯起眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_4bda9485:

    # coit "If ye don't know, ye can always ask. We're playing a fair game 'ere."
    coit "要是不知道，你随时可以问。咱们玩的是公平游戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_3af613df:

    # gato "Quit blabberin' and let's get to the shuffling. The sooner we start, the sooner we'll know what luck our punny little server here brings."
    gato "别废话了，开始洗牌吧。我们越早开始，就越早知道咱们这个滑稽的小发牌员会带来什么好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_46fef336:

    # fokk "The stake's simple, if ye the last one, yev gotta pay up."
    fokk "赌注很简单，要是你最后一个，就得掏钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_16cb3eca:

    # e "What exact amount are we betting here?"
    e "我们到底要押多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_e81379ab:

    # gato "40 gold per-"
    gato "每人四十枚金币——"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_d91b0664:

    # coit "Hush!"
    coit "嘘！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_0d47bb0d:

    # "Coit slaps his finger in front of Gato's mouth, motioning for his silence."
    "科伊特把一根手指拍到加托嘴前，示意他噤声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_eacc540d:

    # coit "Nothing servers like ye can't afford, we ain't got enough gold to bet on anyway, amirite, Gato?"
    coit "没有什么是你们这些伙计付不起的，反正我们也没足够的金子下注，对吧，加托？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_9c8ecaa5:

    # "Gato glances at you for a while, then raises his voice once more."
    "加托看了你一会儿，又一次提高了声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_34da7c8c:

    # gato "Yer a cheeky ol' Coyo'. We've got all sorts of wagers on this table, if it's not gold then we can spice things up a lil."
    gato "你这调皮的老科约。桌上有各种各样的赌注，不一定非得押金子，咱们也可以换点刺激的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_382bb6e5:

    # e "Spice things up?"
    e "换点刺激的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_878ad830:

    # gato "Ye well. Favors. Losers gotta do something for the ones who win. It adds a bit of entertainment for the winners, ye know."
    gato "呃，好吧。赌输的人得为赢家做点事。这样赢家也能多点乐子，你懂吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_45c358a3:

    # e "W-wait, what favours are we talking about exactly?"
    e "等、等等，你们说的“帮忙”到底是指什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_c45b8837:

    # coit "Like I said, nothing ye can't do."
    coit "就像我说的，没什么是你做不到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_9bfd683c:

    # coit "Fokk here once had to sing a bawdy song in front of the tavern, let's say we lost some customers for our beloved Cane that day."
    coit "福克以前有一次得在酒馆门前唱下流歌。只能说，那天我们心爱的凯恩因此损失了几位客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_ec22bac2:

    # fokk "Ya wanker, Cane stopped me there right when I was about to reach the climax of the song, they never got to the end there."
    fokk "你这混蛋，凯恩在我正要唱到歌曲高潮时把我拦下了，他们根本没听到结尾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_661b8851:

    # "Fokk pouts, shuffling the cards on his hands thoroughly."
    "福克噘着嘴，把手里的牌彻底洗了一遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_05f187fc:

    # fokk "Still, what a load of bullshit yer brewing with these {i}favours{/i}."
    fokk "不过，你用这些{i}帮忙{/i}酝酿出来的鬼话，真是一派胡言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_e0137cb0:

    # "Gato nods, with a mischievous glint in his eyes."
    "加托点了点头，眼中闪过一丝恶作剧般的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_45626c63:

    # gato "We'll change things up a bit now that Cane's favourite cupbearer's on the table, don't ye worry."
    gato "既然凯恩最喜欢的酒侍已经上桌了，咱们现在就稍微换个玩法，别担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_3ffd41bb:

    # "Both Gato and Coit chuckle loudly."
    "加托和科伊特都放声大笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_045e8ec4:

    # e "B-but, am I not going to lose anyway, you all have played the game for far longer than I do."
    e "可、可是，我不是无论如何都会输吗？你们玩这个游戏的时间可比我长多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_1b093ecc:

    # coit "Don't fret, aren't ye the brightest server in the room? I'm sure yer'll handle it well."
    coit "别担心，你不是这屋里最聪明的侍者吗？我相信你能应付得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_3a5e2d57:

    # gato "If ye lose, just consider it an initiation to become a cardslinger!"
    gato "要是你输了，就把它当成成为牌手的入门仪式吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_c5878ef2:

    # "As you ponder the risk of such favours, Fokk hands you the last stack of cards, moving the rest on the center of the table."
    "你思量着接受这种好意的风险时，福克把最后一摞牌递给你，同时把其余的牌移到桌子中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_174001eb:

    # e "I guess so. Favours' am I right?"
    e "我猜是吧。是好意，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_0198b87f:

    # fokk "That's the spirit, server. Keeps ye eyes on the prize and soon, ye'll wake up a couple thousand gold richer."
    fokk "这才对嘛，侍者。盯紧奖赏，很快你醒来时就会多出几千枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_b9490bea:

    # "Fokk grins, shuffling the cards on his hands thoroughly."
    "福克咧嘴一笑，把手里的牌彻底洗了一遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_7fd5a378:

    # e "Take it easy on me though, I-I still don't know anything about the game."
    e "不过对我手下留情点，我、我对这个游戏还一窍不通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_19669f11:

    # gato "Aye, we will."
    gato "那当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_2d620b0c:

    # "Both Gato and Coit wink at each other and chuckle loudly, though you still don't know what's going on."
    "加托和科伊特彼此眨了眨眼，又放声大笑起来，尽管你还是不明白究竟发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_8b61a7df:

    # coit "I like yer attitude. Ye'll fit right in on our table."
    coit "我喜欢你的态度。你很快就能融入我们的牌桌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_e0137cb0_1:

    # "Gato nods, with a mischievous glint in his eyes."
    "加托点了点头，眼中闪过一丝淘气的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_94fbf1b9:

    # "As clueless as you are, you scratch your head as the regulars glancing at each other, which just makes them grin wider as they notice you."
    "你一脸茫然地挠了挠头，那些常客则彼此交换着眼神；注意到你后，他们笑得更欢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_0a746f82:

    # fokk "Now I see why Cane liked this one more. Definitely up his alley too."
    fokk "我现在明白凯恩为什么更喜欢这个家伙了。绝对也合他的胃口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_85d764d5:

    # "The other two laugh wholeheartedly, as Fokk hands you the last stack of cards, moving the rest on the center of the table."
    "另外两人尽情大笑起来，福克则把最后一摞牌递给你，同时将其余的牌移到桌子中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Ready_08542825:

    # coit "Get ready, server. And may the best player wins."
    coit "准备好，侍者。愿最强的玩家获胜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_52c838ae:

    # fokk "Alright, listen up, ye scoundrels."
    fokk "好了，都给我听着，你们这些混账。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_91221d4a:

    # "Fokk clears his throat, showing you off the cards."
    "福克清了清嗓子，把牌展示给你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_44ab1726:

    # fokk "Cards can be in the deck, your hand, or a pile. As the game starts, all 52 cards are in the deck."
    fokk "牌可以在牌库里、你的手牌中，或者一叠牌里。游戏开始时，全部52张牌都在牌库中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_9327cb0a:

    # gato "We got that part, you long-winded sod! Get on with it!"
    gato "这部分我们已经知道了，你这个啰里啰嗦的混蛋！快点继续！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_907545ec:

    # fokk "Don't ye worry, server. Losers loves acting like impatients lot."
    fokk "别担心，侍者。输家总爱装得这么没耐心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_ab40919c:

    # fokk "Anyway, each of us gets 5 cards. And the first one can play any number of cards of the same rank to start a new pile."
    fokk "不管怎么说，我们每人会拿到5张牌。第一位玩家可以打出任意数量的同点数牌，开始新的一叠牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_19ae7c8c:

    # fokk "Then, the next one plays, and they can only play cards with number higher than the one on top of the pile-"
    fokk "然后轮到下一位出牌，而他们只能打出点数高于牌堆顶牌的牌——"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_048e07e8:

    # coit "Unless it's them pilgrim cards, then there's a twist to it!"
    coit "除非是那些朝圣者卡，那就另有玄机了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_54c847fe:

    # "Fokk rolls his eyes, obviously annoyed at the interruption."
    "福克翻了个白眼，显然对这次打断很恼火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_9f2b9d96:

    # fokk "Right, right. If there's 4 cards of the same rank on top of the pile, it'll burn the whole pile."
    fokk "对，对。如果牌堆顶上有4张点数相同的牌，就会烧掉整叠牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_3de7a90d:

    # e "What does burning mean?"
    e "烧掉是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_76c349d2:

    # gato "It means the cards in the pile are removed from the game, and the next sod will start a new pile. Simple as that!"
    gato "就是说，牌堆里的牌会从游戏中移除，下一位就会重新开一叠牌。就这么简单！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_78e1f522:

    # fokk "Well he's not wrong. Now, where was I? Ah, if ye can't play or don't want to play, ye have to take the entire pile and add it to your hand, starting a new pile."
    fokk "他说得没错。呃，我刚才说到哪儿了？啊，如果你不能出牌或不想出牌，就得把整叠牌拿走加入手牌，然后重新开一叠牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_fac9b7d2:

    # coit "Or if ye're a wee coward and too scared to take the risk, like Fokk!"
    coit "或者像福克那样，胆小得不敢冒险！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_7e19df10:

    # fokk "Have it yer way, stinker, see who has yer gold now. Either way, if ye have less than 5 cards, then ye must take cards from the deck to refill yer hand."
    fokk "随你怎么说，臭东西，看现在是谁拿到你的金币了。总之，如果你的手牌少于5张，就必须从牌堆抽牌，把手牌补满。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_97a950dd:

    # fokk "After that, it's the next player's turn."
    fokk "之后轮到下一位玩家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_5ca07584:

    # fokk "We'll repeat the same cycle until the deck is depleted. After that, you have no cards to refill and you'll win if you play all your cards."
    fokk "我们会重复这个流程，直到牌堆耗尽。之后你就没有牌可补了，只要把手里的牌全部打出，就能获胜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_57442269:

    # e "uhmm... so what does the pilgrim cards do?"
    e "呃……那朝圣者卡是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_d38f795e:

    # fokk "Ah, those pilgrim cards! They're special, see? The fire one is the kindler. It lets you burn down the pile, just like Gato mentioned earlier."
    fokk "啊，那些朝圣者卡！它们很特别，对吧？火牌叫引火者，可以像加托之前说的那样烧掉整叠牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_0c7be73a:

    # "The Coyote leans in, emphasizing on the symbols on the pilgrim cards."
    "郊狼凑近了些，着重指向朝圣者卡上的符号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_00009f5f:

    # fokk "And the watcher lets you peek at one of the other players' hands. Then ye can choose to swap hands or keep 'em."
    fokk "守望者牌能让你偷看其他一名玩家的手牌。然后你可以选择交换手牌，或者保持不变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_02c0e8cb:

    # fokk "Lastly, the drifter! It's the highest value in the entire game. If it's on the pile and ye don't have any other drifters, ye're stuck takin' the pile, me matey!"
    fokk "最后是流浪者牌！它是整个游戏里点数最高的牌。如果它在牌堆里，而你手上没有其他流浪者牌，那你就只能把整叠牌拿走了，我的朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_c5cd96b1:

    # gato "Aye, ye heard 'em, player! That's the rule of the game in a nutshell."
    gato "没错，你都听见了，玩家！这就是游戏规则的简明版。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_Tutorial_d9498195:

    # e "A-alright, I think I got a hang of it."
    e "好、好吧，我想我已经弄明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_f4ee0ae9:

    # coit "That's no fair round. I had such a great hand and yer tactics be ruining all me plans, ughhh..."
    coit "这局不公平。我手牌那么好，全被你的战术搅黄了，呜啊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_60fae672:

    # fokk "Oi, we know who's the cumrag this round."
    fokk "喂，这局我们知道谁是精液抹布了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_f45b8810:

    # coit "N-no wait, I still have money to spare yall. What was the stake, again. 40 gold per card?"
    coit "不、不，等等，我还有钱付给你们。刚才的赌注是多少来着？每张牌40金币？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_9b06564e:

    # gato "Beat'n by a glorified mug carrier didn't ya? Quickly m' coyo', my pocket's waitin'."
    gato "被一个高级端杯子的家伙打败了，是吧？快点，我的郊狼，我的口袋等着收钱呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_7ec1a6b7:

    # fokk "Been losing for a while now. Aren't ya a proper cumrag?"
    fokk "你已经输了一阵子了。你还真是个彻头彻尾的精液抹布，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_e59caa14:

    # gato "My luck's drier than the desert sands, same goes for m' pocket, Ugh."
    gato "我的运气比沙漠里的沙子还枯竭，口袋也一样。唉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_78a3fe48:

    # coit "Aye, ye better pay us up, including our server right 'ere. 40 gold per card."
    coit "你最好把钱付给我们，也别漏了这位就在这儿的服务生。每张牌40金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_975b3c7a:

    # coit "Hah, Looks like our all and mighty Fokk ain't so invincible after all, I knew we'd take back the gold from ye."
    coit "哈哈，看来我们伟大的福克也没那么不可战胜嘛。我就知道我们能从你手里把金币赢回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_bcad17bc:

    # gato "The god has fallen, hah. What a disaster, ye might wanna reconsider yer self-proclaimed title of a card master."
    gato "神倒下了，哈！真是一场灾难。你最好重新考虑一下自己自封的牌王头衔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_3b9c0802:

    # fokk "Ain't ye lots comedians. 'ight, 40 gold per card as promised."
    fokk "你们还真是一群喜剧演员。行吧，按约定，每张牌40枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_b119e45d:

    # e "W-wait... How much would we get?"
    e "等、等等……我们能拿到多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_783c00d4:

    # fokk "The first gets about two third of the gold, and the rest are spread even by the second and third."
    fokk "第一个人大概能拿到金币总数的三分之二，剩下的由第二和第三个人平分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_2565cfc8:

    # "The fox grins, accepting coins from the coyote."
    "狐狸咧嘴一笑，从那只郊狼手里接过金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_03be19e4:

    # coit "There goes m' ale money for the week, but just so yer know, I'm makin' it back next round."
    coit "这下我这周的酒钱可没了。不过先说好，我下一局会把它们赢回来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_1c476d46:

    # "The fox grins, accepting coins from the alligator."
    "狐狸咧着嘴笑，从那只鳄鱼手里接过金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_ad0fa076:

    # gato "My pocket's lighter than a feather now. Spend those coins wisely yall, caus' yer paying me back more next round."
    gato "我现在口袋比羽毛还轻了。你们都省着点花那些金币，因为下一局你们得多还我一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_d1af2494:

    # "The fox frowns, handing you three a pile of gold."
    "狐狸皱起眉头，把一堆金币递给你们三人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_a2d03d9c:

    # gato "Hah' finally ye taking a taste of yer own medicine."
    gato "哈，终于让你尝到自食其果的滋味了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_848fe7b6:

    # fokk "Aye, I ain't minding once in a while if m' medicine is winning."
    fokk "没事，偶尔让我的“药”变成胜利，我倒也不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_d16ee98a:

    # "You take [cdg_stake_amount] gold from Fokk."
    "你从福克手中拿走[cdg_stake_amount]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_fc2201dd:

    # fokk "Well, 'twas a good game with our server here."
    fokk "嗯，和咱们这位服务员一起玩，确实是场不错的牌局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_2f8fbc28:

    # e "It was quite fun playing with you guys too!"
    e "和你们一起玩也挺开心的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_3b0bf714:

    # coit "The more the merrier, and the chance of m' losing ain't going up too."
    coit "人多才热闹，而且我输掉的机会也不会因此增加。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_345229ef:

    # gato "As if yer' just tossing a dice, ye dumb scoundrel, that's why yer pocket's been empty most of the time."
    gato "你这蠢货就只会掷骰子，也难怪你的口袋大多数时候都是空的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_42cadf42:

    # "The four of you laugh wholeheartedly, with Fokk patting your back."
    "你们四人都开怀大笑，福克还拍了拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_61ee45fa:

    # fokk "Come back anytime, we'll be 'ere playing."
    fokk "随时欢迎回来，我们会在这儿打牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_c868cdd7:

    # "You stand up from the chair, and take your leave."
    "你从椅子上站起来，转身离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_b4e0bbb8:

    # fokk "Ah, today's cumrag - our little server here."
    fokk "啊，今天的精液抹布——就是咱们这位小服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_5d817fd6:

    # e "That was a confusing game... right?"
    e "那场牌局真让人摸不着头脑……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_53fbbed5:

    # coit "Aye, but ye lost. It looks like ye owe us a little something now, don't ya think?"
    coit "是啊，可你输了。看来你现在欠我们点东西了，你不觉得吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_9464a195:

    # e "Can't we... just let it slide this time? I ha- had a lot of fun playing with you guys."
    e "就不能……这次先算了吗？我、我和你们一起玩得真的很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_0dfd3d4f:

    # "The three regulars smirks, it doesn't seem to affect them."
    "那三个常客只是露出讥笑，看来这并没有影响到他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_d641d303:

    # gato "Can't just let ye off the hook that easily."
    gato "没那么容易就放过你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_7421ff5d:

    # "Fokk extends his hand, motioning you to hand over something."
    "福克伸出手，示意你交出点什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_552bc15d:

    # fokk "40 gold per card, ye'v got [cdg_stake] cards left 'ere. That's... [cdg_stake_amount] gold ye owe us."
    fokk "每张牌40枚金币，你还剩[cdg_stake]张牌在这儿。也就是说……你欠我们[cdg_stake_amount]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_1409c024:

    # e "W-well, I guess fair's fair."
    e "呃、呃，我想这很公平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_ae353743:

    # "You take out your bag, handing it over to Fokk."
    "你拿出钱袋，递给福克。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_b34a9d6d:

    # "He quickly snatches it, and begins counting the coins."
    "他一把迅速夺过钱袋，开始数里面的金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_951ca3c1:

    # gato "Well, we're a generous bunch, so don't ye worry yer arse. It'll be a drop in the bucket."
    gato "我们可是很慷慨的一帮人，所以别操心你那屁股。这点钱不过是九牛一毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_258d2091:

    # fokk "See, we'll take no more, and no less. Rules are rules and a few coins will do."
    fokk "你看，我们不会多收，也不会少收。规矩就是规矩，几枚金币就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_4f129f8e:

    # e "Still, you don't need to take all my gold to count it."
    e "不过，数钱而已，你没必要把我所有金币都拿走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_8c4c00f0:

    # "You grumble under your breath, and the fox quickly takes notice and looks up."
    "你低声嘟囔了几句，那只狐狸很快注意到动静，抬起了头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_127e1592:

    # fokk "We'll put'em to good use, server. After all, some of these are hard earned gold you've gotten from serving mugs and plates."
    fokk "我们会把它们花在正地方，侍者。毕竟，这些金币里有些可是你端杯送盘辛苦挣来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_867f964c:

    # coit "Ye mean more ale?"
    coit "你的意思是要更多麦酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_63153e98:

    # fokk "Especially more ale."
    fokk "尤其是更多麦酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_137b8bc3:

    # "Fokk returns the rest of the gold to you, and shares it with his cardmates."
    "福克把剩下的金币还给你，又和他的牌友们分了分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_7b03cd9a:

    # fokk "There goes [cdg_stake_amount] gold."
    fokk "这就少了[cdg_stake_amount]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_ab02f608:

    # e "Thanks for the game, anyway. I had a lot of fun."
    e "不管怎样，谢你陪我玩。我玩得很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_3b0bf714_1:

    # coit "The more the merrier, and the chance of m' losing ain't going up too."
    coit "人越多越热闹，而且我输掉的机会也不会因此增加。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_345229ef_1:

    # gato "As if yer' just tossing a dice, ye dumb scoundrel, that's why yer pocket's been empty most of the time."
    gato "说得好像你只是随手掷骰子似的，你这个蠢货，所以你的口袋大多数时候才会空空如也。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_42cadf42_1:

    # "The four of you laugh wholeheartedly, with Fokk patting your back."
    "你们四人尽情大笑，福克还拍了拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_61ee45fa_1:

    # fokk "Come back anytime, we'll be 'ere playing."
    fokk "随时欢迎回来，我们会在这儿玩牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_c868cdd7_1:

    # "You stand up from the chair, and take your leave."
    "你从椅子上站起来，准备离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_d4245b11:

    # e "I don't have any gold on me right now."
    e "我现在身上一枚金币也没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_1fe7abb8:

    # e "Mind if I l-leave to get them... very quickly?"
    e "我、我离开去取钱……很快就回来，可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_ac0f3d3f:

    # "The three regulars lean forward almost at the same time, their intimidating gaze only causes you to stutter more."
    "三个常客几乎同时探身逼近，他们骇人的目光让你说话更加结巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_97af28b0:

    # gato "No gold? Well, hand over ye wallet."
    gato "没金币？那就把你的钱包交出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_a2c2d516:

    # e "T-there's nothing inside... Can't we just work something out? I promise I'll p-pay back."
    e "里、里面什么都没有……我们不能好好商量一下吗？我保证会、会还钱的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_f881a9f9:

    # coit "Work something out, ye say? Gimme yer wallet and we'll work something out."
    coit "你说想办法解决？把钱包给我，咱们就能解决了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_b8025451:

    # "The Coyote smirks, his demeanor has shifted quite drastically, especially when they are all staring at you, not just your eyes but glancing over your whole body."
    "郊狼咧嘴一笑，态度发生了相当大的转变，尤其是他们全都盯着你看，不只是你的眼睛，而是把你浑身上下都打量了一遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_3ec868a1:

    # gato "It's all in good fun, wouldn't we all agree?"
    gato "这不过是大家寻开心嘛，谁不是这么想的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_9f200c17:

    # "Without hesitation, Fokk swipes the bag from you."
    "福克毫不犹豫地从你手里夺走了袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_69319bf1:

    # e "Hey!"
    e "喂！"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_359f7b50:

    # fokk "Well, a debt is a debt, and we'll take whatever ye can pay."
    fokk "欠债还钱，这是天经地义的。你能付多少，我们就拿多少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_181e9090:

    # "He turns the bag upside down, but nothing falls out of the bag."
    "他把袋子倒了过来，可里面什么也没掉出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_5afbc271:

    # "You awkwardly watch as the fox shakes your bag for a few times, just to confirm that no gold was ever in the bag."
    "你尴尬地看着那只狐狸把你的袋子晃了几下，只为确认袋子里从来就没有金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_a4c7b574:

    # fokk "Well, not even one gold?"
    fokk "连一枚金币都没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_059073a5:

    # gato "That was miserable, even for a mug carrier like ye."
    gato "真够惨的，就算是你这种端酒的跑堂，也够寒碜了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_34f595b1:

    # e "I told you I don't have any money..."
    e "我都说了，我没钱……"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_4afcd8fe:

    # "He turns the bag upside down, and you see only a few coins drop on the table, one of them almost rolls out of the table's edge until Gato stops it."
    "他把袋子倒过来，你看到只有几枚硬币掉在桌上。其中一枚差点滚到桌边，幸好加托把它拦住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_c0cff016:

    # "The fox raises his brows."
    "那只狐狸挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_967efe9d:

    # fokk "That wasn't enough for what ye owed us."
    fokk "这点钱可抵不了你欠我们的债。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_92efe130:

    # "Fokk scratches his chin for a bit, before coming up with an idea."
    "福克挠了挠下巴，琢磨了一会儿，随后想到了一个主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_b5215ed0:

    # fokk "Look, server, we ain't a greedy bunch, I'll spare ye the rest of the coins, if ye pay with yer body."
    fokk "听着，跑堂的，我们可不是贪得无厌的人。只要你用身体偿还，剩下的那些硬币就不用你付了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_07f7e10c:

    # fokk "I've seen what's underneath that apron of ye, when ye came forward to serve plates and mugs bare-furred."
    fokk "你端着盘子和酒杯，光着身子走出来时，我就看过围裙下面是什么了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_222d67f5:

    # coit "That was a sight to behold, m' lad. I even got to squeeze ye bouncy arse down there."
    coit "那可真是大饱眼福，小子。我甚至还在下面捏了捏你那弹性十足的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_356326f9:

    # "The regular walks out of their chairs, and blocks your exit in an uncomfortably close proximity."
    "那些常客纷纷从椅子上站起来，以近得令人不舒服的距离挡住了你的出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_44bf1ac9:

    # gato "And it's free, this lusty little server 'ere ain't the shameful type. I know he's gettin' hard knowing what comes next, just like when he's serving plates."
    gato "而且还是免费的——这个好色的小跑堂可不是什么会害臊的人。我知道他一想到接下来会发生什么就硬起来了，就像他端盘子时一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_0cf3a87a:

    # e "You can't do this..."
    e "你们不能这样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_d8442dd8:

    # fokk "I hate to break it to ye, but this is our district 'ere. And we can do whatever we want with ye."
    fokk "我得把话说明白，这里可是我们的地盘。我们想对你做什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_63a6305b:

    # e "I-I... that wasn't what I signed up for."
    e "我、我……我报名时可没说会有这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_1dcd4923:

    # gato "He's talkin' like he didn't want this... Haha, look at his poorly disguised thirst beneath his eyes."
    gato "他嘴上说得好像自己不想要似的……哈哈，看看他眼底那点藏都藏不住的欲望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_a29b9bcd:

    # fokk "Ain't that a truth, ye've been eyeing us for a while now. So why don't we skip to the great part with ye."
    fokk "这话倒不假，你盯着我们看了好一阵子。那咱们何不直接和你进入正题？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_47755b90:

    # coit "You've got no choice 'ere, server. Should've saved up a little before playing the game don't ye think?"
    coit "你在这儿没得选，侍者。玩这游戏前就该先攒点钱，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_fbf17031:

    # e "That was so unfair, all three of you are so experienced in the game."
    e "太不公平了，你们三个玩这游戏都这么老练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_eb6160c0:

    # fokk "Look, all we need is just some of your precious time. Considering ye've got no gold to pay, why not relax for the while."
    fokk "听着，我们只需要你一点宝贵的时间。既然你没金币付账，不如暂且放松一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_f8c19b08:

    # "He turns the bag upside down, and coins immediately rain on the table, making a small pile that grows by each seconds."
    "他把袋子倒了过来，硬币顿时如雨般落在桌上，堆成一小堆，而且每秒都在变大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_0221658f:

    # gato "Did ye hit a jackpot? Cause that's a lot of gold 'ere. "
    gato "你这是中了头彩吗？这儿的金币可真不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_ab831e17:

    # e "Well, I... uh... guess I must have forgotten about those. Can I have my wallet back now?"
    e "嗯，我……呃……我想我一定是把那些忘了。现在可以把我的钱包还给我了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_9711277a:

    # fokk "Not so fast, server. Since ye conveniently forgot about these coins, they rightfully belong to us now. Consider it a lesson learned."
    fokk "别急，侍者。既然你这么碰巧把这些硬币忘了，它们现在理所当然归我们了。就当是吸取教训吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_9f474be6:

    # e "W-wait, can't you just take what I owed?"
    e "等、等等，你们不能只拿我欠你们的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_11da3474:

    # coit "Not since ye lied to us. We value honesty more than ye think, little server."
    coit "不行，因为你骗了我们。我们比你想的更看重诚实，小侍者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_534a4682:

    # fokk "But we ain't a greedy bunch, I'll spare ye the rest of the coins minus those ye owed us, in the form of another payment."
    fokk "不过我们可不是贪得无厌的人。我会放过其余的硬币，只拿走你欠我们的那些，剩下的就用另一种方式付吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_272d932a:

    # e "W-what another payment."
    e "什、什么另一种付款？"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_07f7e10c_1:

    # fokk "I've seen what's underneath that apron of ye, when ye came forward to serve plates and mugs bare-furred."
    fokk "你上前来端盘子、端杯子时，我可是看见围裙底下是什么样子——身上不着寸缕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_222d67f5_1:

    # coit "That was a sight to behold, m' lad. I even got to squeeze ye bouncy arse down there."
    coit "那可真是大饱眼福啊，小伙子。我甚至还在下面捏了捏你那弹性十足的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_356326f9_1:

    # "The regular walks out of their chairs, and blocks your exit in an uncomfortably close proximity."
