    "你听见凯恩啧了一声，像是在责怪你急着往前冲；他又向后退开，不再贴着你耳语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Private_Show_f94ef217:

    # c "Enough talkin' 'bout this now. 'Ve gotta get back to servin' these layabouts."
    c "行了，先别聊这个。俺得回去伺候那帮闲汉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Private_Show_ee71b727:

    # "Cane gives you a firm smack on the ass, and a devilish smile."
    "凯恩用力拍了拍你的屁股，脸上挂着坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Private_Show_3f06c7ad:

    # c "Lookin' forward to yer next visit to the backroom."
    c "俺等着你下次来后间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_325e8898:

    # e "Hey, Cane. What do you know about the village?"
    e "嘿，凯恩。你对乐村了解多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_e98648d4:

    # c "I know a lotta bout the village, [e]. Everyone talks to me about their little stories."
    c "关于乐村，俺知道的可多了，[e]。人人都会跟俺聊聊他们那些小故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_3fa6e25b:

    # e "How about the people here, do you know them?"
    e "这里的人呢，你认识他们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_46bc6fbd:

    # c "Ya smartarse, of course I know them. Our hero, Lothar is our regular here, ya can probably see him here at night."
    c "小机灵鬼，我当然认识他们。俺们的大英雄洛萨尔是这儿的常客，晚上你大概能在这儿见到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_f34c2489:

    # c "And he has those bozos flying around him like flies buzzing around a piece of bread."
    c "他身边还总围着那几个蠢货，像苍蝇围着面包打转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_0d745029:

    # e "Got it, what about Rahim?"
    e "好，那雷希姆呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_ea0dfdc0:

    # c "That old bull? Why are ya talking about him, did he send ya here?"
    c "那头老牛？你怎么突然问起他，难不成是他派你来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_10a023b2:

    # e "Uhhh... noo?"
    e "呃……不是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_d3a5c7d1:

    # c "Ya wanna cause troubles, go to his old arse shop, eh? No wacky business here."
    c "想找麻烦就去他那破店，啊？别在我这儿胡闹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_d35aaf4c:

    # e "Ok."
    e "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_3694ee9e:

    # e "How about the people in the shop?"
    e "店里的人呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_ba30f6f4:

    # c "Ya mean the lion? and the shopkeeper?"
    c "你是说那头狮子？还有店主？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_cab56a3b:

    # e "Isn't Sebas the shopkeeper?"
    e "塞巴斯不是店主吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_5d565e7c:

    # c "I don't know, do I seem like the kinda man to visit a pawn shop?"
    c "我不知道，我看起来像是会去典当行的那种人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_2d765ff7:

    # e "Maybe?"
    e "也许？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_1c0bcb93:

    # c "Whatever, the lion comes here sometimes. I don't know when. Probably weekends."
    c "随便吧，那头狮子有时会来。我不知道是什么时候，大概是周末吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_86f77d8d:

    # c "I usually can squeeze some rumours outta the lion when he's drunk. Like really drunk."
    c "通常得等那头狮子喝醉了，我才能从他嘴里套出些传闻——得醉得很厉害才行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_20f16f70:

    # e "Can you not do it when he's sober?"
    e "他清醒的时候就不行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_19702dcb:

    # c "Ha, look at him. Ya think I'd bother with that. It's much easier talking to a drunk lion, like shooting fish in a barrel."
    c "哈，瞧瞧他那样。你觉得我会费那个劲吗？跟喝醉的狮子说话容易多了，简直像瓮中捉鳖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_5dc8ec35:

    # e "What does that mean?"
    e "什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_75078363:

    # c "Whatever. The other one in the shop, Ole, we had a few talks, not much. He's siding with the bull."
    c "算了。店里的另一个人，奥利，我跟他聊过几次，也没聊多少。他站在那头老牛一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_20342b90:

    # e "For what?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_a20e4a04:

    # c "The trouble from the Goat Tribe, that bull thinks I'm some kinda snitch."
    c "山羊部落那场乱子呗，那头老牛觉得我是告密者什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_ff25ae64:

    # e "But.... are you?"
    e "可你……是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_18e401e6:

    # c "No, why would I. I have my whole business here. Ya think letting them wreck my home is a viable business strategy?"
    c "不是，我干吗要那么做？我的全部生意都在这儿。你觉得任由他们毁了我的家，算是什么可行的经营策略吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_354a4300:

    # e "Did you explain to him?"
    e "你跟他解释过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_f58e24ef:

    # c "No matter. It's been a few years."
    c "算了，都过去好几年了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_4a7bedd3:

    # e "I'll try to see if you two can work out..."
    e "我会试着看看你们俩能不能和好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_76014c88:

    # c "Don't bother, [e]. Yar wasting yer time."
    c "别费心了，[e]。你这是在浪费时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_1d0e5d7c:

    # e "Hmm...?"
    e "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Lusterfield_907a1932:

    # c "Ahem... {p} You are wasting your time."
    c "呃……{p}我是说，你是在浪费时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_83fd7086:

    # e "Hey, Cane. Can you tell me the history of the Tavern?"
    e "嘿，凯恩。你能跟我说说这家酒馆的历史吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_228791d4:

    # c "Yea, yea, yea. People ask about this every time they come, like they found some gold treasure."
    c "行了，行了，行了。每次他们来都要问这个，好像发现了什么金矿似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_15d3f868:

    # c "This tavern has been here since the beginning of the village, like 80 years ago?"
    c "这家酒馆从村子建起来那会儿就一直在这儿了，大概有八十年了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_51e9a4e3:

    # e "Woah that's a long time."
    e "哇，那可真够久的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_49a3efe8:

    # c "My dad gave it to me when I was 20, somewhere ya age. I've been taking care of it for a whopping 37 years."
    c "我二十岁那年，我爹把酒馆交给了我，那时候我跟你年纪差不多。我已经足足打理它三十七年了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_3f440387:

    # c "This tavern is my everything, and I intend to keep it this way."
    c "这家酒馆就是我的一切，我打算让它一直这样下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_a45af4fe:

    # e "Do you need anyone else to help out with the tavern?"
    e "你还需要别人来帮忙打理酒馆吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_5b1bcb1b:

    # c "Someone. Ya think finding a person to serve drinks is so easy? That's why I want ya to work for me just for a few hours."
    c "需要人手。你以为找个端酒的人很容易吗？所以我才想让你来替我干几个小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_01f43739:

    # e "Mayber later..."
    e "以后再说吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Tavern_7b457a2f:

    # c "Ha. Later it is."
    c "哈，那就以后再说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_fd1c6e9a:

    # e "Cane, how are you doing?"
    e "凯恩，你在干什么呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_06444a59:

    # c "What chu think I'm doing?"
    c "你觉得我在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_abb3b16f:

    # e "Hmm... you were talking with your customer?"
    e "嗯……你刚才在和你的客人聊天？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_9be11dfb:

    # c "Wrong. I'm talking to a alleged dragon who comes here and get all the talks for free."
    c "错。我在和一个自称是龙的家伙聊天——他来这儿，什么话都想白听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_2a9e8f16:

    # e "Hey... look, look. I'll buy a drink later, ok?"
    e "嘿……你看，你看。我待会儿买杯酒，行了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Ask_Himself_8250175a:

    # c "Good. Don't waste my time with yer chit-chatting, [e]."
    c "好。别拿你的闲聊浪费我的时间，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_End_5c4dfe36:

    # e "That's all. Thank you, Cane."
    e "就这些。谢谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Dialogue_End_9b06c336:

    # c "Well, then enjoy ya stay in the Nocturnal Trunk."
    c "得，那就在夜夜椿待得开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_d2df1bbe:

    # "A scent of alcohol and yeast infiltrates your nose as soon as you open the door, you try to pinch your nose under the strong alcohol as a purple figure emerges in front of you."
    "你一开门，酒精与酵母的气味便钻进鼻腔；浓烈的酒气让你连忙捏住鼻子，一道紫色身影也随之出现在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_ca451f31:

    # my "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk, [e]."
    my "欢迎来到夜夜椿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_54d14e14:

    # e "Hello- wait how did you know my name?"
    e "你好——等等，你怎么知道我的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_8a74c83b:

    # my "That hunky dunky Lothar told me a goat outsider disrespected him. Ya got the guts to mix up his name like that, [e]."
    my "那个壮实的洛萨尔告诉我，有只不知哪儿来的山羊对他不敬。你胆子可真够大的，居然敢把他的名字搞混，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_60610ff3:

    # e "I'm a dragon... but yes, that's me. Nice to meet you, uh- what's your name again?"
    e "我是条龙……不过，没错，就是我。很高兴认识你，呃——你叫什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_f81c78e6:

    # my "That hunky dunky Lothar told me a goat fella came to good ol Lusterfield yesterday, it's gotta be ya name, [e]."
    my "那个壮实的洛萨尔说，昨天有个山羊家伙来了咱们这老卢斯特菲尔德，肯定就是你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_60610ff3_1:

    # e "I'm a dragon... but yes, that's me. Nice to meet you, uh- what's your name again?"
    e "我是条龙……不过，没错，就是我。很高兴认识你，呃——你叫什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_f76efaf7:

    # c "Aye, lemme tell ya my name, it's Cone. I own this place. *burp* 'cuse me mister. Ya don't remember people's name don't ya?"
    c "得，我告诉你我的名字，我叫科恩。这地方是我开的。*嗝*——失礼了，先生。你就是记不住别人的名字，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_77b7e6b2:

    # e "I just arrived like yesterday... how can I remember everyone's name."
    e "我才刚来，算起来也就昨天的事……怎么可能记得住所有人的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_75386d78:

    # c "How about this, mister. Wanna bet if you can remember my name next time ya come here?"
    c "这样吧，先生。下次你再来，敢不敢赌我看你还记不记得我的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_c5553849:

    # e "What are we betting on?"
    e "赌什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_8a970462:

    # c "50 gold, that fair for ya? If ya don't get my name next time, That 50 gold is mine." nointeract
    c "五十枚金币，公平吧？下次你要是叫不出我的名字，那五十枚金币可就归我了。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_4c7bc377:

    # e "Of course I can remember your name, you just told me."
    e "我当然记得住你的名字，你刚刚才告诉我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_40247c33:

    # c "I gotta be sure ya can actually use ya brain, its only bets."
    c "我得确认你确实会动脑子嘛，不过就是打个赌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_364c5444:

    # c "But if ya lose and ya don't have the 50 gold for me. Ya will have to see what's gonna happen."
    c "不过要是你输了，又拿不出那五十枚金币给我……那你就等着瞧吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_ee3b9383:

    # e "That's so easy, Cone. You really think I'm that stupid."
    e "科恩，这也太简单了。你真以为我有那么蠢吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_e116a3b7:

    # c "Well then, enjoy ya stay in the Nocturnal Trunk!"
    c "那好，祝你在夜夜椿住得愉快！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_5ab7a9a2:

    # e "Not really, I don't trust your bet."
    e "不怎么样，我信不过你这赌局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_f3859ebe:

    # c "Ya sure about that? Cause this is a one in a thousand years oppourtunity."
    c "你确定不赌？这可是千年难遇的机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "不要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_7a4142b1:

    # c "Ok then, guess ya small brain is only reserved for lil wolf, not me."
    c "行吧，看来你那颗小脑袋只装得下小狼，没我的份。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_93cd8604:

    # c "Look... my name is Cane, not Cone. What kinda stupid arse name was that anyway."
    c "听着……我叫凯恩，不是科恩。科恩？那到底是哪个蠢货起的破名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_ef9f0a5f:

    # e "Wait so you were lying after all."
    e "等等，所以你刚才果然是在骗我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_9bc4f675:

    # c "I reckon Sebas and Ole took ya in their lil pawn shop, must be a sweet dream living with those young boys ain't it?"
    c "我看塞巴斯和奥利把你收留在他们那间小当铺里了，和那两个年轻小伙住在一起，感觉像做甜蜜的梦，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_af5d1ebc:

    # e "Stop avoiding my question, Cane."
    e "别再回避我的问题，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_fd7e9955:

    # c "Ya think 50 gold is that easy to earn, it was a simple misdirection. Plus, those goons in the shop would've given my name away one way or the other."
    c "你以为五十枚金币那么容易赚吗？我不过是耍了个小花招。再说了，当铺里那两个蠢货迟早会把我的真名告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_adba2ae5:

    # e "You still lied to me, misdirection or not."
    e "不管是不是小花招，你还是骗了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_cebf7e47:

    # c "Yeah, huh. What cha gonna do about it. Cry to your lizard daddy like he cried to that old bull bastard?"
    c "是啊，怎么着？你想怎么办？去找你的蜥蜴爹哭鼻子，就像他当年跑去找那个老混蛋公牛哭诉一样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_33af252e:

    # c "Ok, that was a lil too much even for my standard, how bout this, take the 50 gold and enjoy the rest of ya day."
    c "行吧，这对我来说也有点过头了。这样吧，拿上这50枚金币，剩下的时间好好过吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_879634cc_1:

    # e "No."
    e "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_f25f291c:

    # c "Look, take it or leave it."
    c "听着，爱要不要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_c9dfabe5:

    # c "... 100 gold."
    c "……100枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_c8902e05:

    # e "Ok then. (You received 100 gold.)"
    e "好吧，那就这样。（你获得了100枚金币。）"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_First_5435e904:

    # c "My friend, ya got a bright future ahead of ya, [e]. Well then, enjoy yer stay in the Nocturnal Trunk."
    c "朋友，你前途光明着呢，[e]。那么，祝你在夜夜椿待得愉快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_20496e09:

    # my "Welcome back to the Nocturnal Trunk, [e]. Ya remember my name?"
    my "欢迎回到夜夜椿，[e]。还记得我的名字吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_ec6d9d4d:

    # e "Sure, I think you are..." nointeract
    e "当然，我想你是……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_39c78d47:

    # e "...Cona? Is that right?"
    e "……肯恩？对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_5bbe7ace:

    # e "...Cone? Is that right?"
    e "……科恩？对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_9c78f713:

    # e "...Ceno? Is that right?"
    e "……克恩？对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_8c733a72:

    # e "...Cana? Is that right?"
    e "……卡恩？对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_2219d90e:

    # e "...Cena? Is that right?"
    e "……库恩？对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Second_48cdf90f:

    # e "...Cane? I've heard of your name elsewhere."
    e "……凯恩？我好像在别处听过你的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_4375ebc2:

    # c "Ya bastard dragon. Come here."
    c "你这混账龙，过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_f0e3787a:

    # e "What's going on? Cane...?"
    e "怎么了？凯恩……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_430e8140:

    # "You follow Cane into the closet room. He picks up the apron you used to work from the dusty floor and shows it to you."
    "你跟着凯恩走进储藏室。他从布满灰尘的地板上捡起你工作时穿的围裙，拿给你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_eea4911b:

    # c "Ya see the problem here?"
    c "你看出问题了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_fdc9949b:

    # e "Hmm... I don't. W-wait... there's a hole in the apron now."
    e "嗯……没有。等、等等……现在围裙上有个洞了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_4957478b:

    # c "Yes ya dickhead. Ya broke my apron. T'is the only apron I have and ya broke it bad."
    c "没错，你这个大傻瓜。你把我的围裙弄坏了。我就只有这一条，而你还把它弄得惨不忍睹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_cbfc644e:

    # e "I swear the last time I worked, it looked fine to me. Are you sure no one else touched it?"
    e "我发誓，上次我工作时它看起来还好好的。你确定没人碰过它吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_0125d977:

    # c "Ya think I broke it? Poked a hole in it like how yer shop friends poke yer hole every night? Only ya have touched it son."
    c "你觉得是我弄坏的？像你店里的朋友们每晚捅你的洞那样，在围裙上捅个洞？只有你碰过它，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_3045e0ca:

    # e "Uh... I didn't know... I'm so sorry."
    e "呃……我不知道……真的很对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_0e317473:

    # c "Ye... Well. I reckon yer not gonna have an apron when ya work."
    c "嗯……那啥。我寻思你干活时是不会再有围裙穿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_1bae8ad1:

    # e "But... I thought your patrons liked the apron?"
    e "可是……我还以为你的客人们很喜欢这条围裙呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_5217820e:

    # c "Aye, that's why I ain't gonna let you destroy it more. I'm putting it away until the end of time."
    c "没错，所以我才不会再让你把它弄得更破。我打算把它永远收起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_50f49204:

    # e "Hey, Cane. I thought of a way to fix... the apron. Rahim, I'm sure he knows how to fix a hole easily."
    e "嘿，凯恩。我想到修好围裙的办法了……雷希姆肯定很会补洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_d0088566:

    # c "...No. Don't do it."
    c "……不。别这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_e4441b97:

    # e "How about I take it to him? I'll explain to him that it's my apron."
    e "不如我帮你拿给他？我会跟他说这是我的围裙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_3e2fc7d1:

    # c "He made the apron, ya cronky head. I can't take it to its maker who fooking hated me for no reason."
    c "是他做的围裙，你这个糊涂蛋。他妈的无缘无故恨我，我怎么能把它拿去找它的制作者？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_3350ee3f:

    # e "I... You have to fix it one way or another. Do you really want to bring this secret to your grave?"
    e "我……总得想办法把它修好。你真想把这个秘密带进坟墓吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_38f241db:

    # c "Let it rest. It's ancient history."
    c "让它过去吧。那都是陈年旧事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_0d99119f:

    # e "Is it really that hard?"
    e "真有那么难吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_5f7fb295:

    # c "Ya spoke like the finest lad I've met."
    c "你说话的口气，像极了我见过的最出色的小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ea4bc82b:

    # e "Whoo?"
    e "谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_c9668ba0:

    # c "The one who that fat bull made this apron for."
    c "就是那个胖公牛给做这条围裙的家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ef85acb8:

    # e "Stop distracting me again..."
    e "别再转移我的注意力了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ac22fca4:

    # c "It's true. I don't always get this unstoppable energy of young boys. But ya both took it to another level."
    c "这倒是真的。年轻小伙子那股停不下来的精力，我不是总能理解。不过你们俩更是把它发挥到了极致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ad43b1b5:

    # c "That lad. I took him in during a thunderstorm."
    c "那小伙子。我是在一场雷雨中收留他的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_b2f70962:

    # c "He was the greatest, the most passionate and generous being that I've ever seen."
    c "他是我见过最出色、最热情、最慷慨的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_5083b416:

    # e "Was...? Uh... I'm sorry-"
    e "他……？呃……抱歉——"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_eb1c30a8:

    # c "He's still alive, at least the last I've heard of. He used to be like you. But... the tavern, it corrupted him."
    c "至少我最后听到的消息是，他还活着。他以前和你一样。但……这间酒馆腐蚀了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ed2bef55:

    # e "Hmm... H-how?"
    e "嗯……怎、怎么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_d5fbfc21:

    # c "It's me. Those little ten years he's spent here. I've made him this way.."
    c "是我。就因为他在这儿待了短短十年，我把他变成了这样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_a5660b9a:

    # e "Hey... Cane. What are you talking about."
    e "嘿……凯恩。你到底在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_16098242:

    # "Cane sighs, looking at the ceiling, he ponders for a second, you can feel his sorrow even when he doesn't shed a tear."
    "凯恩叹了口气，望向天花板，沉思了片刻。即使他没有流泪，你也能感受到他的悲伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_821531a8:

    # c "I made him like me. The gluttonous, selfish me."
    c "是我把他变得和我一样，变成了那个贪食、自私的我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ad434ebf:

    # c "The lad, he's gone, long before he actually left the village. But the apron, it's still something to reminisce, at least I reckon."
    c "那小子早在真正离开村子之前，就已经不在了。不过这条围裙，至少还值得拿来怀念，我是这么觉得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_6c4f6682:

    # e "It must mean a lot to you."
    e "这对你来说一定意义重大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_5f6cecea:

    # c "Yes... I am who I am, [e]. That ya can't change."
    c "是的……我就是我，[e]。这点你改变不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_d19f855d_1:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_c462df8d:

    # c "Take the apron to him."
    c "把围裙拿给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_dabe232f:

    # e "Wait... really?"
    e "等等……真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_d3a1b47a:

    # c "Well were ya not insisting on licking his cock like a few minutes ago? Go take this dang apron to him."
    c "你几分钟前不是还坚持要舔他的鸡巴吗？快把这该死的围裙给他送去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_15ae1031:

    # c "Hey, I got an idea. Wanna take another bet with me?"
    c "嘿，我有个主意。想不想再和我打一次赌？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_a3a74ed9:

    # e "What? Cane are you drunk?"
    e "什么？凯恩，你喝醉了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_4e97f1f2:

    # c "Ya cowardly ass didn't even take one before, it's time. Say yes."
    c "你这个胆小鬼之前连一把都不敢赌，现在该轮到你了。说“好”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_40fc2269:

    # c "This time it's different, yer not betting on yerself, this is too easy."
    c "这次不一样，你赌的又不是自己，这也太容易了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_e258fe53:

    # e "Uhhh... What's the bet...?"
    e "呃……要赌什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_b951b910:

    # c "You think he would come back?"
    c "你觉得他会回来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_3be6d530:

    # c "I'll let ya ass decide, whatcha bet for 100 gold." nointeract
    c "让你自己决定，拿100枚金币赌一把。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_67959dd9:

    # e "I'm sure he'd come back for you, Cane."
    e "我敢肯定，他会为了你回来的，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_48f5d9cf:

    # c "Ya think so? I've been preparing the apron for him."
    c "你觉得吗？我一直在为他准备这条围裙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_a5b9de31:

    # e "I just want you to be hopeful."
    e "我只是希望你抱有希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_14d59a4d:

    # c "I'd have picked the same choice. I missed that lad so much."
    c "我也会选同样的赌法。那小子，我想他想得厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_3d20cc48:

    # e "Cane... you need to let him go... I don't think he's ever coming back."
    e "凯恩……你得放下他……我不觉得他还会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_34ae8156:

    # c "Huh...? Why not?"
    c "啊……为什么不回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_5339cbbd:

    # e "You said it yourself, that version of him you liked, was gone long before he left."
    e "你自己也说过，你喜欢的那个他，早在他离开之前就已经不在了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_582193ba:

    # c "Whatcha know about him anyway."
    c "你又懂他什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_ef7f2577:

    # c "However, I respect yer bet integrity."
    c "不过，我尊重你的赌约诚信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_023e6eca:

    # e "So... what should I do now?"
    e "那么……我现在该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_c5c48ee2:

    # c "Take ya apron. Tell that old fart I need a fix. Most probably he will rip the apron up like the old farty bull he is."
    c "拿上你的围裙。告诉那个老屁眼，我需要把它补好。他多半会像那头老放屁的老公牛一样，直接把围裙撕烂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_0068d11c:

    # e "Hmm... Ok. I'll let him know."
    e "嗯……好。我会告诉他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_faf83351:

    # c "And remember the bet between me and ya, sleazy ass."
    c "还有，别忘了咱俩的赌约，你这个下流胚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_af64c90b:

    # "You go around, handing out drinks as per usual."
    "你像往常一样四处给客人递酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_2c9b77b4:

    # "From the corner of your eyes, you see Seb slumped on the table in the corner."
    "你从眼角瞥见塞布趴在角落那张桌子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_7b420926:

    # "This time, however, he seems to be betting with a handful of people at his table."
    "不过这次，他似乎正和桌边几个家伙下注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_1f61fdb8:

    # "You shake your head. Typical Seb."
    "你摇了摇头。塞布还是老样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_bd4183f5:

    # "A stern glare pierces straight through you from the counter. While he was being toasted by the customers, Cane still had time to glare at you for slacking."
    "吧台那边投来一道严厉的目光，直刺向你。客人们正向凯恩敬酒，他居然还有工夫瞪你偷懒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_a5a79653:

    # "Fearful of Cane deducting your pay, you quickly hurry back to work."
    "生怕凯恩扣你的工钱，你赶紧回去干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_b6add6b9:

    # "The situation with Seb out of mind, you jerk in surprise as a commotion erupts in the tavern."
    "你把塞布的事抛到脑后，酒馆里突然爆发一阵骚动，吓得你猛地一哆嗦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_2d7f5c3c:

    # "It's coming from Seb's table."
    "骚动是从塞布那桌传来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_3f151d9c:

    # "The group from earlier is shouting at a drunken Seb."
    "刚才那群人正冲着醉醺醺的塞布大喊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_f46decec:

    # patron "Hey, lion. Pay up! You owe us 1000 gold!"
    patron "喂，狮子。把钱交出来！你欠我们1000枚金币！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_0c2e927d:

    # "The lion only grumbles unintelligibly."
    "狮子只是含糊不清地咕哝着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_427046d8:

    # patron "Don't play drunk! We're getting that money today one way or another!"
    patron "别装醉！今天不管用什么办法，我们都要拿到那笔钱！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_aa21b4d1:

    # "You hurry to go help your roommate, but before you can, a shadow flies out from behind the counter."
    "你赶紧想去帮你的室友，可还没等你赶到，一道黑影便从吧台后飞掠而出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_1211882d:

    # "Cane grabs the main aggressor by the collar, and easily lifts him off the ground with one arm."
    "凯恩一把揪住带头闹事者的衣领，单手轻松将他提离地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_f0e6e5a6:

    # c "Just what do ye think yer doin' in my tavern?"
    c "你以为你在俺的酒馆里干啥？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_94dde996:

    # "Cane sounds furious. Never in the time you've met him have you seen him raise his voice like this."
    "凯恩听起来怒不可遏。你认识他以来，从没见过他像这样提高嗓门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_1326d423:

    # patron "We... we just want to get... what the lion owes us."
    patron "我们……我们只是想拿回……那头狮子欠我们的钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_f1512314:

    # "Cane's face shifts into a mask of pure, visceral disgust, a growl entering his normally soothing voice."
    "凯恩的脸扭曲成一副纯粹而本能的厌恶面孔，原本令人安心的声音里也透出低沉的吼意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_ed102f3f:

    # c "I can' tell if ye think I'm blind or stupid. I've been watching ya'll all evenin'."
    c "俺看不出你们是觉得俺瞎了，还是觉得俺蠢。俺整个晚上都盯着你们呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_68878885:

    # c "Ain't nobody gonna take advantage o' another Lusterfield citizen while I'm still around."
    c "只要俺还在这儿，就没人能欺负其他卢斯特菲尔德居民。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_8ee3edc9:

    # c "Now do ya wanna get out of here walkin', or do ya want me to throw you out on yer asses to crawl like maggots?"
    c "现在，你们是想自己走出去，还是想让俺把你们扔出去，叫你们像蛆虫一样爬着滚蛋？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_42cccfb1:

    # "The troublemakers shiver in fear as the whole tavern rises up to support the barkeep."
    "闹事者吓得瑟瑟发抖，整个酒馆的人都站出来支持酒保。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_b0afc2d8:

    # "Outnumbered, they quickly retreat."
    "寡不敌众，他们很快退走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_751919cc:

    # "Now that they're gone, Cane's face shifts mostly back to normal, though you still see his anger from the way his face is tensed rigid despite his smile."
    "他们走后，凯恩的脸大多恢复了正常，不过从他明明在笑、脸部却绷得僵硬这一点，仍能看出他的怒意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_6c91324b:

    # "Cane, waves you over."
    "凯恩朝你挥手示意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_cb9359bf:

    # c "[e], come 'ere."
    c "[e]，到这儿来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_d50851a3:

    # "You oblige."
    "你照做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_3383e214:

    # "Cane gestures at the prone Sebas."
    "凯恩指了指躺着的塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_8e0b74fa:

    # c "Ah think the lion boy's 'ad too much to drink again."
    c "我看那狮族小子又喝太多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_ddb98fb8:

    # c "'e's not gonna walk back on his own like this, and I think yer not strong enough to haul him back either."
    c "他这样可没法自己走回去，我看你力气也不够把他拖回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_613cb8ca:

    # "Cane has calmed down significantly at this point, his body language returning to normal."
    "这时，凯恩已经明显冷静了下来，肢体语言也恢复了正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_94c7a4d3:

    # c "Why don't ya bring 'im to my room. I need to clear the table. Got a business to run 'ere."
    c "你何不把他带到我房间去？我得把桌子清空。这里还得做生意呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_96d70726:

    # "You pick Seb up and off the table, and carry him to the room at the back of the counter."
    "你把塞巴斯从桌上抱起，带到柜台后面的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_d9b42db9:

    # "The bed is made. You gingerly lay Seb down on it."
    "床铺已经铺好了。你小心翼翼地把塞巴斯放到床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_aeee70c5:

    # "Seb grumbles something nonsensical."
    "塞巴斯含糊不清地嘟囔了几句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_714229c5:

    # "You tuck him under the covers and return to work."
    "你替他盖好被子，回去继续干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_67099b53:

    # "The night is drawing to a close. There were an unexpected number of patrons that night."
    "夜色渐深，快要结束了。那晚的客人数量多得出乎意料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_22e25a0e:

    # "You were able to deflect most of the invitations to drink, but Cane was not so lucky."
    "你成功推掉了大多数邀酒，但凯恩就没那么走运了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_1ef36495:

    # "He had drunk a lot. At closing time, he stood swaying at the door, reminding you of the first time you met him."
    "他喝了很多。打烊时，他站在门口摇摇晃晃，让你想起第一次见到他的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_4f0165ba:

    # c "Ye... Go home now... Good job... Today..."
    c "你……现在回家……今天……干得不错……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_8a04646e:

    # "You thank him but you're not quite sure if Cane understands you."
    "你向他道了谢，但不太确定凯恩是否听懂了你的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_d0d0dd4c:

    # "You walk back to the shop."
    "你走回店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_944650f0:

    # "You enter the door. You walk past the counter. And..."
    "你推门进去，走过柜台。然后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_6a0ed89c:

    # "Oh crap."
    "糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_e5086423:

    # "You've forgotten something, or rather, someone important."
    "你忘了什么东西，不，更准确地说，是忘了某个重要的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_df210ab6:

    # "You turn back and head to the tavern."
    "你转身返回酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_306a36bc:

    # "To your surprise, the tavern door is left unlocked. Cane was probably too drunk to remember locking it. Thankfully, Lusterfield doesn't have much crime."
    "令你惊讶的是，酒馆的门没锁。凯恩大概醉得连门都忘了锁。幸好，卢斯特菲尔德没什么犯罪活动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_b6bfa508:

    # "Cane is not perched at his usual post behind the counter. Then again, that's to be expected. It's already past the tavern's business hours."
    "凯恩没有像往常一样守在柜台后面。话说回来，这也在意料之中。酒馆已经过了营业时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_0230dfac:

    # "You move to the room you left Seb in."
    "你走到之前把塞布留下的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_63e18892:

    # "You are about to call out either Seb's or Cane's name, when you hear a creaking sound coming from the room."
    "你正要喊塞布或凯恩的名字，却听见房间里传来吱呀声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_33f0b779:

    # "You pause at the door."
    "你在门口停下脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_8c884012:

    # "You perk up your ears. You believe you hear someone moaning. But whether it was Seb or Cane, you are unsure."
    "你竖起耳朵，隐约听见有人在呻吟。但你不确定那人究竟是塞布还是凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_b2ada32a:

    # "Curiosity compels you to ease the door open slightly."
    "好奇心驱使你把门轻轻推开一条缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_6a9db2f3:

    # "You pack a raging boner as you run back to the shop."
    "你带着怒张的肉棒跑回店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_93061099:

    # "You rush into your room and quickly rub one out while the scene you saw is still fresh in your mind."
    "你冲进自己的房间，趁刚才看到的场景还清晰地留在脑海中，迅速自慰了一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_bd9b7093:

    # "After the moment of ecstasy is gone, you calm down and ponder over what you saw and heard."
    "高潮退去后，你平静下来，思索着自己看到和听到的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_f030fa62:

    # "Seb always has your best interests in mind."
    "塞布总是把你的利益放在心上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_d3065f63:

    # "Cane might not look the part, but it seems like he has taken some sort of responsibility over you."
    "凯恩看起来或许不像那种人，但他似乎已经开始对你负起某种责任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Sebas_Tavern_Night_2ae663ad:

    # "You feel warm... Spent from a hot night, you slowly drift off to sleep."
    "你感到浑身暖洋洋的……在这火热的一夜之后，你慢慢沉入梦乡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_c54104e2:

    # c "So, how did yer lion friend get home last night?"
    c "那么，你那位狮子朋友昨晚是怎么回去的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_16c52b29:

    # c "I dragged him back."
    c "我把他拖回去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_0749a004:

    # c "Ye weren't there to help."
    c "你又没在那儿帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_a4453677:

    # e "Did nothing else happen?"
    e "没发生别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_e395615e:

    # c "What do ye mean?"
    c "你这话是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_e464566d:

    # "Cane narrows his eyes at you."
    "凯恩眯起眼睛盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_51b41dd3:

    # "You avert your eyes."
    "你移开视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_1a400f0b:

    # e "Nothing."
    e "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_2a4df793:

    # c "Good. What d'ya need? A drink? Wanna work ya job?"
    c "好。你需要什么？喝一杯？想去干你的活？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_0b56eb79:

    # e "Maybe later."
    e "也许晚点吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_a9155d81:

    # "That was close. You're lucky to have gotten away from that without more questions from Cane."
    "真险。你能躲过凯恩的追问，算你走运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_bd70e5a8:

    # c "Hey, [e]!"
    c "嘿，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_fb3f8a81:

    # "You turn around and see Cane grin dirtily at you."
    "你转过身，看见凯恩冲你露出下流的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_7b303ddf:

    # c "Thanks ye fer lockin' the tavern door when you left yesterday night."
    c "谢谢你昨晚离开时把酒馆门锁上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_After_Sebas_Tavern_Night_e07c34a1:

    # "You blush as red as a tomato."
    "你脸红得像个番茄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_43e8b76a:

    # e "Hey... Cane. I've got your apron back, and no... he didn't rip it apart."
    e "嘿……凯恩，我把你的围裙拿回来了，而且……不，他没有把它撕碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_679e952f:

    # c "Ya got the apron? For real?"
    c "你拿到围裙了？真的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_8a551634:

    # c "Oh... look at this beautiful boy. All brand new. Yer the best laddity lad out there."
    c "噢……瞧瞧这个漂亮的小伙子，崭新如初。你可是外头最棒的小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_a363a796:

    # e "What... does that mean?"
    e "什么……这是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_c24879c3:

    # c "Well I don't know. Since you're working in my place, I might as well give yer ass the apron you need!"
    c "呃，我也说不清。既然你在我这儿干活，那我不妨把你需要的围裙给你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_60f08cdb:

    # e "I thought you were leaving the apron for your guy."
    e "我还以为你要把围裙留给你的那个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_a0969aca:

    # c "I've been waiting for what? 4 years? No, he's not coming back, and I shouldn't waste my time waiting."
    c "我等了多久来着？四年？不，他不会回来了，我也不该把时间浪费在等待上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_e138317b:

    # c "Plus, I've got a much better substitute. Right here and then. No lie. Yer the best second finest lad I've had out there."
    c "再说，我现在就有个好得多的替代品站在这儿。不是哄你，你是我手下第二棒的小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_bebdde80:

    # e "What about the bet?"
    e "那赌约呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_3b641db6:

    # c "Ye, ye. Yer bet continues regardless of what I think, eh? Just take the apron."
    c "行了，行了。不管我怎么想，你的赌约都照旧，对吧？把围裙收下吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_f425d7a0:

    # e "Thank you so much for the apron, Cane. I'd surely be hoping to meet your expectation of... uhh.. finest lad."
    e "凯恩，真的太谢谢你了。我一定会努力达到你心目中……呃……最棒小伙子的标准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_7383137d:

    # c "Ya know what... It's actually funny, I blamed ya for breaking the apron. But it's me, I was taking it out to do the laundry. But it got torn by the door handle over there."
    c "你知道吗……其实挺好笑的，我还怪你把围裙弄坏了。可其实是我，我拿它出去洗衣服时，被那边的门把手勾住撕破了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_fa685f40:

    # e "I knew it... that's why I had no idea it was torn when I worked here."
    e "我就知道……所以我在这儿干活的时候，完全不知道它破了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_a1bb6838:

    # c "Ya can blame me for whatever happens here, it's fair game."
    c "这里发生什么事，你都可以怪我，反正理亏的是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_29fc1fcb:

    # e "It's fine."
    e "没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_879766b6:

    # c "Ha, yer already like thousand times better than when he left the place. That lad, I treated him like my own son."
    c "哈，你现在已经比他离开时强上一千倍了。那孩子啊，我一直把他当成自己的儿子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_7f254f7d:

    # c "You'd never imagine, he was 14 when he first worked here. No family, just him alone in the village, he lived in one of my room over there."
    c "你肯定想不到，他第一次来这儿干活时才十四岁。没有家人，孤零零地待在村子里，还住在我那边的一间房里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_eb6a0d62:

    # "Cane points to the guest room on the second floor, it seems to be much fancier than the other room, with a shade of a sign on the door that was once mounted."
    "凯恩指向二楼的客房。那个房间似乎比其他房间豪华得多，门上还留着曾经挂过门牌的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_7ae0ce56:

    # c "He was someone like a humble, and loving person when he first worked for tavern. And I, eh. I was so relieved to have a helping hand delivering the dishes."
    c "他刚来酒馆干活时，是个谦逊又有爱心的人。而我，呃，有个人帮忙端菜送酒，真是松了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_d869454f:

    # c "I asked the old bull to make something that he'd like, on his birthday. Well of course, he made him a perfect-fit apron on the fly. That lad liked it."
    c "他生日那天，我请雷希姆做件他会喜欢的东西。果然，他当场做出了一条完全合身的围裙。那孩子很喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_37505122:

    # e "The apron, it fits me as well...?"
    e "这条围裙……我穿着也合身？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_f6e3caa1:

    # c "Yeah. yeah it does. He liked the apron so much, that during those 10 years, he never spilt anything, or poked a hole in it. He was so careful and gentle with it."
    c "嗯，嗯，确实合身。他太喜欢这条围裙了，以至于那十年里从没往上洒过任何东西，也没在上面戳出过一个洞。他一直都很小心，也很爱惜它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_54aafea2:

    # c "But over time, he got used to the scent of the tavern, the gold-hungry, self-indulgent scent. And I felt I was losing control on him."
    c "但随着时间过去，他渐渐习惯了酒馆的气息——那种贪金逐利、纵情享乐的气息。我感觉自己越来越管不住他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_6b6d97f8:

    # e "But... What made him leave the village?"
    e "但是……他为什么要离开村子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_7ff81d38:

    # c "That one from the town, the inspector as they'd call him, he told the lad he'd get much more attention, much more money from working in the town. He instantly loved the idea."
    c "镇上来了个家伙，大家都叫他督察。他告诉那小伙子，只要去镇上工作，就能得到更多关注，还能赚更多钱。他立刻就喜欢上了这个主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_ef1680df:

    # c "But he didn't have the money. When he asked me for the gold to to apply for the job, I told him no. Because why would I? I wanted him to stay."
    c "可他没有钱。于是他来找我要钱申请那份工作，我拒绝了。凭什么答应？我想让他留下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_bffa6f1b:

    # c "He wouldn't listen, he didn't even talk to me again after that, he was just doing his job."
    c "他根本不听，之后甚至再也没跟我说过话，只顾着埋头工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_d4e43b45:

    # c "I shouldn't care, but I did, I took away his gold, thinking he wouldn't dare to leave the tavern."
    c "我本不该在意，可我还是在意了。我拿走了他的金币，以为这样他就不敢离开酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_88055e7c:

    # c "...I don't know what happened. But he got the money anyway. And he just vanished, one day before the goat tribe attacked the village."
    c "……我不知道后来发生了什么。但他不知怎么还是弄到了钱，然后就在山羊部落袭击村子的前一天，突然消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_52ac0c00:

    # e "...What? Are you sure...? What happened to him?"
    e "……什么？你确定……？他后来怎么样了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_821fa4f9:

    # c "I don't know, I'd love to believe he wasn't the one helping with the raid on the goat wagon. But I don't know."
    c "我不知道。我真希望能相信，袭击那辆山羊族马车的人不是他。可我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_3df6dec1:

    # e "Is that... why you didn't tell Rahim about all of this?"
    e "这……就是你没把这些事告诉雷希姆的原因吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_2715cdc3:

    # c "He isn't the kind of lad that'd do this. I am. Everyone knows this. I didn't want to give him a bad name when he comes back eventually."
    c "他不是会做出这种事的小伙子，我才是。大家都知道这一点。我不想等他将来回来时，背上一个坏名声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_afd55807:

    # e "But... is he coming back?"
    e "但是……他还会回来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_17c7e91e:

    # e "Cane... Can I give you a hug at least?"
    e "凯恩……至少让我抱抱你吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_becb5789:

    # "You reach in, embracing his whole body, he's so tall that your head can only rest on his chest, while he leans in, burying his booze-scented face on your shoulder."
    "你伸手抱住凯恩的整个身体。他实在太高了，你的头只能靠在他的胸膛上。他也俯身将脸埋进你的肩膀，脸上带着酒气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_8b6c73e7:

    # c "Good lad."
    c "好小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_f37d0883:

    # "Slap!! You hear a huge smack on your buttock as Cane's hand finds his way to make the loudest sound possible."
    "啪！！凯恩一巴掌重重拍在你的臀部上，发出震耳欲聋的声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_edfad75a:

    # "You gasped for a moment, couldn't even comprehend what just happened. Maybe Cane just has to ruin this heartfelt moment somehow."
    "你惊叫了一声，一时甚至没反应过来刚才发生了什么。看来凯恩非得想办法把这感人的时刻毁掉不可。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_2179d396:

    # c "HAAA Gotcha."
    c "哈哈，抓到你了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_2989e603:

    # e "Hey, Cane. I thought you were sad."
    e "喂，凯恩。我还以为你很伤心呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_a9fdd68b:

    # c "Well, I'm fine now. Fine fiddity fine. Gotta get back to work like the good old bat I am."
    c "我现在没事了。好得不得了，好得不能再好了。得回去干活了，像我这个大家熟悉的老蝙蝠一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_a122f272:

    # e "Hmm... I guess."
    e "嗯……我想也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_03379484:

    # e "If you need any support, I'll be here for you."
    e "如果你需要帮忙，我会一直在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_00ade677:

    # c "Alright, finest lad, ya bet I'll come and ask ya to work for me again."
    c "那当然，最棒的小伙子。你等着吧，我肯定还会来找你，让你回来帮我干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Apron_Quest_End_910fe225:

    # msg "Quest Finished! You gained a level up point! Check your inventory to distribute your points!"
    msg "任务完成！你获得了1点升级点！查看背包，将点数分配出去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_SoWrong_21a8a3ed:

    # c "What kinda name was that? Don't make me laugh, [e]."
    c "那算什么名字？别逗我笑了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_SoWrong_f6ec6469:

    # c "That wolf was right about ya all along, I thought that was a joke he made. My name is Cane. Not some kinda stupid name ya pulled out of yer arse."
    c "那个狼兽人一直都没看错你，我还以为那只是他开的玩笑。我叫凯恩，不是什么你蹲坑时从屁股里拉出来的蠢名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_SoWrong_1dc2025e:

    # e "Wait... Cane? How could I have forgotten about it..."
    e "等等……凯恩？我怎么会把这事忘了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_SoWrong_8e975ac2:

    # c "Yea ya stupid lizard got half a brain about fucking and sucking. I reckon those goons in the shop already told you my name already. And ya still forgot it."
    c "对，你这蠢蜥蜴的脑子一半想着操，一半想着舔鸡巴。我猜店里的那些混混早就告诉过你我的名字了。可你还是忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_SoWrong_e2bf0094:

    # c "Now, ya got the 50 gold for me?"
    c "现在，你有那五十枚金币给我了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_5dfc18ba:

    # c "Cone? Really? Ya think I've got that stupid name like that?"
    c "科恩？搞什么？你以为我会叫这么蠢的名字吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_22a66741:

    # e "Wait a minute, I thought you told me your name was Cone..."
    e "等等，我记得你说过自己叫科恩……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_3c8e0a5f:

    # c "What? Ya ask around other patrons, they remember my name better than ya do ya stupid lizard."
    c "什么？你去问问其他顾客，他们可比你这个笨蜥蜴更记得住我的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_19475493:

    # "Cane walks around the tavern tables by tables, then he gently taps a patron's shoulder while they were talking."
    "凯恩在酒馆里一桌一桌地走过，随后在一位正说着话的顾客肩上轻轻拍了拍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_db5ef229:

    # c "Aye, Mister, enjoying ya stay?"
    c "是啊，先生，待得还愉快吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_b61efa15:

    # patron "Yeah, this beer is buzzing awesome as always!"
    patron "是啊，这啤酒还是一如既往地棒，喝着带劲！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_9605da18:

    # c "I just wanna ask a simple question for my clueless lizard here, what's my name?"
    c "我就想替身边这条糊涂的蜥蜴问个简单问题：我叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_0f7dc502:

    # patron "Uhhh- Duhh. You are Cane right? How could anybody around here have not known about your name?"
    patron "呃——这不是明摆着吗。你叫凯恩，对吧？这里怎么可能有人不知道你的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_cd0283b1:

    # e "Wait... what?"
    e "等等……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_82ec6c1b:

    # c "Well apparently this lizard doesn't."
    c "不过显然，这只小蜥蜴并没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_750fb4d7:

    # patron "Ha... What the hell? Little lizard you gotta step up your game, and pay some respect to the tavernkeeper."
    patron "哈……搞什么？小蜥蜴，你得好好表现，给酒馆老板应有的尊重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_03689381:

    # e "I thought..."
    e "我还以为……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_18999e03:

    # c "I'm sure he does now, alright mister, enjoy ya beer!"
    c "我相信他现在已经懂得尊重了。好了，先生，慢慢享用你的啤酒吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_90353783:

    # "Cane turns back to you with an evil smirk on his face. He seems to be oddly satisfied with you not getting his name right."
    "凯恩转过身来，脸上露出邪恶的坏笑。他似乎对你没能叫对他的名字感到格外满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_eed51e05:

    # e "Did I mix it up with other people in the village? How could that. I'm sorry... Cane."
    e "我把你和村里其他人弄混了吗？怎么会这样。对不起……凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_7ea6f1bd:

    # c "Well don't say sorry to me, say sorry to ya wallet."
    c "别跟我道歉，跟你的钱包道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Wrong_072d3a3d:

    # c "Speaking of which, ya got the money eh?"
    c "说到这个，你带钱了吗，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Correct_ef785441:

    # c "Ha... damn, that's fair. It's Cane with a C."
    c "哈……该死，你说得对。我叫凯恩，是 C 开头的那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Correct_fb58faa6:

    # e "I almost mixed you up with Cone... where did that name come from?"
    e "我差点把你和科恩弄混了……你这名字是怎么来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Correct_533a6b69:

    # c "Ya sure? I'm not Cone for the record, just letting ya know."
    c "是啊，当然？我可不是科恩，先跟你说一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Correct_bcb31e09:

    # e "Yeah... whatever. Glad at least I got this right."
