    c "这堆是你的[pc.gold]枚金币。另一堆是约定好的50枚金币，归我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_94c5bebe:

    # "The bat gently swipe the first pile all up back into your pouch, and throws it back at you, you can barely catch it in the air."
    "蝙蝠轻轻一挥，将第一堆金币全都扫回你的钱袋，然后把钱袋扔还给你，你险些没能在空中接住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_f0969e8a:

