translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_4a0509df:

    # "He walks closer to you, his meaty belly almost touching your own, you shudder as you see his arm reaching behind your back."
    "他朝你走近，那肥硕的肚子几乎要贴上你的身体；看到他的手臂伸向你背后，你不禁打了个寒颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_1b88f674:

