translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_482a9ec1:

    # "Cane slapped your ass as hard as he can, you let out a loud gasp but the other patrons don't seem to notice."
    "凯恩使出全力打了你的屁股，你发出一声响亮的抽气声，但其他客人似乎并没有注意到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_bc35d635:

    # "You glance at your behind and then back to Cane. Your ass has already turned red by his forceful slap."
    "你瞥了眼自己的屁股，又回头看向凯恩。挨了他用力的一巴掌后，你的屁股已经红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_1e7a4e9c:

    # c "This is an extra punishment for forgetting my name, [e]."
    c "这是你忘记我名字的额外惩罚，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_f332a196:

