translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_2996cd64:

    # c "First time loser always gets a taste of my slap, mister. Yar surely welcomed when I come up with another bet."
    c "第一次输给我的人都得尝尝我这一巴掌，先生。等我想好下次赌什么，随时欢迎你再来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_c9fff88b:

    # e "I don't know if I want to bet with you again."
    e "我可不确定自己还想再和你打赌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_41cbba6d:

    # c "Well then, that concludes our lil business. Enjoy ya stay in the Nocturnal Trunk."
    c "那么，我们这点小生意就到此为止了。祝你在夜夜椿酒馆住得愉快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_GotTheMoney_2e23fe8d:

    # "Your ass still feels sore after Cane's slap. You nudge on the cheeks as you walk around the tavern."
    "凯恩那一巴掌拍得你屁股现在还酸痛。你在酒馆里走动时，不停地揉着臀瓣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_f0972ae5:

    # e "Let me see... I've got... uhh- [pc.gold] gold..."
    e "我看看……我有……呃——[pc.gold]枚金币……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_b87bec4d:

    # c "How poor are ya lil goat. Shouldn't have bet if ya ain't got no money."
    c "你这小羊羔还真穷。没钱就不该下注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_8435aaf1:

    # e "I'm sorry, Cane. I thought I'd remember..."
    e "对不起，凯恩。我以为自己会记得……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_106596c3:

    # c "Well well well, gimme that."
    c "好好好，拿来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_a04dae47:

    # "Cane yanks your pouch away from your palms, he swiftly pour all the coins on the counter and took them away. He then hands you back the empty pouch."
    "凯恩一把从你手中夺走钱袋，迅速将里面的硬币全倒在柜台上，随后尽数收走。他接着把空钱袋还给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_669735f6:

    # c "... ya still owe me [owed_gold], pal."
    c "……伙计，你还欠我[owed_gold]枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_7ad38c53:

    # e "I'll come back soon and get you the money."
    e "我很快就会回来把钱给你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_db04bb7e:

    # c "No I don't think so. C'mon, ya not gonna leave this place until ya paid ya debt. Look, ya be serving my patrons for a few hours and I'll consider our debt forgotten."
    c "不，我看没那么简单。得了，在还清欠款之前，你别想离开这里。听着，替我的客人们端上几个小时的酒菜，我就考虑把这笔账一笔勾销。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_e5c832b2:

    # e "Hey, it's just [owed_gold] gold, I'll earn this back elsewhere."
    e "喂，不就[owed_gold]枚金币吗？我在别的地方也能赚回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_NoMoney_7814d9f9:

    # c "It's only a few hours, if not, ya gonna pay double the price ya owed me. Just be our server for a while, what can it hurt ya?" nointeract
    c "也就几个小时而已。不然你欠我的钱可要翻倍。暂时替我们当会儿服务员，又能把你怎么样？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_c237210e:

    # "As you enters the tavern, you immediately draw the attention of everyone present."
    "你一走进酒馆，立刻吸引了在场所有人的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_24a1b6eb:

    # "You feel hot even though you were used to serving this crowd with the trusty apron and sometimes even less than that... Perhaps its the effect of the new outfit."
    "尽管你早已习惯穿着那条可靠的围裙、甚至有时穿得比那还少，替这群客人服务……可你现在还是觉得浑身发热。也许是这套新衣服的效果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_49c6b942:

    # "You quickly slinks over to the counter where Cane stands waiting. He observes you with a glint in his eyes."
    "你赶紧悄悄溜到凯恩等候的柜台前。他眼中闪着异样的光，打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_8798ac62:

    # c "Ahem... Nice new outfit. I don't know where yau get the idea, but I'll have to consider paying ya extra if ya keep coming up with ideas and drawing in my customers like this."
    c "咳……这身新衣服不错嘛。我不知道你是怎么想到的，不过要是你继续想出这种点子，把我的客人都吸引过来，我可得考虑给你加钱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_ec6b2001:

    # e "This is not my idea. Rahim made this outfit and he wanted to get your feedback on it."
    e "这不是我的主意。是雷希姆做的这套衣服，他想听听你的意见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_4e87df44:

    # c "Rahim made this? For the tavern?"
    c "雷希姆做的？给酒馆做的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_3502150c:

    # "You can see Cane's normal smile waver slightly."
    "你能看出凯恩惯常挂着的笑容微微一滞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_0cd853e9:

    # "You are about to explain the situation and defend Rahim when Cane continues."
    "你正要解释情况、替雷希姆辩护，凯恩却继续说了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_fa492f64:

    # c "Eh, now that yer here. Come and let me take a look."
    c "呃，既然你都来了，就过来让我好好看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_692c2aef:

    # c "It's not like I can chase yer sleazy little ass out."
    c "我又不是不能把你这副下流的小屁股赶出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_39f59339:

    # "You shuffles over to Cane. Cane suddenly pats your butt that is exposed through the chaps."
    "你迟疑着挪到凯恩身边。凯恩突然拍了拍你从皮套裤中露出的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_4d24d623:

    # "You yelp."
    "你惊叫了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_a226137d:

    # c "Heh, that bull has done a good job of capturing the shape of the buns. The cutting cups and highlights everything."
    c "嘿，那头公牛把这对臀瓣的形状做得真不错。剪裁得恰到好处，把该凸显的全都凸显出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_375234e0:

    # "Cane proceeds to pat down the insides of your thighs."
    "凯恩接着拍揉你的大腿内侧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_95143db0:

    # c "The fabric is tough and can stand a washing. A good quality when ya work around drunk patrons."
    c "这料子结实，耐得住搓洗。整天伺候醉醺醺的客人，这点可重要着哩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_78e408d3:

    # c "It also sticks close to yer muscles."
    c "而且还紧贴着你的肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_dea701bd:

    # "As Cane pulls his hands away, his fingers hooks the buttons that held your shorts inside the chaps togethers."
    "凯恩抽回双手时，手指勾住了把你的短裤固定在开裆裤里的纽扣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_e3fee1d1:

    # "You feel a jolt of electricity."
    "你感到一阵电流般的悸动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_b68593a9:

    # c "Maybe you should consider coming to work just in the chaps and without the shorts. I'm sure many customers will like that."
    c "或许你该考虑下回只穿这条开裆裤来上工，别穿短裤了。我敢保证，很多客人都会喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_38083b75:

    # "You blush just thinking about it. The cutouts on the chaps allow your digit to hang freely should you want to go commando."
    "你光是想想就红了脸。要是你真想不穿内裤，开裆裤上的开口能让那话儿自由垂在外头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_f969354f:

    # "Cane notices your discomfort and chuckles."
    "凯恩察觉到你的不自在，咯咯笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_5c32895f:

    # c "The bandana is a nice touch. It'll be handy to clean up spilled drink and other... liquids."
    c "胳膊上系条方巾很不错。清理洒出来的酒水，还有其他……液体时，正好派得上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_2a0a0ae6:

    # c "I'd say this outfit is a homerun. If ya still have any doubt, look around."
    c "我得说，这身衣服简直完美。你要是还有什么疑虑，就回头看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_0a2c8122:

    # "You did and saw the whole tavern looking at you hungrily."
    "你照做了，发现整间酒馆的人都在饥渴地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_24cbafd3:

    # "Part of you want to hide but another part of you want to surrender to that desire."
    "你一部分想躲起来，另一部分却想屈服于那股欲望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_67aa781d:

    # "You feel the front of your pants stretching. This is a problem because opening of the chaps mean that your boner can be seen clearly."
    "你感到裤子前襟被撑紧了。开裆裤的开口让你的勃起清晰可见，这可不妙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_25d3faf7:

    # "The shame and thrill of being discovered seem to excite you even more."
    "被人发现的羞耻与刺激，似乎反而让你更加兴奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_84a9047f:

    # "At that moment, you feel a pinch on your butt. The pain slightly silences the lust."
    "就在这时，你感到屁股被掐了一下。疼痛让满脑子的色欲稍稍消退了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_a22e8a18:

    # c "Alright lad, ya better get back to the bull. Believe me, that bull has a temper and he doesn't like to wait."
    c "好了，小崽子，你最好回那头牛身边去。相信我，那头牛脾气可大着呢，不喜欢等太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_b6e7ab11:

    # "Cane glances down at the front of your chaps."
    "凯恩低头瞥了眼你开裆裤的前面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_fc4aee89:

    # c "And it seems, neither do ya."
    c "看样子，你也等不及了哩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_1d3d4dd1:

    # "You quickly shuffles out of the tavern."
    "你匆匆挪出了酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_02_b9f8d13e:

    # "Before you exit, you believe you heard the barkeep say, Thank the bull for me."
    "出门前，你仿佛听到酒保说：“替我谢谢那头牛。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_813e17cd:

    # "Cane thumps his fingers on his cheek as he examines you."
    "凯恩一边打量着你，一边用手指轻敲自己的脸颊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_f58a580d:

    # c "Can't say I'm a fan of this one."
    c "不能说我喜欢这件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_a780084e:

    # c "The bull's design is either hit or miss. This one is a miss."
    c "那头牛的设计要么惊艳，要么败笔。这件就是败笔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_2c5d558b:

    # c "With how long the clothes is dragging, it'll keep hitting the floor."
    c "这身衣服拖得这么长，肯定会一直蹭到地板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_bb765b5b:

    # c "And you know how dirty our floors are."
    c "你也知道咱们这地板有多脏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_5eb1fa12:

    # "Cane winks at you when he says the word dirty."
    "他说到“脏”这个字时，凯恩朝你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_65c38e23:

    # "You think you have gathered enough feedback from Cane when you notice the barkeep staring at your crotch. You can't help but blush."
    "你觉得自己已经从凯恩那里收集到足够的反馈了，却注意到酒保正盯着你的裆部看。你不由得脸红起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_9f87a138:

    # c "No worries. This set does less for your figure than the other set."
    c "别担心，这套衣服没另一套那么显身材。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_11ad1cb8:

    # c "However, I am wondering. What is under all those layers?"
    c "不过，我倒是很好奇。那一层层衣服下面到底藏着什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_63617f03:

    # "You blush even harder."
    "你的脸颊红得更厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_c4665027:

    # "Cane chuckles."
    "凯恩轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_b766f14f:

    # c "Alright. Maybe my impression of this set has improved slightly."
    c "好吧。或许我对这套衣服的印象稍微好了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_0932bdaa:

    # c "Next time, consider coming without so many layers and we'll see how the patrons will react."
    c "下次可以考虑少穿几层，咱们看看客人们会有什么反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_03_5b6cb0de:

    # c "Out you go. I have to get on with business."
    c "出去吧，我得继续忙生意了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_5c7daca6:

    # c "Now, ya look a bit more like a real adventurer."
    c "现在，你看起来更像个真正的冒险家了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_82bdf8b3:

    # e "I am an adventurer."
    e "我就是冒险家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_e26845bd:

    # c "Never said you're not. Now you just look the part a bit more."
    c "我可没说你不是。只是现在看起来更像那么回事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_1d96165d:

    # e "So, you like it?"
    e "所以，你喜欢这身吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_c8421c97:

    # c "I suppose. Although I do wonder if this armor set makes you more adventurous in bed too."
    c "我觉得还行。不过我倒想知道，穿上这套护甲会不会也让你在床上更有冒险精神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_54ce99aa:

    # "Your cheeks color."
    "你的脸颊泛起了红晕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_6f32839c:

    # c "It's not bad. But it's not for me or for this place."
    c "这套还不算差，只是既不合我的口味，也不适合这个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_7720cabb:

    # c "Those armor plates are more likely to hurt and bruise my patrons."
    c "那些护甲片更可能会弄伤我的客人，给他们留下淤青。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Outfit_01_0cb5e7d9:

    # e "Hmm... Alright."
    e "嗯……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_8f110e74:

    # e "Ok. I'll take the job."
    e "好。我接下这份工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_22173d3a:

    # c "Good, same as last time. Take yer monkey suit out and start serving."
    c "很好，和上次一样。把你的猴子装拿出来，开始干活吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_6da3e789:

    # "You pick up the apron from the closet room again, it seems less dusty than the last time. You put on your uniform and walk out of the counter."
    "你又从储物间拿起围裙，那里似乎没上次那么多灰尘。你穿上制服，走出柜台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_afd7e145:

    # "Cane looks back at you and grins widely."
    "凯恩回头看着你，咧嘴笑得很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_d87780c1:

    # c "Ya liked stripping naked in front of everyone, eh?"
    c "你就喜欢当着所有人的面脱光，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_4d4cee6b:

    # e "Hey, Cane... I was just doing what your patrons asked."
    e "嘿，凯恩……我只是在做你的客人们要求的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Serve_Later_685c601b:

    # c "Ye ye. They're all perverts, didn't know yer one as well."
    c "对对对。他们全都是变态，没想到你也是其中一个。"

