translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_a77047e7:

    # l "A hero should always be ready, disciple."
    l "英雄就该随时准备好，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_b5c34624:

    # l "To learn that, you must be caught unawares. You are coming with me."
    l "要学会这一点，你就得在毫无防备时被抓个正着。跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_32ed943d:

    # "You groan. You really did not expect to get ferried off like this out of nowhere."
    "你发出一声呻吟。你实在没想到自己会这样被莫名其妙地带走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_f5d2978f:

    # "Lothar looks at you with that ever-present arrogant face of his."
    "洛萨尔用他那副一如既往的傲慢表情看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_efe016f1:

    # l "And a hero never complains. Get off your ass and come with me."
    l "英雄可从不抱怨。别再磨蹭了，跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_43296b10:

    # "Lothar begins walking off. You hurry after him."
    "洛萨尔开始走开，你赶紧跟了上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_7263f6ba:

    # "Probably a good thing he didn't give you time to talk, honestly, considering you were going to point out how often he complains."
    "老实说，他没给你说话的时间或许是件好事，毕竟你本来就打算指出他有多爱抱怨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_4f0ddf8e:

    # e "I have courier work to attend to today, sorry... but can we do it some other day?"
    e "我今天还有信使的工作要做，抱歉……我们能改天再去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_f7c3c616:

    # "Lothar narrows his eyes."
    "洛萨尔眯起了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_e4201c2a:

    # "It wasn't a lie... you're just stretching the truth is all."
    "这也不算撒谎……你只是把事实说得夸张了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_d07a963e:

    # l "Well, it cannot be helped if you are busy."
    l "忙着的话也没办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_15dc143f:

    # l "You will need to report back to me soon, however. A hero never shirks responsibility."
    l "不过，你得尽快回来向我汇报。英雄从不逃避责任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_05043cea:

    # e "Lothar, didn't you mention the monster the Lusterfolks have been complaining about?"
    e "洛萨尔，你之前不是提过那个让卢斯特菲尔德人一直抱怨的怪物吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_e6402c67:

    # l "Yes, now... you ready?" nointeract
    l "现在？准备好了吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_b849ced5:

    # e "Okay. Can you give me a moment to get ready?"
    e "好吧。给我一点时间准备，行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_a77047e7:

    # l "A hero should always be ready, disciple."
    l "英雄就该时刻准备就绪，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_b5c34624:

    # l "To learn that, you must be caught unawares. You are coming with me."
    l "想知道答案，就得趁你毫无防备时抓住你。跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_32ed943d:

    # "You groan. You really did not expect to get ferried off like this out of nowhere."
    "你呻吟了一声，实在没想到自己会这样莫名其妙地突然被带走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_f5d2978f:

    # "Lothar looks at you with that ever-present arrogant face of his."
    "洛萨尔用他那张一如既往的傲慢面孔看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_efe016f1:

    # l "And a hero never complains. Get off your ass and come with me."
    l "而英雄从不抱怨。赶紧给我起来，跟我走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_43296b10:

    # "Lothar begins walking off. You hurry after him."
    "洛萨尔转身走开，你赶紧跟了上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_7263f6ba:

    # "Probably a good thing he didn't give you time to talk, honestly, considering you were going to point out how often he complains."
    "说实话，他没给你开口的时间，恐怕反倒是件好事——毕竟你本来就要指出他抱怨得有多频繁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_4f0ddf8e:

    # e "I have courier work to attend to today, sorry... but can we do it some other day?"
    e "我今天还有送信的工作要做，抱歉……但我们能改天再去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_f7c3c616:

    # "Lothar narrows his eyes."
    "洛萨尔眯起眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_e4201c2a:

    # "It wasn't a lie... you're just stretching the truth is all."
    "那不算撒谎……你只是把事实说得夸张了些而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_d07a963e:

    # l "Well, it cannot be helped if you are busy."
    l "忙着的话也没办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Quest_Ready_15dc143f:

    # l "You will need to report back to me soon, however. A hero never shirks responsibility."
    l "不过，你得尽快回来向我汇报。英雄从不逃避责任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2d2a5591:

    # "You and Lothar have been walking through the forest for a while now, Lothar following some unknown set of directions, and you following him."
    "你和洛萨尔已经在森林里走了一阵子。洛萨尔循着某种你完全不清楚的路线前进，而你则跟在他身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_02b2254e:

    # e "So... Lothar."
    e "那个……洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f8e470c5:

    # "Lothar grunts in acknowledgement, but keeps walking."
    "洛萨尔哼了一声作为回应，但脚下并未停步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a4806ab1:

    # e "What kind of monster are we hunting exactly?"
    e "我们到底在追捕什么样的怪物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_242870d1:

    # l "A hero should be prepared for any kind of enemy!"
    l "英雄就该为面对任何敌人做好准备！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_07ea8214:

    # e "...Please? Can I know?"
    e "……求你了？我可以知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_56f825fb:

    # "Lothar sighs and shakes his head."
    "洛萨尔叹了口气，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8ea3cca1:

    # l "Fine, but you are lucky to have such a generous mentor."
    l "好吧，不过你很幸运，能有一位如此慷慨的导师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6978c82e:

    # l "We are hunting a plant monster that has been reported to be bothering the locals."
    l "我们正在猎杀一种据报一直在骚扰当地人的植物怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_1f5a8efa:

    # "He continues marching, as if that short note explained everything."
    "他继续迈步前行，仿佛那句简短的说明已经解释了一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2adf4679:

    # e "How is it bothering them? Is it hurting them or something?"
    e "它是怎么骚扰他们的？会伤害他们之类的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_15b07ca5:

    # "Lothar does not turn around, but you can feel his grin even without seeing it."
    "洛萨尔没有回头，但即使看不见，你也能感觉到他脸上的笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_77b9e8b0:

    # l "What, are you afraid of getting hurt, disciple? I thought I trained you better than that."
    l "怎么，害怕受伤吗，徒弟？我还以为我把你训练得更好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_7e993d26:

    # e "No, I just want to understand what's been happening to the townspeople."
    e "不，我只是想弄清楚镇民们究竟遭遇了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_90dc723c:

    # "Lothar dips his head in acknowledgement as he walks."
    "洛萨尔一边走，一边点头表示认可。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_045c3df5:

    # l "Fair enough. It is good for a hero to be concerned about his people."
    l "这倒也是。英雄关心自己的人民，总归是件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_d11f8021:

    # l "It has been attacking villagers, but not lethally."
    l "它一直在攻击村民，但并不会致命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_74cdeaff:

    # l "Most of the townspeople came back with rumpled clothes, and maybe a couple bruises."
    l "大多数镇民回来时衣服都皱巴巴的，身上可能还带着几处瘀伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_228a1512:

    # e "Then why is it so important to take down?"
    e "那为什么非得除掉它不可？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_20708bb2:

    # l "Well, a hero should never back down from a fight, mainly."
    l "嗯，主要是英雄绝不能在战斗面前退缩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_87f5ec85:

    # l "But it also seems to mess with their minds a bit. They report feeling a bit woozy and euphoric after meeting it."
    l "不过，它似乎还会对他们的精神造成些影响。他们说，见过它之后会有些头晕目眩，还会感到欣快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_fae004d5:

    # "That's... odd."
    "这……真奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2af5c694:

    # e "Do they behave any differently in that situation?"
    e "他们在那种情况下，行为会有什么不同吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2abef7bb:

    # l "I asked, and..."
    l "我问过了，可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_b361b165:

    # "Lothar pauses his speech for the first time so far."
    "洛萨尔迄今为止还是第一次停下话头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_24d67119:

    # l "They were all very dodgy about it. I assumed they were just in awe of being in front of the Hero of Lusterfield."
    l "他们对此都闪烁其词。我以为，他们只是在卢斯特菲尔德的英雄面前心生敬畏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_aa62cb2a:

    # "You have a feeling that is not why they wouldn't answer. Despite that, you can't figure out why they actually would."
    "你感觉那并不是他们不肯回答的原因。可即便如此，你还是想不出他们究竟为什么不肯回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_418e97af:

    # l "That's enough questioning, however. You must pay attention to how I move, so you can imitate it and become a fraction of the hero I am."
    l "不过，问题就问到这里吧。你必须注意我的动作，这样才能模仿我，成为像我这样的英雄，哪怕只有我一小部分的水平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_9198c8ac:

    # "After a long while of walking, and going past various different landmarks like the tree, Lothar puts his arm out in front of you."
    "走了很久，经过树木之类的各种地标后，洛萨尔把手臂伸到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_738d7e98:

    # l "We are approaching the monster."
    l "我们快接近那头怪物了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_fd4541ea:

    # "Lothar removes his sword from its sheath."
    "洛萨尔将剑从鞘中拔出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_c21e0e65:

    # "He turns to look at you."
    "他转过身来看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2cb403b0:

    # l "Why aren't you taking out your sword."
    l "你为什么还不拔剑？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_3d712a1b:

    # e "I didn't know I was supposed to yet?"
    e "我不知道现在就该拔啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f9a6e1f6:

    # "Lothar takes one hand off of his sword and slaps it to his face."
    "洛萨尔把一只手从剑上移开，拍在自己脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_08f45e2a:

    # l "Do as your mentor says and does, disciple. This is beginner stuff, it reflects badly on me for you to mess up like this."
    l "徒弟，照你师父说的去做，也照着做。这可是入门级的事，你犯这种错，丢的可是我的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_19e3a5a4:

    # e "I-"
    e "我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_07667461:

    # "You decide against saying anything, and instead unsheathe your blade."
    "你决定还是不说什么，转而拔出刀刃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_64d54103:

    # "Lothar sees this as enough, and turns to begin moving forward once more."
    "洛萨尔觉得这样就够了，转身再次开始向前走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2b57ef3c:

    # "Almost as if it were waiting for the perfect moment where both of your guards were down, you see a massive root lunge out of the earth at you."
    "你看到一根巨大的根茎从地面猛然向你袭来，仿佛一直在等待你们两人防备松懈的绝佳时机。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_c6f899ea:

    # "Right as it is about to land its blow, Lothar leaps forwards, blocking the strike with his sword."
    "就在它即将击中时，洛萨尔向前跃出，用剑挡下了这一击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_995623b0:

    # l "Sneak attacks are useless against a hero!"
    l "对英雄来说，偷袭根本没用！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_057a48f6:

    # "As he says this, a second root erupts from the earth behind him, moving to slam into Lothar's skull."
    "他说这话时，第二根根茎从他身后的地面破土而出，朝着洛萨尔的头颅狠狠砸去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_980663e0:

    # "Your body moves before your mind does, lunging forward and blocking it with your weapon."
    "你的身体先于思维行动，猛地冲上前，用武器将其挡下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_41145a97:

    # l "Well done disciple! Maybe not all hope is lost for you after all."
    l "干得好，徒弟！看来你也并非彻底无可救药。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8bd52898:

    # "Standing back to back with Lothar now, the plant releases all pretenses of stealth."
    "此刻，你正和洛萨尔背靠着背，那株植物也不再伪装潜行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2ecadfa7:

    # "Dozens of roots burst out of the ground."
    "数十根根茎从地面破土而出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8b1641cf:

    # "You and Lothar are a blur, blocking and nudging, redirecting the roots to anywhere but your bodies."
    "你和洛萨尔的身影快得模糊不清，一边格挡、一边拨挡，将根茎引向任何不会撞到你们身体的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_c28c51ed:

    # "You are making no progress however."
    "不过，你们毫无进展。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_e0c72082:

    # l "Let's see how long you can keep this up for!"
    l "让我们看看你还能撑多久！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_989f0338:

    # "You have no idea if he's talking to you or the plant, but Lothar is clearly having the time of his life."
    "你完全不知道他是在对你说，还是在对那株植物说，但洛萨尔显然正享受着人生中最痛快的时刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6187e03c:

    # "Every muscle, joint, and tendon of his body is ready - waiting for the next blow to come."
    "他身体的每一块肌肉、每一处关节和每一根肌腱都已做好准备——等待下一击到来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_be6e67dd:

    # l "This is how a hero fights, disciple!"
    l "英雄就是这样战斗的，徒弟！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_15efa9e5:

    # "He seems to have forgotten that you are doing only slightly less than half of the work here."
    "他似乎忘了，你做的也只比他少那么一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_66ed90a0:

    # "You have no idea how long this continues for, your every thought dominated by the plant and Lothar."
    "你完全不知道这一切持续了多久，所有思绪都被那株植物和洛萨尔占据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_dae5b8e1:

    # "Eventually however, there is movement in the canopy above you."
    "不过，最终你头顶的树冠中传来了动静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f9da75f5:

    # "A bright orange pod emerges from above you and Lothar."
    "一个鲜橙色的荚果从你和洛萨尔上方探了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6f84ebe6:

    # "Extending from its sides are thousands of tendrils, all of which snake down into the ground to become roots."
    "数千条卷须从它的侧面伸出，蜿蜒着扎入地面，化作根须。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_94962c0e:

    # l "There you are, you bastard!"
    l "你这混账，终于找到你了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f64cb945:

    # "Despite the colorful language, Lothar is the happiest you've ever heard him, his voice an overjoyed roar."
    "尽管话说得粗鲁，洛萨尔此刻却是你听过他最开心的时候，声音中满是狂喜的咆哮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_b7c74386:

    # "Lothar turns to look at you, somehow still managing to block all of the roots coming his way."
    "洛萨尔转头看向你，不知怎的，仍在挡下所有朝他袭来的根须。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_b9a0d61a:

    # l "Go get it disciple! I can handle all of the roots down here on my own!" nointeract
    l "去把它拿下来，弟子！下面这些根须我一个人就能应付！" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_3012fb92:

    # e "Okay! I will do my best!"
    e "好！我会尽力的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_bbc0165d:

    # "With that, you slide under the attacking roots, kicking off the ground when your momentum begins to lag."
    "说完，你从袭来的根须下方滑过，速度开始减慢时便蹬地加速。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f9aff859:

    # "A couple roots attempt to follow you, but Lothar blurs forwards to block them off."
    "几条根须试图追上你，但洛萨尔化作一道模糊的身影向前冲去，将它们拦了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_317b7e23:

    # "You reach one of the trees underneath the pod, and begin to climb."
    "你来到荚果下方的一棵树旁，开始向上攀爬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_06c93030:

    # "On your way up, you look down at Lothar."
    "攀爬途中，你低头望向洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_dcdd9963:

    # "He is a whirlwind of silver. If you don't look closely, it looks like there are 4 of him at every moment, each one blocking and shoving one of dozens of roots."
    "他宛如一阵银色的旋风。若不仔细看，几乎会以为他每时每刻都有四个分身，每一个都在挡开、推开数十条根须中的一条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_e9f8545b:

    # "As you continue your climb, you get a better look at the pod above you."
    "你继续向上攀爬，对头顶的荚果看得更加清楚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_37e90ff2:

    # "Bright orange, the pod has a spherical shape. The light it emits renders it transparent."
    "荚果呈鲜橙色，形状浑圆。它散发的光芒让它变得近乎透明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_09b72e58:

    # "Inside, it is pulsing with millions of tiny dots, each one floating around like dandelion seeds in a hurricane."
    "荚果内部有数百万个微小的光点在搏动，每一个都像飓风中的蒲公英种子般四处飘浮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_4cb67b90:

    # "This is clearly vital to the plant. You are certain that attacking the pod will kill it."
    "这显然是这株植物的要害。你确信，只要攻击荚果，就能杀死它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_47d9cef4:

    # "Removing one arm from the trunk of the tree, you once more grab your sword."
    "你从树干上收回一只手臂，再次握住剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_12d7c397:

    # "The pod is within reach."
    "荚果已经近在咫尺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_0720d238:

    # "You plunge your blade into the center of the pod."
    "你将剑刃刺入荚果的中心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_88bfbc18:

    # e "No! You can't do this on your own!"
    e "不！你不能一个人这么做！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_69d70026:

    # e "Please let me stay and help."
    e "请让我留下来帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_e34bc671:

    # "Lothar growls in displeasure."
    "洛萨尔不悦地低声咆哮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_69188e52:

    # l "You think I can't handle this?!"
    l "你觉得我应付不了这个吗？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6ab9b17a:

    # l "I've been holding back so that you can get experience too, disciple."
    l "弟子，为了让你也能获得经验，我一直都在留手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_cd004b14:

    # "Lothar's body language shifts radically, from one reveling in violence, to one poised to kill."
    "洛萨尔的肢体语言骤然改变，从沉浸于暴力的状态变成了蓄势待杀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_490d8d23:

    # "Abandoning all pretense of staying on the defensive, he shifts his blade such that the fuller is no longer at front - instead, the sharp edge is poised to cut and shear."
    "他不再假装只守不攻，调整刀身，使刀槽不再朝向前方——取而代之的是锋刃，蓄势着要将目标割开、斩断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ea5de5eb:

    # "As you continue to block roots, Lothar's body accelerates to the point where it is difficult to track with your eyes."
    "当你继续挡住根须时，洛萨尔的身形加速到肉眼难以捕捉的程度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8b69df49:

    # "Silver flashes through roots, cutting through rough wood as if it were paper."
    "银光穿过根须，将粗糙的木头砍得如同纸张一般。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ab365619:

    # "More and more roots fall lifeless to the ground, until a small wall of roots lay in front of Lothar."
    "越来越多的根须无力地倒在地上，直到洛萨尔面前堆起了一堵小小的根须墙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_b148b204:

    # "After he is satisfied that no more roots can attack from that side, he grabs you by the shoulder, and shoves you behind him."
    "确认那一侧不再有根须能够发动攻击后，他一把抓住你的肩膀，将你推到身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_20922fba:

    # l "If you aren't going to help or learn, you might as well stay where you won't be in the way."
    l "你既不打算帮忙，也不打算学习，那就老实待在不会碍事的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_c2723769:

    # "Once more exploding into motion, Lothar begins to exterminate the roots on your side of the field."
    "洛萨尔再次爆发出惊人的速度，开始清除你这边的根须。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ad947881:

    # "After only a few brief minutes, no more roots are left to attack you or Lothar."
    "短短几分钟后，已经没有根须能再攻击你或洛萨尔了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_dae4b2d3:

    # "Above you, the pod is trembling. It cannot move anymore, its body connected to the ground and trees through vines that now chain it to its grave."
    "你上方的荚果正在颤抖。它已经无法动弹，藤蔓将它的身体与地面和树木相连，如今更是把它锁在了自己的坟墓上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_18c28849:

    # l "I've had enough of you. The sooner you die, the sooner I can go back to town and drink."
    l "我已经受够你了。你越早死，我就能越早回镇上喝酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_34b0f927:

    # "As he says this, Lothar jumps for one of the nearby trees."
    "说着，洛萨尔跃向附近的一棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_1ac24e2b:

    # "His feet land on the trunk - his knees tense, his legs rippling with muscle underneath his grey fur."
    "他的双脚落在树干上——膝盖绷紧，灰色皮毛下的双腿肌肉起伏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_bd0b7c35:

    # "With an incredible leap, Lothar reaches the plant, cutting an enormous swath of vines from it, before landing on another tree, and repeating the action."
    "洛萨尔纵身一跃，抵达那株植物，从中斩下大片藤蔓，随后落到另一棵树上，重复着刚才的动作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ab19e372:

    # "With each jump, The pod sags lower and lower, until eventually, it rests against the earth, robbed of all connections."
    "每跳一次，荚果就向下耷拉几分，最终失去所有连接，伏在了地面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_c2e17264:

    # l "We're done here."
    l "我们该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_22ffce8d:

    # "He marches off without another word."
    "他一言不发地迈步离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_843c794a:

    # e "What about the plant? Are you not going to kill it?"
    e "那植物呢？你不打算杀了它吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_10c61b59:

    # "Lothar turns on you."
    "洛萨尔转身面对你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6febc7ae:

    # l "What right do you have to ask that, when you refused to do so earlier?"
    l "你之前拒绝动手，现在又有什么资格问这个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_24bf94d1:

    # l "You are my disciple, you are supposed to follow my directions and learn from me."
    l "你是我的弟子，本该听从我的指示，向我学习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a5bd30a1:

    # l "I will continue to teach you, but what kind of fool doesn't listen to their mentor."
    l "我会继续教你，但不听从导师教诲的，究竟是怎样的蠢货？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_22f6ba78:

    # "Lothar shakes his head, spitting on the floor."
    "洛萨尔摇了摇头，朝地板吐了口唾沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_9a975c20:

    # l "If you paid attention, you would realize that plants survive based on their connections to the environment around them."
    l "你要是认真留意，就该明白，植物能否存活取决于它们与周围环境之间的联系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_b4c25f50:

    # l "Without roots or vines, the monster will die of starvation. That is one of the most efficient ways to kill a plant monster."
    l "没有根须或藤蔓，这头怪物会因饥饿而死。这是杀死植物怪物最高效的方法之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8642a8d7:

    # "Lothar once more turns away, and stalks off towards town."
    "洛萨尔再次转过身，大步朝城镇走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_9d581f4a:

    # "Before long, you arrive at Lusterfield."
    "没过多久，你来到了卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a638d341:

    # l "I am disappointed in how you did today, disciple."
    l "徒弟，今天你的表现让我很失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_6708aa0c:

    # "Okay, enough is enough."
    "好了，够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_2a5e508d:

    # e "What am I supposed to do, listen to you blindly if you tell me to do anything?"
    e "那我该怎么办？难道你让我做什么，我就得盲目听从吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ab39a1e5:

    # e "If you're holding back to let me do things, maybe TELL me that, so that I can actually have a good understanding of the battle."
    e "如果你是为了让我动手才故意留手，那就直说啊，好让我真正理解这场战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_99b1f03f:

    # e "Rather than just being led along."
    e "而不是一直被你牵着鼻子走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_171bbda8:

    # "Lothar looks furious."
    "洛萨尔看起来怒不可遏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_d089ee7d:

    # l "Maybe I wouldn't have to coddle you like that if you were as strong as me."
    l "要是你和我一样强，也许我就不用那样迁就你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a5f697d7:

    # l "But you aren't."
    l "可你不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_751616bc:

    # l "So maybe, instead of talking back to a hero, you should listen to him."
    l "所以，与其对英雄顶嘴，你还不如听他的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_eafe3b13:

    # e "You say that like the spar wasn't closer than you'd like to admit."
    e "你这话说得，好像刚才那场切磋并没有接近到你不愿承认的程度似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_bc6b51df:

    # l "I was going easy on you back then too."
    l "我当时也对你手下留情了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_8b4be97f:

    # e "I don't believe that for a second."
    e "我一个字都不信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_d5e39db5:

    # l "You want to go again right now?!"
    l "你现在就想再来一场？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_46917fee:

    # e "You know what, maybe I do!"
    e "你这么一说，没准我还真想！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_3d3d356b:

    # "Right as you both begin to reach for your swords, Rahim steps out of his shop, bellowing at the top of his lungs.."
    "就在你们两个都开始伸手去拔剑时，雷希姆从他的店里冲了出来，用尽全力吼道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_bf7e2985:

    # r "I swear to god, if you two don't shut up and let me work in peace, I'm going to go over there and beat both of you."
    r "我对天发誓，你们两个要是还不闭嘴、还不让我安静干活，我就过去把你们俩都揍一顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_a96ba498:

    # "You and Lothar are frozen by this sudden display of anger from Rahim."
    "你和洛萨尔被雷希姆这突如其来的怒火震得僵住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_454334fa:

    # "After a while of staring at both of you, Rahim goes back inside, slamming the door behind him."
    "盯着你们两个看了一会儿后，雷希姆回到店里，砰地把门摔在身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ccfe4af5:

    # "You and Lothar turn to face each other once more."
    "你和洛萨尔再次转身面对彼此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_7fa51e82:

    # l "...fine."
    l "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_f5007ed7:

    # l "Make sure you get strong enough to actually make your own decisions like that in the future."
    l "以后你可得变得足够强，真正能像刚才那样自己做决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_66933a49:

    # "...This argument isn't going to end if you don't let it."
    "如果你不肯罢休，这场争论就没完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_ce3aa529:

    # e "...okay."
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aphrodisiac_Adventure_7864d655:

    # "With that, Lothar leaves you alone, returning to his usual spot, a dark look creasing his features."
    "说完，洛萨尔便不再理你，回到平时待的地方，眉眼间满是阴沉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_b77af144:

    # e "Thank... you? Lothar..."
    e "谢谢……你？洛萨尔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_e41ca7d8:

    # l "Yes, you are correct, for the first time. Anyways, I should introduce myself, if you have forgotten."
    l "没错，这回你说对了，还是头一回。总之，如果你忘了，我还是该自我介绍一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_2dd919a5:

    # l "I am Lothar, the hero of Lusterfield."
    l "我是洛萨尔，卢斯特菲尔德村的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_205b48f8:

    # e "I thought you told me about it already? The whole hero thing."
    e "我还以为你之前已经告诉过我了？就是当英雄那回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_a7c2628b:

    # l "What? I was being genuinely considerate about your memory, I saw it on the courier news that brain worms can eat your memory away."
    l "什么？我可是认真替你的记性着想。我在信使新闻上看到，脑虫会把人的记忆吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_06ab5f35:

    # e "I'm not sure that is a real-"
    e "我不确定那是真的——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_1347ecfa:

    # "Lothar cut you off before you can finish your sentence, he is visibly irritated, refusing to elaborate further."
    "你还没说完，洛萨尔就打断了你。他明显很不耐烦，也不肯再多解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_b753a2cd:

    # l "You want your training or not."
    l "你到底还想不想训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Smile_74db1a7f:

    # e "Yes..."
    e "想……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_ec000328:

    # l "Ok?"
    l "行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_f0a5fabc:

    # l "Did your elder teach you manners, especially talking to a hero in front of you?"
    l "你的长辈没教过你礼貌吗？尤其是当着英雄的面说话时？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_16dc5433:

    # e "I didn't know who you are, I'm sorry."
    e "我不知道你是谁，对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_c7c93ab3:

    # l "You little piece of shit. I know Ole talked to you about me. I made sure he does every time."
    l "你这个小混账。我知道奥利跟你提过我。我每次都确保他会这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_75c0a179:

    # "The wolf apparently was not pleased with your demeanor. He advances towards you, making you pace backward, almost to the point of hitting the door behind you."
    "显然，这只灰狼很不满意你的态度。他朝你逼近，逼得你一步步后退，差点撞上身后的门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_dd9d260f:

    # l "You know what? If it isn't for that green lizard I would never even approach you in first place."
    l "你知道吗？要不是那只绿蜥蜴，我根本不会主动接近你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_03fe7a51:

    # "You can smell the wolf's bitter scent from such a close distance, it doesn't smell like he had bathed for a while. His bulging chests are almost touching you."
    "在这么近的距离下，你能闻到那只狼身上苦涩的气味，闻起来像是已经有段时间没洗澡了。他鼓胀的胸膛几乎贴到你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_c31953fe:

    # l "And now you are treating me with such inappropriate manners? And you don't feel ashamed of yourself? Are you really sure?"
    l "现在你还用这么无礼的态度对我？你就不觉得羞愧吗？你确定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_f3826aab:

    # "Lothar is adamant in his way of teaching you manners, he growls forcefully at you, while you flinches, trying to turn your face away. You can feel his barking rattling the doors."
    "洛萨尔坚持用自己的方式教你礼貌。他冲你用力低吼，你瑟缩着想把脸转开；他的吼声震得门板都在颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_bce3e15b:

    # e "Look... I'm sorry."
    e "听着……对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_7717b576:

    # l "Are you?"
    l "你是真心的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Who_Angry_93c2a728:

    # l "Hmmmph."
    l "哼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_2a743721:

    # e "Uhhhh... Are you Rahim?"
    e "呃……你是雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_76bcb450:

    # my "You-???"
    my "你——？？？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_d254360d:

    # "The wolf is getting visably irritated, almost threatening you in some way, until he calm down after a few seconds and let out a long sigh."
    "灰狼越发恼怒，几乎带着威胁之意，几秒后才平静下来，长长叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_3cfbfa55:

    # my "How the hell could you have mixed up with me and that Old Bull, Does he even look like a hero of Lusterfield?"
    my "你他妈怎么会把我和那头老牛搞混？他看起来像卢斯特菲尔德的英雄吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_75862f28:

    # my "Alright then, now tell me, what's your name."
    my "好了，现在告诉我，你叫什么名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_d454165b:

    # e "My name is [e]."
    e "我叫[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_b951246f:

    # my "Good. Good. The lizard told me about you. I'll just call you the goat now. Considering that you don't even know what a hero looks like."
    my "很好，很好。那只蜥蜴跟我说过你。我现在就叫你山羊吧，毕竟你连英雄长什么样都不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_75c0a179:

    # "The wolf apparently was not pleased with your demeanor. He advances towards you, making you pace backward, almost to the point of hitting the door behind you."
    "灰狼显然对你的态度很不满意。他朝你逼近，逼得你一步步后退，几乎要撞上身后的门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_fb1313e9:

    # "You can smell the wolf's bitter scent from such a close distance, it doesn't even smell like he had bathed for a while. His bulging chests are almost touching yours."
    "距离这么近，你能闻到灰狼身上刺鼻的气味，简直像是有一阵子没洗过澡。他隆起的胸膛几乎贴上了你的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_47e9bfe1:

    # my "You know me now?"
    my "现在认识我了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_20fd191c:

    # e "What's your name?"
    e "你叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_8c5cf0e2:

    # l "Lothar. It's Lothar. Put my name into your horny brain, now. Don't you ever forget about it."
    l "洛萨尔。就是洛萨尔。现在把我的名字刻进你那发情的山羊脑袋里。可别忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_e9489b13:

    # e "Y-yes... nice to meet you. Lothar..."
    e "是、是的……很高兴认识你，洛萨尔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_93e5a0ee:

    # l "Tell me again. What's my name?"
    l "再说一遍。我叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_91ef65b9:

    # e "l-lothar."
    e "洛、洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_480232fa:

    # l "Good, good. I'm the hero of the village. Don't you ever, ever try to play me like that, you understand?"
    l "很好，很好。我可是村里的英雄。你再也、再也别想那样耍我，明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Wrong_ad107a04:

    # e "Ok?"
    e "好、好的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_4c53de91:

    # "Lothar now satisfied with your performance, backs off slowly and gives you room to breath properly. He crosses his arms more tightly now, almost squishing his chest further."
    "洛萨尔对你的表现很满意，慢慢退开，给你留出喘息的空间。他把双臂交叉得更紧，胸口也几乎被挤得更紧了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_7076335e:

    # l "Alright. You've learnt your lesson. I've shown you."
    l "好了，你已经吸取教训了。我已经给你演示过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_3e355fc1:

    # l "Did the lizard mentioned the word \"training\" to you by any chance, [e]?"
    l "那只蜥蜴有没有跟你提过“训练”这个词，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_b23140ea:

    # e "I think so. He told me to get the training from you before I go out for an adventure."
    e "我想应该提过。他告诉我，出门冒险前，要先来接受你的训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_f02175aa:

    # l "A new adventurer I see. Maybe sometimes I can get you to carry the bags for me outside. Maybe even wash my back on the river down there."
    l "哦，原来是个新冒险家啊。以后说不定我会让你在外面替我拎包。甚至还可以在下面那条河边替我搓背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_63dabf15:

    # e "What? N-no... I can't-"
    e "什么？不、不行……我不能——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_4b02d0ab:

    # l "Ha. You little thing. You think I'll let you touch me even slightly? Don't be so silly."
    l "哈，你这小东西。你真以为我会让你哪怕稍微碰我一下？别傻了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_711287ca:

    # l "Now. I haven't prepared my weapons for you to try out yet. So, come find me later. I'll meet you here when I'm ready. You understand?"
    l "现在，我还没准备好让你试用的武器。过一会儿再来找我吧。等我准备好了，我会在这里见你。明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_54d5cea3:

    # e "Yes... Lothar."
    e "明白……洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_93405601:

    # l "Where are you meeting me?"
    l "你要在哪里和我碰面？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_9ec79cb8:

    # e "H-here?"
    e "这、这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_End_5ae63efe:

    # l "You're goddamn right. Ok. Good. Now that lizard owes me a huge favour to take care of his little outsider friend."
    l "你说得没错。好，很好。现在，为了照顾他这个小外乡朋友，那只蜥蜴可欠我一份天大的人情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_9140b7d0:

    # e "His name is Ole..."
    e "他叫奥利……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_0e9e382e:

    # l "What did you say? You think I don't know his name? You've met him only just yesterday, and I've been with him before he's even born-"
    l "你说什么？你以为我不知道他的名字？你昨天才刚认识他，而我早在他出生前就认识他了——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_ff547ef7:

    # "The door behind you moves, Lothar still angrily staring at you when you see Ole comes out of the store in the corner of your vision. He gave Lothar a side eye before walking towards you."
    "你身后的门动了一下。你从余光中看见奥利从店里走出来，而洛萨尔仍在气冲冲地瞪着你。他斜眼看了洛萨尔一眼，便朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_9c2edee2:

    # o "What's going on, [e]?"
    o "[e]，怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_d2bcc849:

    # l "Nothing, I was talking to him about the training I promised you."
    l "没什么，我在跟他聊我答应教你的训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_4605285b:

    # o "Doesn't sound like talking."
    o "听起来可不像是在聊天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_7d78aa14:

    # l "Alright then, I'll tone down my voices for the newcomer. I'm just trying to teach him something important."
    l "好吧，那我会对这位新来者放低音量。我只是想教他一些重要的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_12da8c53:

    # o "Then teach silently."
    o "那就安静地教。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_fb71ad95:

    # l "Ok."
    l "行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_f9115139:

    # "Ole stares at Lothar for a few seconds while the wolf tries to avoid his gaze, looking away like a defeated puppy. The lizard then turns to you calmly."
    "奥利盯着洛萨尔看了几秒，狼则像一只战败的小狗般躲避他的目光，别过脸去。随后，蜥蜴才平静地转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_51e5c690:

    # o "[e], you alright? If he ever harasses you again, I'll teach him a lesson myself."
    o "[e]，你没事吧？如果他再骚扰你，我会亲自教训他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_58206fc8:

    # "With that, the lizard walks back towards the door and closes it, you could see Sebas peeking out from the door in a glimpse of a second."
    "说完，蜥蜴走回门边并关上了门。就在那一瞬间，你看见塞巴斯从门后探头看了一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_f84f12a1:

    # l "Ahem..."
    l "咳咳……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_75273d36:

    # "The wolf clears his throat, obviously bothered by the presence of Ole. He unnaturally places his arms apart, scratching his head for a few times before stretching."
    "狼清了清嗓子，显然对奥利的出现颇为不自在。他不自然地张开双臂，挠了几下头，然后伸了个懒腰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_720fec84:

    # l "So, See you then... [e]."
    l "那么，回头见……[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_9c9b3c64:

    # e "See you Lothar."
    e "回头见，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_First_Ending_ed3b0d65:

    # "Lothar frowns upon you as he walks away towards the stairs on the other side of the road. You sigh heavily, finally getting out of the sticky situation."
    "洛萨尔皱眉看了你一眼，朝马路另一边的楼梯走去。你重重叹了口气，终于摆脱了这尴尬的局面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_52132ed0:

    # l "Hey! Are you trying to hide from me, disciple?"
    l "喂！你想躲着我吗，徒弟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_e6ae2b07:

    # e "N-no! I was looking for you."
    e "不、不是！我正要找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_9268d720:

    # l "{b}Meet, me, in, the, tavern, at, night.{/b} And don't tell me you don't drink. I don't care."
    l "{b}晚上来酒馆见我。{/b}别跟我说你不喝酒。我不在乎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_db165e53:

    # e "Uh, alright."
    e "呃，好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_62feb791:

    # l "Hey, I see you here, disciple."
    l "嘿，我看到你在这儿，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_0c8df589:

    # e "Uh... Lothar?"
    e "呃……洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_6fd97e81:

    # l "Meet me in the tavern at night if you want to learn from the best."
    l "如果你想向最优秀的人学习，晚上就到酒馆来见我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_55fa2d86:

    # l "Don't you make me wait further."
    l "别让我继续等下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_08fa49ce:

    # e "Heyyyy, Lothar."
    e "嘿——洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_285abeaf:

    # "You can't help but look down, twiddling your fingers as you think about how to talk to Lothar after what happened."
    "你不由自主地低下头，一边捻着手指，一边想着发生那件事后该如何与洛萨尔交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_863a76eb:

    # l "Hello, disciple."
    l "你好，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_71ef02db:

    # l "I look forward to carrying on like normal."
    l "我很期待我们像往常一样相处下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3c77910e:

    # e "But-..."
    e "但是——……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_9a6e141d:

    # l "Nothing happened, and we will not talk about it."
    l "什么都没发生，我们也不会谈这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_d49d0510:

    # "Lothar sighs, looking to the side and blushing slightly."
    "洛萨尔叹了口气，望向一旁，脸上微微泛红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_95c7a6f5:

    # l "You did a good job in the fight."
    l "你在战斗中的表现不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_eb55f14e:

    # e "O-okay..."
    e "好、好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_c4409b36:

    # l "Thank you, disciple."
    l "谢谢你，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_87eee822:

    # "Lothar is smiling at you. It seems that despite... what has happened between you, he still likes you quite a bit."
    "洛萨尔正对你微笑。看来，尽管……你们之间发生了那件事，他还是相当喜欢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_c4935225:

    # l "Now, get back to training. You've been making good progress, but you're not a hero yet!"
    l "现在，回去训练。你最近进步很大，但还算不上英雄！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_fba13052:

    # l "Greetings, disciple."
    l "晚上好，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_c6e1671a:

    # e "Hello, Lothar."
    e "你好，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_5a83a250:

    # e "How're you doing, Lothar?"
    e "最近过得怎么样，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_5baff97c:

    # l "Bad. Especially when I see the lion here."
    l "糟透了。尤其是看到那头狮子也在这里的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_fba13052_1:

    # l "Greetings, disciple."
    l "晚上好，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_c6e1671a_1:

    # e "Hello, Lothar."
    e "嗨，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_5a83a250_1:

    # e "How're you doing, Lothar?"
    e "最近怎么样，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_0999aa74:

    # l "Have you seen the lizard here before, I think he's spying on me."
    l "你以前在这里见过那只蜥蜴吗？我觉得他在监视我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3388a208_1:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_568bb928:

    # l "Hey, [e]. I heard you're serving people naked. When are you serving me this way?"
    l "嘿，[e]。我听说你会光着身子给人端酒。什么时候也这样伺候我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_02671382:

    # e "Uhhhmmm? Lothar?"
    e "呃呃呃？洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_4ed20f6b:

    # l "You know, being a hero is really tiring, I might need a personal server."
    l "你知道吗，当英雄真的很累，我可能需要一个私人侍者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_b82f8229:

    # e "O-oh, If you would like?"
    e "噢——哦，如果你想的话？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_315ee5af:

    # l "Yeah, no. I'm not one of those horny patrons Cane serves in his tavern."
    l "不，不是。我可不是凯恩在酒馆里招待的那些色鬼客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_02e60a94:

    # l "You know what I did today, disciple? I killed 10 slimes, in a day. Protecting Lusterfield from the dangerous slime threats."
    l "你知道我今天干了什么吗，徒弟？我一天之内杀了十只史莱姆，保护卢斯特菲尔德免受危险史莱姆的威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_7da21fc9:

    # e "Uh, that's... very impressive."
    e "呃，那……真是厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_df09abf0:

    # l "What are you trying to say? I bet you can't even beat a dummy."
    l "你到底想说什么？我敢打赌你连训练人偶都打不过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_e93f1902:

    # e "I did! I beat it the first days we met."
    e "我打过！我们刚认识的头几天我就打败过它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_6862acc4:

    # l "Don't talk about what happened with the flower."
    l "别提那朵花的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_46a87d94:

    # e "I- Lot, do you want to talk about it?"
    e "我——洛萨尔，你想谈谈这件事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_9ca93b6f:

    # l "NO! Stop asking me about the flowers. You're making me uncomfortable."
    l "不！别再问我那些花的事了。你让我很不舒服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_fdac3ef9:

    # e "O-ok."
    e "好、好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_8d3a4903:

    # l "I feel like Lusterfolks respected me now more than when I killed that goat."
    l "我觉得，现在卢斯特菲尔德人比起我杀掉那只山羊的时候，更尊重我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_4919c77d:

    # e "Well, maybe because you were actually saving them from that flower?"
    e "嗯，也许是因为你当时确实是在保护他们，不让他们被那朵花伤害？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_35969d2c:

    # l "What do you mean, everyone knows I am the saving grace of Lusterfield because I killed him, not some random flowers."
    l "你什么意思？大家都知道，我杀了他才是拯救卢斯特菲尔德的功臣，可不是什么随便的花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_7df88c6d:

    # l "Speaking of, I still remember what you did there."
    l "说到这个，我还记得你在那里做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_e6cedf20:

    # e "Uh, I just wanted to save you there, but alright."
    e "呃，我当时只是想救你，不过算了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_c2e950a4:

    # l "I actually saved Amble and Jog, long ago from the bandits."
    l "我很久以前就从山贼手里救过安布和乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_1f4e4ef7:

    # e "Hello Lothar, what are you talking about?"
    e "嗨，洛萨尔，你在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_7170b630:

    # l "I feel I have to make them remember that once in a while, else they forget."
    l "我觉得自己得偶尔让他们想起这件事，不然他们会忘掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_ccb64e2a:

    # l "Anything new with the werewolves in the dark forest?"
    l "黑暗森林里的狼人有什么新消息吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3a899e05:

    # e "Uh, actually, aren't you a wolf, Lothar?"
    e "呃，说真的，你不是狼人吗，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_ceaad1fd:

    # l "I'm not a werewolf, that's a whole different species. They are vicious and hunts anyone they see like cavemen."
    l "我不是狼人，那可是完全不同的物种。他们凶残得很，像穴居人一样，见人就猎杀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_b4f610ef:

    # e "Well, technically, you're correct. I think the-"
    e "严格来说，你说得对。我觉得——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_eac736ce:

    # l "Still, werewolf or not, they're mere smokescreens. All teeth, not brain."
    l "不过，不管是不是狼人，他们都不过是障眼法而已。只有牙齿，没有脑子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_e24e7daa:

    # l "The only thing I care is the goats, get it, disciple? One day we'll unveil the evil plans those goats are brewing up."
    l "我唯一在意的就是那些山羊，明白吗，徒弟？总有一天，我们会揭露那些山羊正在酝酿的邪恶计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_dedec69e:

    # l "That's what heroes do."
    l "英雄就是干这个的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_e158ab8e:

    # l "Hmmph, [e]. Why are you naked..."
    l "哼，[e]。你怎么没穿衣服……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_8ab05b3d:

    # e "Sorry, Lothar."
    e "抱歉，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_53288926:

    # l "Whatever."
    l "随你便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_a8917b76:

    # l "A-ahhhh, [e]. Rarely do I see you in the tavern."
    l "啊——[e]。我很少在酒馆见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_ea033421:

    # e "Hello... Lothar?"
    e "你好……洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_6df2c243:

    # l "Greetings. [e]."
    l "向你问好。[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3e8b7ecc:

    # e "Hello Lothar."
    e "你好，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_2fd6aab4:

    # l "Hello, my disciple."
    l "你好，我的徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_3e8b7ecc_1:

    # e "Hello Lothar."
    e "你好，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Normal_Talk_ff55d21c:

    # l "What brings you to the hero today?" nointeract
    l "今天怎么想到来找本大英雄了？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Normal_Talk_58e0fbb5:

    # "As you are about to ask, you realise you are not putting on the right clothes to judge..."
    "你正要开口询问，却意识到自己还没穿上适合审判的衣服……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_23c51416:

    # e "Hey, Lothar, what's wrong with the... stone. again?"
    e "嘿，洛萨尔，那块……石头又怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_583f0a40:

    # l "Disciple, remember the wagon attack info you've gotten with Jog?"
    l "徒弟，还记得你和乔格一起得到的马车袭击情报吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_61a065a5:

    # e "Yea."
    e "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_348731fe:

    # l "I went back to the site around the tree to do some digging."
    l "我回到那棵树附近的现场挖了挖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d8dcb708:

    # "Lothar takes out the stone to show you."
    "洛萨尔取出那块石头给你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "这是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9780a9f4:

    # l "Hard to say. But based on this hero's experience, it is imbued with magic."
    l "很难说。不过，以本大英雄的经验来看，它蕴含着魔力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e29a2eb3:

    # e "Magic?"
    e "魔法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8e970f4f:

    # l "Yes. And the only magic user around here is that deer."
    l "是。而且这附近唯一会用魔法的就是那头鹿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_67d0d2a9:

    # "Lothar bristles with anger."
    "洛萨尔怒气冲冲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_72b9d88e:

    # l "I'll tell you, they set this all up just for an excuse to attack us."
    l "我告诉你，他们把这一切都安排好，就是为了找个借口攻击我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9afa0df6:

    # "There is a rage in his eyes that you have not seen before."
    "他的眼中燃烧着你从未见过的怒火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d6465e99:

    # "You can finally understand why he's the Hero of Lusterfield. Lothar can be quite frightening."
    "你终于明白他为什么会被称为卢斯特菲尔德的英雄了。洛萨尔有时确实令人害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_429b20c4:

    # e "Lothar, what are you going to do?"
    e "洛萨尔，你打算做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_690de678:

    # "You are worried about Lothar's condition. He has a tendency to do rash things."
    "你担心洛萨尔的状况。他总是容易做出鲁莽的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e0632913:

    # l "This is a sign of their guilt. I'm going to kill them all!"
    l "这就是他们有罪的证明。我要把他们全杀了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_92d86514:

    # e "Maybe we should look at this closer."
    e "或许我们应该仔细看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_a9644f5d:

    # l "What's there to look? The evidence is clear as day." nointeract
    l "有什么好看的？证据明摆着。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4cc0359c:

    # e "Lothar, do you think the stone... has a different colour?"
    e "洛萨尔，你觉得这块石头……颜色是不是不一样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e52382d5:

    # l "W-what."
    l "什、什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_3d1272ea:

    # e "Colour. I think it's different than the hue the goat tribe usually have."
    e "颜色。我觉得它和山羊部落通常拥有的色泽不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ccecaadc:

    # l "N-no... even if the colour is d-different..."
    l "不、不管颜色是不、不一样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_428e74b5:

    # l "I-I..."
    l "我、我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_c148bcd2:

    # l "Maybe you're right. But these fuckers can use magic, what else can they not do?"
    l "或许你是对的。但这些杂种会用魔法，谁知道他们还有什么做不到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_b02e7a40:

    # l "I'm not convinced, disciple."
    l "我还是无法信服，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_77006eb9:

    # e "Lothar, look at the roughness of the stone. Does that feel like a stone from the goats?"
    e "洛萨尔，看看石头的粗糙程度。这感觉像是山羊族的石头吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_94125c77:

    # l "Yes, Disciple what's your point."
    l "是啊，弟子，你到底想说什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4957449a:

    # e "I-I mean... it's smoother?"
    e "我、我是说……它更光滑？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d1be3759:

    # l "They have all kinds of stones, and how can't these fuckers polish one?"
    l "他们有各种各样的石头，难道这些杂种就不能把其中一块打磨光吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_50afd1d4:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_93cec283:

    # l "Disciple, if you want to help, then stop trying to convince me."
    l "弟子，如果你想帮忙，就别再试图说服我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ca4e07e5:

    # e "Lothar, look at the wetness of the stone, does that feel like a stone that the goats would make?"
    e "洛萨尔，看看这块石头的湿润程度，这感觉像是山羊族会做出来的石头吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_bc5c265b:

    # l "Yes."
    l "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_65735172:

    # e "W-what? No?"
    e "什、什么？不是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_657012f0:

    # l "Disciple, their whole tribe is powered by a waterfall with magic."
    l "弟子，他们整个部族都靠一座魔法瀑布供能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_50afd1d4_1:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_c54c886f:

    # l "Do you even know what you're talking about..."
    l "你到底知不知道自己在说什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4866ae9a:

    # l "I'm going to get an explanation, and kill their leader!"
    l "我要去问个明白，然后杀了他们的首领！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ae9e7165:

    # e "Stop! I know..." nointeract
    e "住手！我知道……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_0bf19ec0:

    # e "The golem, right? Their golems went rogue."
    e "是魔像，对吧？他们的魔像失控了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_3ef19a1b:

    # l "I know, and we killed one of them, so?"
    l "我知道，而且我们还杀了其中一个，所以呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9bb08dab:

    # e "I saved the other one. With a stone just like this!"
    e "我救了另一个。用的就是和这块一模一样的石头！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9bf4c9be:

    # l "W-wait. What?"
    l "等、等等。什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_dfc8c4bb:

    # e "Yes... It's from the cave."
    e "是的……它来自洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_5f4916af:

    # l "When? What happened?"
    l "什么时候？发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_a10a6149:

    # e "I saved Furkan from the cave when someone hit him from behind."
    e "有人从背后打了弗坎，我当时在洞窟里救了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_32a43cb2:

    # e "And they stole... the basin."
    e "而且他们还偷走了……那个盆子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_85b3c5bc:

    # l "Why didn't you tell me, disciple."
    l "弟子，你为什么没告诉我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e432efc3:

    # e "Look, the point is, that stone belongs to something in the cave."
    e "听着，关键是，那块石头是洞窟里某个东西的一部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_81904bb0:

    # e "And it's not used to kill anyone."
    e "而且它不是用来杀人的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_2704a1b3:

    # l "Are you... sure?"
    l "你……确定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_370701d4:

    # l "I'm rather disappointed you didn't tell me about this earlier, disciple."
    l "弟子，你之前没告诉我这件事，我相当失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_88f05473:

    # l "But I'll trust you, for now."
    l "不过暂时我还是会相信你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8820d68f:

    # e "So... Uh... the golem..."
    e "所以……呃……那个魔像……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_27af5197:

    # l "The golem has nothing to do with their caravan attack, disciple."
    l "弟子，那魔像和他们袭击商队的事毫无关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_f25e2f16:

    # l "It's that fucking deer that's using the magic."
    l "是那头他妈的鹿在使用魔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_b15758bb:

    # e "Those goats who died in the caravan. Do you really think they'll do something like this?"
    e "那些死在商队里的山羊。你真觉得它们能做出这种事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_6fd7c5f0:

    # l "What else can't they do?"
    l "还有什么是它们做不到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_636b0fc1:

    # e "Their leader, Tevfik, loved their people so much that they attack on Lusterfield after the caravan incident."
    e "他们的首领特夫菲克太爱护族人了，所以商队事件后，他们袭击了卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_bb9998a8:

    # e "You really think they did that on themselves?"
    e "你真觉得那是它们自己干的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_3ec79ab0:

    # l "I-... I don't know? Why else would their stone be there."
    l "我——……我不知道？不然它们的石头怎么会在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_60d1d1cf:

    # e "Maybe it's from the carriage?"
    e "也许是从马车上掉下来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_c9a25310:

    # l "No, they cleaned it up very quick. It couldn't have been from the attacked caravan."
    l "不，他们很快就清理干净了。不可能是从那支遭袭的商队上来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8684cede:

    # l "I found this one hidden under the tree stump. Something must've stopped it..."
    l "我发现这块藏在树桩下面。肯定有什么东西挡住了它……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_5b644e7d:

    # e "Well maybe there's other magic user than the general?"
    e "嗯，也许除了将军之外，还有别的魔法使用者？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_26972d0d:

    # l "...Fine, you win this one. But I'll still go there an you can't stop me."
    l "……好吧，这次算你说得对。但我还是要去那里，你拦不住我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_469df808:

    # e "The tree, the ancient tree, why else would they need magical stone?"
    e "那棵树，那棵古树——不然他们要魔法石做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8f698766:

    # l "W-what do you mean."
    l "你、你这是什么意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9dfa2ef8:

    # e "The ancient tree has all the magical reserve they need, why would they want another magic source?"
    e "那棵古树里有他们所需的全部魔力储备，他们为什么还要另一个魔力来源？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_fe1d8e00:

    # l "It's still pretty far away from the tree."
    l "可它离那棵树还相当远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_871bc6e1:

    # e "My thing is, they could just do it when the caravan arrived to the tree."
    e "我的意思是，他们完全可以等商队抵达那棵树时再这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_2475acbf:

    # l "No? I mean you're right. But why not anywhere with the stone they have."
    l "不？我是说，你说得对。但他们为什么不拿着那块石头，在哪里都可以这么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ae52d18b:

    # e "I-I... because that's the most convenient way...?"
    e "我、我……因为那是最方便的办法……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_7447a21f:

    # l "No, that doesn't sound very right..."
    l "不，那听起来不太对……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_21c30a91:

    # l "I'll kill their guards first if they dare to block me."
    l "要是他们敢拦我，我就先杀了他们的守卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_38c6ebf8:

    # e "Uhmm...."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d000c3b0:

    # e "I know, I know!" nointeract
    e "我知道，我知道！" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_40e6acd5:

    # e "Look, Lothar. I know what you're going through."
    e "听着，洛萨尔。我知道你正在经历什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_1264f361:

    # l "What I am going through?"
    l "我正在经历什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4cfec638:

    # e "I know that you're still grieving and in a lot of pain sinc-"
    e "我知道你还在悲痛之中，而且自从——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ea2cf725:

    # l "What are you talking about, disciple."
    l "你在说什么，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_6316378a:

    # l "I'm angry because I'm only finding this out now!"
    l "我生气是因为我现在才知道这件事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_269a05e3:

    # l "I'm angry that they're getting away with this for so long."
    l "他们这么久都能逍遥法外，我很生气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_319e7f8b:

    # l "These pieces of trash living up on the mountain looking down upon us."
    l "这些住在山上、俯视我们的垃圾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8f004cc5:

    # l "You think this is one thing? That goat leader? I'm fucking glad I get to kill him."
    l "你以为就这一件事？那个山羊族首领？我他妈真高兴能杀了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_c3044c76:

    # e "Maybe you're jealo-"
    e "也许你是嫉妒——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_859c4da3:

    # l "I'm not. I'm the hero, and I do what a hero would do."
    l "才不是。我是英雄，英雄就该做英雄该做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4dd9e62e:

    # e "Think, Lothar. Look at all the evidence that proved otherwise."
    e "想想吧，洛萨尔。看看所有证明事实并非如此的证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_8f698766_1:

    # l "W-what do you mean."
    l "什、什么意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_137e92ea:

    # e "Take a deep breath, Lothar."
    e "深呼吸，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_6312c2be:

    # l "I... I'm starting to hate how you're talking to me this way, disciple."
    l "我开始讨厌你这样跟我说话了，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_726fb666:

    # e "I-... just breath."
    e "我……只是让你呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e70ba265:

    # l "I'm breathing all the time."
    l "我一直都在呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_106c20d1:

    # e "Then stop shaking and think about the reasons. Maybe you're blinded by emotions."
    e "那就别再发抖了，想想其中的缘由。也许你被情绪蒙蔽了双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ba356bb4:

    # l "I'm not."
    l "才没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_dbe85fed:

    # e "There's a lot more groups other than the goats and Lusterfield."
    e "除了山羊族和卢斯特菲尔德，还有很多其他群体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_aa17648e:

    # l "Y-you mean the other tribes?"
    l "你、你是说其他部族？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_4d7200c6:

    # e "Maybe, but much more."
    e "也许吧，但远不止这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_f39a9527:

    # l "...Maybe."
    l "……也许吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_a81c20a9:

    # e "Look, Lothar. You need a beer."
    e "听着，洛萨尔。你需要喝杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_a49fddcf:

    # l "I-I... I can't drink a beer, I'm going to kill them."
    l "我、我……我不能喝啤酒，我要去杀了他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_e95a9965:

    # e "But... you need a beer first, here."
    e "但是……你得先喝杯啤酒，给。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_053ed47f:

    # e "Well, what a sunny day it is today..."
    e "嗯，今天的阳光真好啊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_66d29fd4:

    # l "Disciple, stop."
    l "弟子，别说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_51285af9:

    # e "We could have gone for a walk, just you and me."
    e "我们本可以去散散步，就你和我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d61ba1ff:

    # l "We could but there's something much more important."
    l "本来可以，但还有更重要的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_ad9def80:

    # e "I've defeated a mimic before, have you seen a monster that mimics a chest?"
    e "我以前打败过拟态怪，你见过会伪装成箱子的怪物吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_82822a0c_1:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_a4a45684:

    # e "And Seb seems like he wanted his nuts kicked, don't you want to take a revenge?"
    e "而且塞布看起来像是想挨上一脚，你难道不想报仇吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_cda51cc7:

    # l "Mhmm..."
    l "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_984f13bd:

    # l "It doesn't seem you're that convincing, disciple."
    l "弟子，看起来你并没有那么有说服力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_3e45dc9c:

    # l "I'm going there myself, and don't try to stop me."
    l "我要亲自去，别想拦我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9cad8d67:

    # "Lothar rushes away and you already lose sight of him when you realise..."
    "洛萨尔冲了出去，等你意识到时，已经看不见他的身影了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_7841d6c2:

    # "You feel like you should go to the goat tribe to check on Lothar..."
    "你觉得自己应该去山羊部落那里看看洛萨尔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d361eb98:

    # l "I've thought about your argument, but... I trust my intuition."
    l "我考虑过你的说法，但是……我相信自己的直觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_71ddf22b:

    # l "And I can just get all I need before I finish them."
    l "而且在解决掉他们之前，我正好能拿到自己需要的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_3e45dc9c_1:

    # l "I'm going there myself, and don't try to stop me."
    l "我要亲自去，别想拦我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_9cad8d67_1:

    # "Lothar rushes away and you already lose sight of him when you realise..."
    "洛萨尔冲了出去，等你意识到时，已经看不见他的身影了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_7841d6c2_1:

    # "You feel like you should go to the goat tribe to check on Lothar..."
    "你觉得自己应该去山羊部落那里看看洛萨尔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_fc766ee9:

    # l "I've thought about it..."
    l "我考虑过了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_790cc048:

    # l "I don't need a beer, or a small talk."
    l "我不需要啤酒，也不需要闲聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_13bf8c22:

    # l "But I need an explanation at least, as a hero."
    l "但作为英雄，我至少需要一个解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_d387d273:

    # e "So... can I go with you?"
    e "那么……我能和你一起去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Caravan_Stone_93f7e641:

    # l "Fine. You can come, maybe you can get them to start talking."
    l "好吧。你可以跟来，说不定你能让他们开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_fda1fd53:

    # "As you and Lothar approach the goat tribe, you can feel your companion becoming a lot more tense."
    "当你和洛萨尔接近山羊部落时，你能感觉到同伴变得紧张了许多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_8947979c:

    # "Lothar's hand reaches towards his sword."
    "洛萨尔的手伸向了他的剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_42dbe41e:

    # e "Lothar, we're not here to kill anyone. We should talk before we resort to violence."
    e "洛萨尔，我们不是来杀人的。在诉诸暴力之前，我们应该先谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_863d200b:

    # l "Why shouldn't we, Disciple? They've killed so many of us. Plus, the stone is proof that they're in on this."
    l "为什么不该杀，弟子？他们杀了我们这么多人。而且，那块石头就证明了他们也参与其中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_01e9017f:

    # e "Again, that's not yet verified."
    e "我再说一次，那还没有得到证实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_d00301b3:

    # l "This Hero will not be seen groveling or begging any goats. I'll kill before that happens."
    l "这位英雄可不会在任何山羊面前卑躬屈膝、苦苦哀求。在那发生之前，我会先杀了人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_a537d873:

    # e "We're not going to do that either."
    e "我们也不会那样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_fba6df5d:

    # l "Disciple, for all we know, we might be walking into a trap."
    l "门徒，据我们所知，我们可能正走进一个陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_f4ab2bee:

    # e "Now, you're just being paranoid."
    e "你现在只是疑神疑鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_e9afbae9:

    # l "I am being experienced as I am. A lesson you need to learn when you're dealing with goats, Disciple."
    l "我只是凭经验行事。和山羊打交道时，你得学会这一课，门徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_054da56f:

    # "The conversation is cut short as two goat guards appear out of the bushes."
    "谈话被打断了，两名山羊守卫从灌木丛中现身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_355f0cb2:

    # goatguard "Halt!"
    goatguard "站住！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_1a496964:

    # "Lothar instantly gears up to fight."
    "洛萨尔立刻摆出战斗姿态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_387dc25f:

    # "You quickly intervene."
    "你连忙出面干预。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_4913fa9d:

    # e "Wait. We would like to talk to the General. We have found something that he might be interested to see."
    e "等等。我们想见将军。我们找到了一样他可能会感兴趣的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_bcdbcc75:

    # "The guards look at each other. They are familiar with your presence but they clearly are wary of Lothar."
    "守卫们互相对视。他们对你的出现并不陌生，但显然对洛萨尔心存戒备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_d50eea26:

    # "Then again, you can't really blame them. Lothar is on the offensive mode."
    "不过也不能怪他们。洛萨尔已经摆出进攻架势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_46cd768a:

    # l "Get the general or we're going to cut our way into your village!"
    l "把将军叫来，否则我们就杀进你们村子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_ab8beb66:

    # l "Try and stop me!"
    l "尽管来阻止我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_920d899d:

    # e "Lothar, you're not helping!"
    e "洛萨尔，你这样只会帮倒忙！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_82bd503e:

    # "More guards immediately appear."
    "更多守卫立刻现身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_86f478e6:

    # "Lothar pushes you behind him as he brandishes his sword."
    "洛萨尔挥舞长剑，把你推到身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_779e1d3e:

    # "The tension in the air is so thick that it could cut."
    "空气中的紧张气氛浓得几乎能用刀切开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_400d2b0a:

    # e "Lothar, calm down please."
    e "洛萨尔，请冷静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_fd3e5454:

    # "At that moment, there is a silvery chime."
    "就在这时，传来一声银铃般的声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_45c775e0:

    # "The goats part to reveal Furkan and Kari."
    "山羊们分开，露出弗坎和卡里的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_d439585d:

    # "Furkan's eyes darken when he lays his eyes on Lothar."
    "弗坎一看到洛萨尔，眼神便阴沉下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_74e15968:

    # "Kari is still as serious as usual."
    "卡里依旧一如往常地严肃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_ec35581a:

    # k "What is the meaning of this, courier?"
    k "信使，这是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_4b5ec882:

    # k "We give you the permission to visit our village and you bring a murderer into our midst?"
    k "我们准许你进入村子，你却把一个杀人犯带到我们中间来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_9c3a0dce:

    # l "Who are you calling a murderer?"
    l "你说谁是杀人犯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_28b571aa:

    # k "You know what you did, murderer."
    k "你知道自己做了什么，杀人犯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_51429298:

    # "You try to break up the tension. You figure the easiest way is to cut straight to the point."
    "你试图缓和紧张的气氛，觉得最简单的办法就是直奔主题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_96c3cc11:

    # e "Kari, we believe we found something of magical nature at the caravan attack site."
    e "卡里，我们相信自己在商队遇袭地点发现了某种带有魔法性质的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_74dc8139:

    # l "Yes, an evidence of your guilt."
    l "没错，是能证明你有罪的证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_6167b8ac:

    # "Kari frowns."
    "卡里皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_0423e6ae:

    # k "I wasn't even part of that caravan trip 4 years ago. If I were there, the tragedy wouldn't have happened."
    k "四年前那趟商队之行我根本没参加。要是我当时在那里，那场悲剧就不会发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_8996915a:

    # l "Lies!"
    l "胡说！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_554bfc1e:

    # k "Why would I lie about something like that?"
    k "我为什么要在这种事情上撒谎？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_57c0249f:

    # f "Kari is telling the truth... He went with me while the caravan attack happened."
    f "卡里说的是真的……商队遇袭时，他是和我一起去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_df75d72c:

    # f "Of course, in retrospect, things would have been a lot more different if he was in the caravan."
    f "当然，现在回想起来，如果他当时在商队里，事情肯定会大不相同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_19a6c0e1:

    # e "Lothar, I think they're right."
    e "洛萨尔，我觉得他们说得没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_2740b865:

    # l "Disciple, the goats are deceitful creatures. We mustn't be too trusting."
    l "门徒，山羊是狡诈的生物。我们不能太过轻信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_4b830ef9:

    # f "In that case, how about we show some trust in you."
    f "那样的话，我们不如也对你表示一些信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_6732bf30:

    # f "I will have the guards pull back. No more blood needs to be shed."
    f "我会让守卫撤退。不必再流血了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_88de899e:

    # k "Furkan, is that really..."
    k "弗坎，真的吗……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_8c0740cf:

    # "Furkan stops his general."
    "弗坎拦住了他的将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_c834e7c2:

    # f "Kari, it will be fine. Plus, I trust the courier."
    f "卡里，没事的。而且，我信任这位信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_72046d00:

    # "The goat guards back away under Furkan's order."
    "山羊族守卫在弗坎的命令下退开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_8928e4c2:

    # "Furkan smiles at you and points to the wolf."
    "弗坎朝你微笑，并指向那匹狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_6d302c21:

    # e "Thank you, Furkan."
    e "谢谢你，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_a79d0326:

    # "You turn to Lothar."
    "你转身面对洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_9823fe27:

    # e "Lot, perhaps you should put down your weapon too."
    e "洛萨尔，也许你也该把武器放下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_34440b65:

    # "You see the veins of Lothar's hand pop."
    "你看到洛萨尔手上的青筋暴起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_f48236c3:

    # e "It's fine. Furkan is not going to harm us."
    e "没事的。弗坎不会伤害我们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_6f38f393:

    # "Reluctantly, Lothar puts his sword away."
    "洛萨尔不情愿地收起了剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Along_Goat_Tribe_d041a6d1:

    # f "Thank you."
    f "谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_76580977:

    # "Kari holds the magical stone in his palm and closes his eyes."
    "卡里将魔法石托在掌心，闭上了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_896528d9:

    # "Everyone is silent, even Lothar."
    "所有人都陷入了沉默，就连洛萨尔也不例外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_33471d00:

    # "After who knew how long, Kari opens his eyes."
    "不知过了多久，卡里睁开了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_9bf81c08:

    # k "This is strange..."
    k "这很奇怪……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_5a1ab3fb:

    # f "What is it?"
    f "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_90234025:

    # k "The source of this magic is surprisingly close to us."
    k "这股魔法的源头，竟然离我们这么近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_3cf93c81:

    # l "See! I told you they're the culprit!"
    l "看吧！我就说他们是罪魁祸首！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_ab0095af:

    # "Lothar immediately turns aggressive."
    "洛萨尔立刻变得咄咄逼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_89efdbe5:

    # k "That's not what I meant."
    k "我不是这个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_17c7280a:

    # e "Kari, what is it then?"
    e "卡里，那到底是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_0500e3eb:

    # k "The lingering magic on this stone can be traced back to the dark forest."
    k "这块石头上残留的魔力，可以追溯到黑暗森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_01182ef8:

    # e "Dark forest? Where is that?"
    e "黑暗森林？那是什么地方？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_6557cd44:

    # "Both Furkan and Lothar frown."
    "弗坎和洛萨尔都皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_696383eb:

    # l "How are they involved in this?"
    l "他们和这件事有什么关系？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_1a1cf6ec:

    # f "Dark forest is a forest north of our outpost."
    f "黑暗森林就在我们哨站的北面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_05e6de1c:

    # f "It is a place where all kinds of dangerous creatures lurk."
    f "那里潜伏着各种各样的危险生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_5e924ca6:

    # f "The most dangerous of them all is a pack of werewolves."
    f "其中最危险的，是一群狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_857cece2:

    # e "Werewolves?"
    e "狼人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_c4cc9286:

    # k "Yes. They are highly dangerous and fiercely territorial."
    k "没错。他们极其危险，而且有着强烈的领地意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_23c6abbc:

    # k "Thankfully, they rarely leave dark forest. We get the occasional werewolf raid, but nothing more than that."
    k "好在他们很少离开黑暗森林。我们偶尔会遭到狼人袭击，但也仅此而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_7845f928:

    # e "Then, what are we supposed to do now?"
    e "那么，我们现在该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_f90a8aa4:

    # "Furkan is silent. Kari contemplates for a moment."
    "弗坎一言不发，卡里沉思了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_37d58c57:

    # k "The trail leads us to the dark forest. You can do anything in the dark forest without the permission or at least having the werewolves tolerate your presence."
    k "这条线索把我们引向黑暗森林。在黑暗森林里，你可以不经许可做任何事，至少也得让狼人容忍你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_1970f4f0:

    # k "The werewolves are led by an alpha. To proceed, we'll need to get his aid."
    k "狼人由一名首领统领。要继续前进，我们得获得他的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_b833b7bd:

    # f "But that is not going to be easy. They are highly suspicious of outsiders and have no qualms to resort to sinister means to deal with outsiders."
    f "但这可不容易。他们对外来者疑心很重，而且不介意用阴险手段来对付外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_2058f88e:

    # f "I wish the tribe can help but with our magic dwindling, we can't afford to assign any soldiers away from the tribe."
    f "我希望部落能帮忙，可我们的魔力正在逐渐衰竭，实在无力从部落派出士兵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_9e6939a8:

    # l "The Hero will handle this."
    l "英雄会处理这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_83581b07:

    # e "Lothar, don't be silly. This is much too dangerous. Plus, Lusterfield still needs its hero."
    e "洛萨尔，别犯傻了。这太危险了。而且，卢斯特菲尔德仍然需要它的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_1d7dc0fa:

    # "Lothar mulls over this."
    "洛萨尔对此思索起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_8d141981:

    # f "Thanks for bringing this to our attention, Kari and I will see what we can do about this."
    f "谢谢你把这件事告诉我们，我和卡里会想办法处理的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_91ece583:

    # f "I know we can't stop you from doing your fair share of adventuring. But no matter what you do, be careful."
    f "我知道我们阻止不了你去冒险闯荡。但无论你做什么，都要小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_1e22084d:

    # e "I... I will, if I go there..."
    e "我……如果我去那里……我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_aecfc16d:

    # "The general and the chief walks back to the mountain."
    "将军和酋长走回山上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_05956e1f:

    # "You go back to Lusterfield with Lothar."
    "你和洛萨尔回到卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_60c429de:

    # e "H-hey... Lothar. You... doing alright?"
    e "喂、喂……洛萨尔。你……还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_0032b342:

    # l "...no."
    l "……不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_a2cede7d:

    # "You look at the bruises on Lothar's back and arm."
    "你看着洛萨尔背部和手臂上的瘀伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_13c56fe4:

    # l "And I didn't get to kill them before they get to explain."
    l "而且我没能在他们解释之前杀掉他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_9f31adbb:

    # e "Hmm... do you need anything?"
    e "嗯……你需要什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_03199fe8:

    # l "No, if I need... I'll ask that lizard to give me free ointment."
    l "不，如果我需要……我会让那条蜥蜴免费给我药膏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_df9c2b76:

    # l "Disciple, I may not trust the goats but they are not joking about how dangerous the dark forest is."
    l "徒弟，我或许不信任那些山羊，但他们对黑暗森林有多危险这件事，可不是在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_b7a41b32:

    # e "W-what do you mean?"
    e "你、你这是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_337db65a:

    # l "The werewolves, let's say they are not as heroic and honourable as me."
    l "狼人嘛……这么说吧，他们可没有我这么英勇高尚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_b42f9122:

    # l "If you set your foot in there, I'm afraid you may not come out alive."
    l "如果你踏入那里，恐怕就没法活着出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_b2b7ae13:

    # e "Are you scared, Lothar?"
    e "洛萨尔，你害怕吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_c5348e92:

    # l "O-of course not! Why would I be scared... I'm the hero! HE-RO."
    l "当、当然不怕！我为什么要害怕……我可是英雄！英——雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_82822a0c_1:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_12bbea57:

    # l "As much as you and those filthy goats want me to believe otherwise."
    l "尽管你和那些肮脏的山羊都想让我相信事实并非如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_3b7e7e96:

    # l "I'm still keeping my eyes on the goats. So I have to stay in Lusterfield."
    l "我还得盯着那些山羊。所以我必须留在卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_82822a0c_2:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_6b342fbf:

    # l "What?"
    l "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_2d3f7d3b:

    # e "Fine... then I'll go to the dark forest?"
    e "行吧……那我去黑暗森林？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_cce2b9a1:

    # l "I didn't say that."
    l "我可没这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_ba6fac70:

    # l "...But it's getting weird that I'm telling you this."
    l "……但我把这些告诉你，感觉越来越奇怪了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_7180f2d9:

    # e "Tell me what?"
    e "告诉我什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_dfbc31e8:

    # l "Keep yourself... safe."
    l "你自己……多保重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_40112f05:

    # l "You're my disciple after all. I trust that you possess half of my power."
    l "毕竟你是我的弟子。我相信你拥有我一半的力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_700d109f:

    # l "It would suffice already to survive in the forest."
    l "只要能在森林里活下来，就已经够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_7634acec:

    # e "O-ok..."
    e "好、好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Stone_Goat_Tribe_479680db:

    # msg "You received a level point."
    msg "你获得了一个等级点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_603b8c84:

    # "As you approach the goat village, you can sense the palpable tension in the air."
    "你接近山羊村时，能感受到空气中弥漫着紧张的气氛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_15e1e50f:

    # "You get closer and see a group of goats surrounding Lothar."
    "你走近些，看到一群山羊正围着洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_9fd58469:

    # "You take a quick sweep around and are relief to see that no one has been injured."
    "你迅速环视四周，庆幸没有人受伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_c46b46c7:

    # "You quickly step in before things spiral out of control."
    "你赶紧介入，以免事态失控。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_226d9b96:

    # e "Stop!"
    e "住手！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_a779582f:

    # "Everyone turns to you."
    "所有人都转头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_bd18c24f:

    # "The goat guards still have their spear poised at Lothar but Kari levels his penetrating gaze at you."
    "山羊守卫仍用长矛指着洛萨尔，但卡里用锐利的目光盯住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_770c148b:

    # "Lothar regards you with caution."
    "洛萨尔警惕地打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_569cd61d:

    # l "Disciple, what are you doing here? Go back. This Hero can handle this!"
    l "弟子，你来这里做什么？回去。本英雄能处理好这件事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_7e6a7297:

    # "You can see bruises on lothar's arms."
    "你能看到洛萨尔手臂上的淤青。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_eaa5b9c6:

    # k "Are you responsible for this idiot?"
    k "你要为这个白痴负责吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_0a43b08e:

    # "Kari addresses you."
    "卡里对你说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_c19308ef:

    # "Lothar snarls in response. He would have attacked if not for the ring of guards suppressing him."
    "洛萨尔咆哮着回应。若不是一圈卫兵压制着他，他早就发动攻击了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_9e168798:

    # e "What happened?"
    e "发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_8ea9be6d:

    # k "I would like to know that. This wolf charged into the tribe without warning to attack me."
    k "我也想知道。这头狼毫无预警地冲进部落要袭击我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_665ce34a:

    # k "The guards held him back. We fought to a stalemate and you arrived."
    k "卫兵拦住了他。我们打成平手，随后你来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_5b9d1406:

    # l "There's no stalemate. I would have gotten your head if not for these pesky guards!"
    l "根本没有什么平手。要不是这些碍事的卫兵，我早就砍下你的脑袋了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_5a4016fc:

    # e "Let Lothar go."
    e "放开洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_20057a64:

    # k "And have the wolf attacks us? Courier, you do not make the rules here."
    k "还要让这头狼攻击我们不成？信使，这里不是你说了算。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_79e41dd0:

    # "Kari eyes you threateningly."
    "卡里威胁地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_d35e1f85:

    # l "Disciple, don't worry about me. I'll cut a bloody way out if I have to."
    l "弟子，别担心我。必要的话，我会杀出一条血路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_b41f07dc:

    # "The goats move into a fighting stance."
    "山羊人纷纷摆出战斗姿态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_98e0d69d:

    # "The ring closes in on Lothar. A guard goes in for a stab. Lothar dodges it with ease, just to step into the trap of another goat."
    "包围圈向洛萨尔逼近。一名卫兵刺向他。洛萨尔轻松闪开，却正好踏入另一名山羊人的陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_53cdf158:

    # "The guard smacks Lothar's wrist and his weapon falls to the ground."
    "卫兵猛击洛萨尔的手腕，他的武器掉落在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_0d7944df:

    # l "Arughhhh!"
    l "嗷啊啊啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_33a90ee6:

    # "Lothar gnashes his teeth and looks like he's going to go into rage."
    "洛萨尔咬牙切齿，看起来就要陷入狂怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_57e660b5:

    # l "You can't fight me you filthy goats!"
    l "你们这些肮脏的山羊人，根本不是我的对手！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_aa651895:

    # "Suddenly, a dignified voice carries over."
    "突然，一道威严的声音传来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_d49ce91a:

    # f "Enough. There shall be no bloodshed today."
    f "够了。今天不许见血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_0f56e7f8:

    # "Furkan walks over with the bearing of the chief."
    "弗坎带着首领的威仪走了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_058ac40f:

    # "Furkan's eyes darken slightly when he sees Lothar but he soon reverts to his charismatic self."
    "看到洛萨尔时，弗坎的目光略微阴沉，但很快又恢复了他那副魅力十足的模样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_16bb97e8:

    # f "What have you trespassed into our tribe, wolf?"
    f "狼，你为何擅闯我们的部落？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_c74e9828:

    # l "Of course, it's to exact vengeance on our people."
    l "当然是为了向我们族人复仇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_ca3f330d:

    # k "It was the goats who lost more in that battle."
    k "那场战斗中，损失更惨重的是山羊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_bf2e5b1b:

    # f "Plus, what evidence do you have to say that we're responsible for that caravan?"
    f "再说，你有什么证据证明那支商队的事是我们干的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_9c0b31e4:

    # l "This!"
    l "就是这个！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_7091c9a6:

    # "Lothar brandishes the magic stone."
    "洛萨尔亮出魔法石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_b12e26bf:

    # "Both Kari and Furkan frown."
    "卡里和弗坎都皱起眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_b3bec646:

    # f "Where did you find that?"
    f "你在哪里找到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_9b4e6d8d:

    # l "Wouldn't you know?"
    l "你不是应该知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_a5b3bc6b:

    # f "Based on what you've said, I presume you found this at the caravan attack site?"
    f "根据你说的，我猜你是在商队遇袭的地方找到这件东西的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_f4a4020a:

    # "Lothar growls and says nothing."
    "洛萨尔低吼一声，没有作答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_00013427:

    # "He's not really known for lying."
    "他并不以撒谎闻名。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_deafc44f:

    # f "Kari, what do you make of this object?"
    f "卡里，你怎么看这件东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_325644aa:

    # "Furkan turns to ask his general."
    "弗坎转身询问他的将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_1b77ca89:

    # k "It's definitely a magical artifact. As for what it does, I need to take a closer look at it to tell."
    k "这确实是一件魔法遗物。至于它有什么作用，我得再仔细看看才能判断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_f8dcdf92:

    # "Lothar quickly puts the stone away."
    "洛萨尔迅速把石头收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_dd1b2935:

    # l "You're not destroying the evidence! I won't allow that!"
    l "你不能毁掉证据！我不允许！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_3a15838f:

    # "Furkan sighs."
    "弗坎叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_3cb077e7:

    # f "We're not going to do that."
    f "我们不会这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_1c0850fe:

    # k "Plus, the artefact does not even originate from this tribe."
    k "而且，这件魔法遗物甚至并非出自这个部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_078b644a:

    # e "How can you tell?"
    e "你是怎么看出来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_0bc779a5:

    # k "Simple. As you can see around us, we use blue magic in our glyphs. The glyphs on that stone are not blue."
    k "很简单。你看看我们周围就知道了，我们在符文中使用的是蓝色魔法。那块石头上的符文不是蓝色的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_606b229d:

    # "Furkan turns to you."
    "弗坎转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_856e927c:

    # f "Courier, would you mind talking to your friend to let us take a look at that stone? So that we can put this misunderstanding behind us?"
    f "信使，你能不能劝劝你的朋友，让我们看看那块石头？这样我们就能把这场误会抛在脑后了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_7cb4fd13:

    # k "In fact, we would like to find the real culprit behind the caravan attack and avenge our people too."
    k "事实上，我们也想找出商队遇袭的真正元凶，为我们的族人报仇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_11387225:

    # "Kari's eyes shine with determination and power."
    "卡里的双眼闪烁着坚定与力量的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_4aff5437:

    # "You turn to Lothar. He snaps his teeth at the goats around him."
    "你转向洛萨尔。他冲着身边的山羊龇牙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_d351d5cd:

    # "You realize Furkan and Kari do have a point."
    "你意识到，弗坎和卡里说得确实有道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_296229ae:

    # e "Lothar, perhaps we should let them see the stone."
    e "洛萨尔，也许我们应该让他们看看那块石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_e653997a:

    # l "Disciple, do not be fooled by their words! They will cut us down once we give them what they want."
    l "弟子，别被他们的话骗了！一旦我们把他们想要的东西交给他们，他们就会把我们砍倒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_61168411:

    # f "We will not do that. As a show of faith, I will have my people put down their weapons too."
    f "我们不会这么做。为了表示诚意，我也会让我的人放下武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_8decf2d6:

    # k "Furkan, is that really a good idea?"
    k "弗坎，真觉得这是个好主意吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_4a79ad42:

    # f "We need to meet halfway for peace to work."
    f "要想实现和平，我们双方都得各退一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_71561f23:

    # "Kari contemplates that for a while before giving the order for the goats to stand back."
    "卡里思索了一会儿，随后下令让山羊们退后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_e2ac84f6:

    # "The ring of weapons around Lothar loosens."
    "围住洛萨尔的武器圈渐渐松开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_d4c99eb5:

    # "This gives Lothar pause."
    "这让洛萨尔迟疑了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_4db655dc:

    # "You hurry to Lothar's side."
    "你赶紧来到洛萨尔身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_397e1803:

    # e "Lothar, you alright?"
    e "洛萨尔，你没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_b3cc4b8d:

    # l "Why wouldn't I be, Disciple?"
    l "我为什么会有事，徒弟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_788b0eab:

    # e "Lothar, perhaps we should show them the stone."
    e "洛萨尔，也许我们该把石头给他们看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_a02cfe8e:

    # "Lothar hesitates."
    "洛萨尔犹豫了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_d96dbd86:

    # l "Fine. But I will keep a very close eye on them. Any funny move and I will move to kill."
    l "好吧。但我会盯紧他们。只要他们稍有异动，我就会动手杀了他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Found_Goat_Tribe_eb58d476:

    # "Lothar reluctantly hands the magic stone over."
    "洛萨尔不情愿地把魔法石递了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Sparring_14a2abd5:

    # e "Lothar, about the sparr-"
    e "洛萨尔，关于对练——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Sparring_c47ae0a7:

    # l "Well, well... disciple. Finally, Are you ready to get your ass beat?" nointeract
    l "哼哼……徒弟。终于来了。准备好被我打得落花流水了吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Sparring_8d246e37:

    # e "Yes... I'm ready."
    e "是……我准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Sparring_ed6f8e88:

    # e "Hmmm... not yet."
    e "嗯……还没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Sparring_c4d692b4:

    # l "Ugh, make it quick, I'm waiting..."
    l "啧，快点，我还等着呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_f163ce69:

    # l "Hmm..."
    l "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_56bd063a:

    # e "What are you looking at, Lothar?"
    e "洛萨尔，你干嘛一直盯着我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_80f29ad9:

    # l "You know... Amble and Jog saw you a few days ago."
    l "你知道的……安布和乔格几天前看见了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_9e56aaeb:

    # l "And they ask me. Lot, why is your disciple so small."
    l "然后他们就问我：“洛哥，你的徒弟怎么这么小只？”"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_ed54c58b:

    # l "And I can't say anything back, usually I could tease them to oblivion."
    l "而我没法反驳。换作平时，我早就能把他们损到体无完肤了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_68af3d0a:

    # l "Like, not being as handsome as me, or not being the hero of Lusterfield."
    l "比如说，他们没我英俊，或者没我这个卢斯特菲尔德的英雄厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_d30a66d5:

    # l "But now I don't even know what to say... because that's not my problem! That's your problem, disciple."
    l "可现在我甚至不知道该说什么了……因为那不是我的问题！那是你的问题，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_f33c3e16:

    # e "Is it really my fault though... it's not like I can get any bigger in size..."
    e "真的是我的错吗……我又不能让自己长得更大……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_f10c9f24:

    # l "Ugh, I'll give you the credit. For a smaller guy like you, you actually do fight like a warrior."
    l "啧，算你有点本事。你个头这么小，居然真能打得像个战士。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_52daa19b:

    # e "I'll bet I can beat you, quite easily."
    e "我敢赌我能轻轻松松打败你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_81b131f5:

    # e "I've had no problem punching these slimes into pulps, quite easily actually."
    e "我把这些史莱姆打成浆糊也毫不费力，其实轻轻松松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_17c02a7e:

    # l "You're a mere disciple, stop being so smug."
    l "你不过是个徒弟，别这么得意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_9e8cb1d4:

    # e "Lothar, you just don't trust me enough."
    e "洛萨尔，你就是不够信任我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_c95939f5:

    # l "You know, that's the problem with you, everything negative about you reflects much worse on my name."
    l "你知道吗，你的问题就在这里：你身上所有不好的地方，都会让我的名声受到更严重的损害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_1d474e28:

    # l "Next thing Amble would tell me you got fucked by a feeble little slime..."
    l "接下来安布就会告诉我，你被一只弱小的史莱姆给强奸了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_24919ecc:

    # l "And then they'll ask. Hu hu hu, Lot why did your disciple get fucked by a slime!"
    l "然后他们会问：呵呵呵，洛哥，你的徒弟怎么会被史莱姆给干了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_0823e48c:

    # l "Hu hu hu! And they laugh like an idiot for hours straight."
    l "呵呵呵！然后他们会像傻瓜一样一笑就是好几个小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_ded2746f:

    # "Lothar imitates Amble and Jog's voices, while chuckling."
    "洛萨尔一边偷笑，一边模仿安布和乔格的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_61f23e3c:

    # e "How... did you know..."
    e "你……你怎么知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_d6dcaf02:

    # l "I really do need to train you myself, do I not...?"
    l "看来我确实得亲自训练你，不是吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Battle_Training_9e6e1f41:

    # e "No, I-I can actually handle being out there. Look, I'm strong enough."
    e "不、不是，我其实应付得来外面的战斗。看，我够强了。"

