    # e "All he did was just punching me."
    e "它也就只会揍我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_657bbab3:

    # "Lothar gives you a satisfied grin."
    "洛萨尔得意地咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_77899306:

    # l "Well I didn't even expect you're gonna actually do it."
    l "我根本没想到你居然真的能做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_7cae614d:

    # l "I need to tell them about this..."
    l "我得把这件事告诉他们……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_acf8dda5:

    # l "Follow me."
    l "跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_35675f62:

    # e "Huh...?"
    e "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_0a7d3955:

    # "You see lothar smirks while he looks for Amble in the village."
    "你看到洛萨尔一边得意地笑着，一边在村里寻找安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1ed383e8:

    # "He seems to be very proud of your achievement... almost too proud."
    "他似乎为你的成就感到无比自豪……甚至有点过头了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_733931f2:

    # l "Hey, Amb, where's Jog."
    l "嘿，安布，乔格呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_a3fbfc05:

    # a "Out scouting."
    a "出去侦察了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_fc82aaf1:

    # "Amble says as he notices you."
    "安布说着，注意到了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_2f6bdb39:

    # a "Oh, puny friend. What are you doing here?"
    a "哦，小不点朋友。你怎么会在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_65dec1d2:

    # e "Well, I live in this place."
    e "呃，我住在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1b2e908c:

    # e "And I'm practising with Lothar."
    e "而且我正在跟洛萨尔练习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_0b74671d:

    # "Amble nods with a sluggish smile."
    "安布带着懒洋洋的笑容点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_54e05d5f:

    # l "I'd tell you but you won't believe stuff like this."
    l "我可以告诉你，不过这种事你肯定不会信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_cb6d7537:

    # l "My disciple... he beat my advanced dummy."
    l "我的徒弟……他打败了我的高级人偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_7a5bec27:

    # a "Eh...? That's impossible! It was ridiculously strong."
    a "什么……？这不可能！那东西强得离谱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1a1a3255:

    # a "Like the tailor doesn't even know how to adjust their proper strength."
    a "简直就像裁缝根本不知道该怎么把它调到合适的强度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_c86437e2:

    # "Amble scratches his head with frustration."
    "安布挫败地挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1ce663f5:

    # "Amble walks towards the dummy and he soon returns in defeat, it's apparent to him that you won against the dummy."
    "安布走向人偶，很快便垂头丧气地回来了；显然，他已经看出你打赢了人偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_6d1cf8da:

    # l "How does it go...?"
    l "怎么样……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_427643a5:

    # a "I didn't even know you can possibly do it. Even Lot can't beat it every time."
    a "我都不知道你居然能做到。就连洛哥也不是每次都能打赢它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_fde72e4c:

    # l "Now hand me those 200 gold, Ambie."
    l "现在把那两百枚金币交出来，安比。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_7ffeaa59:

    # "Lothar exclaims, he seems to be getting more impatient with Amble."
    "洛萨尔喊道，似乎对安布越来越不耐烦了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_47897b65:

    # a "Hmmmmmm..."
    a "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_fabfc4a9:

    # l "See? [e], great job at shutting up doubters, and earning me some gold."
    l "看到了吧？[e]，既让那些质疑者闭了嘴，又替我赚到了金币，干得漂亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_b660fe4e:

    # "Lothar says, as he smuggishly takes the gold from Amble."
    "洛萨尔说着，趾高气扬地从安布手里接过金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_b8809f23:

    # e "Were you guys betting if I will win?"
    e "你们是在赌我能不能赢吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_a20faaac:

    # a "Yeah, I suppose so."
    a "嗯，我想是吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1f7d4b21:

    # e "And Lothar was betting for me?"
