translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_4985a718:

    # e "I just wanted to kick you..."
    e "我只是想踢你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_168f3dd2:

    # l "What's wrong with you, and your fascination of my nuts..."
    l "你到底怎么回事，干吗这么迷恋我的蛋蛋……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_456be4e0:

    # l "I've never met people like you, with such audacity to argue with your hero..."
    l "我还从没见过你这种人，居然厚着脸皮跟自己的英雄顶嘴……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_ebfeafd7:

    # l "I saved you from the golem, it could've killed you easy if it wasn't for me."
    l "要不是我，你早就被魔像轻易杀掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_50afd1d4_2:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_36a325dd:

    # e "So... do I get to kick you?"
    e "那……我可以踢你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_5cb6c0b2:

    # l "Alright, but it's not like you can actually win against the hero right here."
    l "好吧，不过你也不可能真在这里赢过这位英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_6d392908:

    # l "I mean, I've got over 2 decades of fighter training."
    l "我可是接受了二十多年战士训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_e59ae9c9:

    # l "It's totally alright for you to be just a little intimidated."
    l "你稍微有点害怕也完全没关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_4f311731:

    # e "I get it."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_fa0b6fe8:

    # l "Anyways, are you ready?"
    l "总之，你准备好了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_2697bf52:

    # l "For our legendary sparring... of course." nointeract
    l "当然是为了我们这场传奇般的切磋……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_8d246e37:

    # e "Yes... I'm ready."
    e "是的……我准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_1b33efd3:

    # e "No, I still have to prepare, I had already spent all my energy beating the dummy."
    e "不，我还得准备一下，打那个训练人偶已经耗尽了我所有力气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_a8f3f1ea:

    # l "Alright, alright, go ask your little lizard friend for tips or something."
    l "好了好了，去找你那小蜥蜴朋友讨教几招什么的吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_cb6c9e4e:

    # l "You can't win against me anyhow."
    l "反正你赢不了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_9a961bd3:

    # e "Uhm, we're just sparring, right?"
    e "呃，我们只是切磋，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_7f8492fb:

    # l "Yes, I suppose, this is your big opportunity to learn from the best out here."
    l "是吧，我想这可是你向这里最强的人学习的大好机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_45a1a6d2:

    # l "This hero right here aren't always here to fight with someone like you."
    l "我这位英雄可不会一直有空陪你这种人切磋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_385a6fc7:

    # e "I get it. I should go now?"
    e "我明白了。我现在可以走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Dummy_6f8b99bc:

    # l "Yes, you can go now, I'll just be waiting..."
    l "可以，你现在就走吧，我会一直等着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_e9fc7cea:

    # e "Lothar, can you tell me again about your plan?"
    e "洛萨尔，你能再跟我说一遍你的计划吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_ec398aec:

    # l "You dare to ask me this? After you outright told Ole about our secret plan?"
    l "你竟敢问我这个？你都已经把我们的秘密计划一五一十地告诉奥利了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_04a9cb2b:

    # l "Are you ever on my side."
    l "你有站在我这边过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_cff509a4:

    # e "Uhm... What?"
    e "嗯……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_fe81c907:

    # l "Stop pretending you're innocent in every fucking matter, I trained you, made you an adventurer..."
    l "别他妈在每件事上都装无辜，我训练了你，把你培养成了冒险家……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_8d7be70a:

    # l "And this is how you repaid me?"
    l "你就是这样报答我的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c9778233:

    # l "Fucking stab me in the back?"
    l "他妈的，背后捅我一刀？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_5da9276f:

    # e "I just think Ole deserves to know the truth, I didn't have the heart to lie to him."
    e "我只是觉得奥利有权知道真相，我实在不忍心对他撒谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_2924dde1:

    # l "Fuck off."
    l "滚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_3f00c726:

    # "Lothar leans on the brick wall, he gives you a side eye before looking away..."
    "洛萨尔倚在砖墙上，侧眼瞥了你一下，便移开视线……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_8a9e4785:

    # "The air becomes frozen for a moment as both of you stay silent."
    "你们俩一时无言，空气仿佛凝固了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_86b3bd22:

    # e "I'm sorry, Lothar."
    e "对不起，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_cd7111fc:

    # l "You all are like this, taking my kindness for granted..."
    l "你们一个个都这样，把我的好心当成理所当然……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_f28bfc83:

    # e "I'm... really sorry, Lothar."
    e "我……真的很对不起，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_d823286f:

    # "Lothar continues looking away, but his expression seems to soften a bit."
    "洛萨尔继续移开视线，但他的表情似乎缓和了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_3ae156a1:

    # e "I'm sorrrrry."
    e "对不起起起起——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_365539d0:

    # "You grasp at Lothar's paw, slowly nudges at the fur on the back of his hand."
    "你握住洛萨尔的爪子，缓缓摩挲着他手背上的毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_5fdf179d:

    # e "Hey, Sorry."
    e "嘿，对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_5f9042aa:

    # l "You need to do much better than that..."
    l "你得做得比这好得多……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c016b05d:

    # e "W-what do I need to do? My boss."
    e "我、我该怎么做？老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_82822a0c_1:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_dd94c74d:

    # l "Since when did you learn talking like this..."
    l "你什么时候学会这么说话了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_7b5bb3da:

    # e "When I feel like I'm really really sorry, I guess."
    e "我觉得自己真的真的很抱歉时，大概就会了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_11d6aff0:

    # l "Huh... Well I'm not impressed, yet, disciple."
    l "哼……不过我还没被打动，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_8c6a6bdf:

    # l "And don't you think you can seduce a hero with your big..."
    l "还有，别以为凭你那大……就能诱惑一位英雄……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c0463696:

    # e "Big what?"
    e "大什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_7b2f5349:

    # l "Ahem- No. Back to the topic. The plan."
    l "咳——不，回到正题。计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_478a7ee9:

    # e "Do you accept my apology...?"
    e "你接受我的道歉了吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_ce432d18:

    # l "Y-yes, but watch your back..."
    l "嗯——嗯，但你可得小心身后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_8cdf0324:

    # l "Anyways, the plan. Ask for direction, pretend you're fainting. Get inside, and ask around."
    l "总之，计划就是这样。先找个地方问路，假装自己快要晕倒。混进去之后，再四处打听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_0cf425bf:

    # e "Alright... I'll think about it."
    e "好吧……我会考虑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_71ead04e:

    # l "Don't think for too long. Else, I'll be angry... again."
    l "别想太久。不然我又要生气了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_96b64e6e:

    # e "Look Lothar, I don't know what you want, but that wasn't my fault."
    e "洛萨尔，我不知道你到底想要什么，但那不是我的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_82822a0c_2:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_d272c415:

    # e "Ole was right, you shouldn't even try to spy on the goat tribe at the first place."
    e "奥利说得没错，你一开始就不该试图去山羊部落刺探情报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_35dd8d0c:

    # l "Y-you say what? Fuck you and your devious little tactics."
    l "你——你说什么？去你的，还有你那些阴险的小伎俩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_319586ee:

    # l "Trusting your sweet little lies was a mistake, I don't even know how you became my disciple."
    l "相信你那些甜言蜜语是个错误，我甚至不知道你是怎么成了我徒弟的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c8b30ac3:

    # l "I shouldn't have listened to that lizard, teaching you, mentoring you."
    l "我真不该听那只蜥蜴的话来教你、指导你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_ec117e22:

    # l "And now you stab me in the back and tell me I'm wrong?"
    l "现在你还在背后捅我一刀，反过来说是我错了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_ed28b4e7:

    # e "What I'm telling you is, you are a big dumb wolf!"
    e "要我说，你就是一头又蠢又笨的大笨狼！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_a986cb02:

    # e "And don't you blame me for having an intact, functional brain that can think for itself!"
    e "别因为我有一颗完好、能独立思考的脑子，就把责任推给我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_73f0fb90:

    # "You feel as if you are tired of being a pushover for such a long time."
    "你仿佛已经厌倦了这么久以来一直任人摆布的日子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_fcf694db:

    # "And it somehow feels good. Almost... a relieve."
    "不知为何，这感觉还挺好。几乎……有种解脱感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_857962f5:

    # "But the excitement fades soon when you snap back to reality and see Lothar staring at you..."
    "但当你回过神来，看见洛萨尔正盯着你时，那股兴奋很快便消退了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_9af00f01:

    # l "Y-"
    l "你——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_da755a8c:

    # l "Fuck the fuck off before I fucking stomp you into a pile of useless dragon pulp."
    l "他妈的赶紧给老子滚，不然老子就把你踩成一堆没用的龙渣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_b9bcf94a:

    # l "GET YOUR ASS OFF RIGHT NOW!"
    l "马上给老子滚！！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_377fc751:

    # "You retreat immediately as your sudden momentary courage fades out... and you're left with feeling bad for speaking out."
    "你突如其来的勇气转瞬消退，只得立刻退开……为自己刚才顶嘴而感到难受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_53a30a74:

    # "The wolf doesn't seem to appreciate it as well..."
    "那头狼似乎也并不欣赏这一点……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_e9fc7cea_1:

    # e "Lothar, can you tell me again about your plan?"
    e "洛萨尔，你能再跟我说一遍你的计划吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_58fe2069:

    # l "Yes, it's very simple actually. Ask for direction... somewhere, then pretend you're going to faint."
    l "是的，其实很简单。先找个地方问路，然后假装自己要晕倒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_687031d0:

    # l "Then get inside, ask around. They'll be easy on you because of your badge."
    l "那就进去，四处打听打听。他们看在你徽章的份上，会对你客气些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_33380855:

    # e "...Alright."
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_8d5e9cf8:

    # l "So, what do you say, disciple. Are you going to do me a favour?"
    l "所以，你意下如何，徒儿？愿意帮我这个忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_84f0c0c3:

    # l "Maybe considering I saved your ass from that stone golem?"
    l "要不看在我从那个石魔像手里救过你的份上？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_9e3eae0b:

    # l "I don't usually owe someone a favour, though. If you are curious." nointeract
    l "不过，我可不是经常欠别人人情的。你要是好奇的话。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_0fddf809:

    # e "I'll get into it."
    e "我去办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_b1f58e7b:

    # l "Hmmm... Good."
    l "嗯……很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_0176c746:

    # l "Just remember what I told you, because getting caught might be a little dangerous for you."
    l "记住我告诉你的那些，因为要是被抓到，对你来说可能会有点危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什——什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_1ee8127a:

    # l "I mean surely you wouldn't get caught right?"
    l "我的意思是，你肯定不会被抓到，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_c0fa5750:

    # l "It's like fighting a slime and lose, that's impossible."
    l "这就像和史莱姆战斗还会输一样，根本不可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_863c7354:

    # l "But if you do, well... they probably won't kill a courier."
    l "不过真要是被抓了，嗯……他们大概不会杀一个信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_72a33094_1:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_e53c6fed:

    # e "Alright..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_1f2ea34f:

    # l "Here's the location. Goat Tribe. Let me mark it on your map."
    l "地点在这儿。山羊部落。让我在你的地图上标出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_ae95b06d:

    # l "West to the Outpost..."
    l "哨站西边……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_b5cff9c2:

    # e "Got it. Thanks Lothar. I'll be back soon."
    e "明白了。谢谢你，洛萨尔。我很快就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_b79eb010:

    # e "Maybe... Later?"
    e "也许……晚点再说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_27d26753:

    # e "I need to think about it."
    e "我得考虑一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Invasion_175e28ba:

    # l "Okay then."
    l "那好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_f5072eae:

    # e "Lothar, I'm back from the goats."
    e "洛萨尔，我从山羊部落回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_eb6c705e:

    # l "Oh...?"
    l "哦……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_2a904cc9:

    # l "So what did you find?" nointeract
    l "那你打听到什么了？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_ee1aa985:

    # e "Uhh... I think they were... looking for their guardians..."
    e "呃……我想他们……是在寻找他们的守护者……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_579ab600:

    # l "Hmm?"
    l "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_3558d346:

    # e "The Golem we met, it's their Guardian that got lost somewhere."
    e "我们之前遇到的石魔像，就是他们不知在哪儿走失的守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_8e4c10bc:

    # l "Ah... Their guardian..."
    l "啊……原来是他们的守护者……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_491644e4:

    # l "Alright then."
    l "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_42428af5:

    # l "I'll have to see it for myself."
    l "我得亲自去看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_464e9757:

    # e "Uhm... I didn't find much."
    e "呃……我没发现什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_d80db94b:

    # l "Really?"
    l "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_234fe019:

    # e "Yeah, I just get inside and they seem pretty normal."
    e "嗯，我进去看了看，他们似乎挺正常的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_3778efe1:

    # l "Meh... Alright."
    l "哼……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_d4a433de:

    # e "So... that's it?"
    e "所以……就这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_42055667:

    # l "I guess so."
    l "大概吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_d1aa3b6b:

    # l "If they aren't planning anything, I wouldn't be the one that attacks."
    l "如果他们没打算做什么，我也不会主动出手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_a9516177:

    # l "Did you learn anything about your little friend?"
    l "你那位小伙伴呢？有查到什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_4221f3ab:

    # e "I don't know..."
    e "我不知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_816204f9:

    # l "Alright."
    l "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_34b77199:

    # l "I'll meet you another time then, disciple."
    l "那就改天再见，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Goat_0b9ce1a9:

    # e "See you, Lothar."
    e "回头见，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_63265da8:

    # e "Lothar, do you have some time?"
    e "洛萨尔，你现在有空吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_e2ac1690:

    # l "Disciple, what do you want? Don't you know my time is precious? And what the fuck are you wearing?"
    l "徒弟，你想干什么？你不知道我的时间宝贵得很吗？还有，你他妈穿的是什么鬼东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_e0a8bbac:

    # "Lothar's eyes wandered over to your lower body and you cheeks turn red."
    "洛萨尔的目光移向你的下半身，你的脸颊顿时红了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_6ab3d170:

    # e "Does this look weird? Rahim wants me to get your opinion regarding this set of clothes as adventuring gear. Its stupid, right?"
    e "看起来很奇怪吗？雷希姆想让我听听你对这套冒险服装的看法。很蠢，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_f3862c90:

    # l "Disciple, what are you talking about? This is marvelous. Despite his pissy behaviour, that bull's creations are the best in town."
    l "徒弟，你在说什么？这简直妙极了。先不提那头牛的臭脾气，他做的东西可是镇上最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_4ce6c1cb:

    # l "This armor will provide all the arsenal you need in battle to distract and overcome your opponent."
    l "这套护甲能让你在战斗中分散对手的注意力，并提供击败对手所需的一切手段。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_01_6512c56e:

    # e "... If you say so."
    e "……你这么说的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_589c65f7:

    # l "What is it that you're wearing?"
    l "你穿的到底是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_de7406c0:

    # l "Does it even provide any protection?"
    l "这东西到底能不能提供一点防护？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_ce02f860:

    # e "Well, it's not really an outfit to go fighting in..."
    e "嗯，这可不是什么适合拿去战斗的服装……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_f2ba61d4:

    # l "Hmm, perhaps the lack of protection is intentional."
    l "唔，或许它防护性差是故意设计的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_d38d1ab2:

    # l "That's not a bad way to win some battles."
    l "这倒不失为赢下某些战斗的好办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_04e0394c:

    # l "Disciple, it looks like you've been practicing hard at the art of seduction."
    l "徒儿，看来你最近一直在苦练诱惑人的本事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_57de4d63:

    # l "However, you can't just focus on one style of fighting."
    l "不过，你不能只专注于一种战斗方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_b7edd410:

    # "Lothar closes his eyes and starts to launch into a lecture..."
    "洛萨尔闭上眼睛，开始长篇大论起来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_02_19dcc86a:

    # "You decide to thank him and slip away before he notices."
    "你决定先道声谢，趁他注意到之前悄悄溜走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_d8fcb5c2:

    # l "I have seen combat outfits like that before."
    l "我以前见过类似的战斗服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_83fa63b9:

    # l "Can't say that I'm a fan of it."
    l "但要说我喜欢它，那倒不至于。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_4aa80492:

    # l "They're normally worn by magic users."
    l "这种服装通常是魔法使用者穿的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_eec4515d:

    # l "Real heroes charge in the front. Get it, Disciple?"
    l "真正的英雄会冲在最前面。明白了吗，徒儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_b2267a89:

    # e "Uhmm... Yes?"
    e "呃……明白？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_d5bbc949:

    # l "Now, move so I can continue with my training."
    l "现在走开，让我继续训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_2e5aa5fd:

    # e "What training?"
    e "什么训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Outfit_03_31e14484:

    # l "Endurance training. For if I see that outfit one more second."
    l "耐力训练。免得我再多看那身衣服一秒就撑不住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_a00f4662:

    # l "Disciple, sounds like you've been trying to meddle with the goat business a lot."
    l "徒儿，听起来你最近没少插手山羊的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_bc67ac26:

    # e "Lothar. What do you mean?"
    e "洛萨尔。你这是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_0dccfd08:

    # l "There's something wrong with the goats. I can sense that they're plotting something against our village..."
    l "那些山羊有些不对劲。我能感觉到，它们正在密谋对付我们村子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_5619019c:

    # l "And that goat leader. Doesn't he look a bit suspicious...?"
    l "还有那个山羊首领。你不觉得他看起来有点可疑吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_367e8d46:

    # e "Uhhh... What?"
    e "呃……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_c1236433:

    # l "I need some information, before I decide on my action against the goats as the hero of Lusterfield."
    l "在我以卢斯特菲尔德的大英雄身份决定如何对付那些山羊之前，我需要先弄到一些情报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ab81d4b6:

    # l "It's best we talk about this in the alley."
    l "我们最好去巷子里谈这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_e53c6fed:

    # e "Alright..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_2903783f:

    # e "So, you want me to go to the goat village?"
    e "所以，你是想让我去山羊村？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_a1d6418a:

    # l "Yes. Don't talk too loud, disciple, the lizard might be eavesdropping somewhere..."
    l "没错。徒儿，别说得太大声，那只蜥蜴可能正躲在什么地方偷听……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_9c8db1d0:

    # e "Uhm, why me? Why don't you ask one of your friend..."
    e "呃，为什么是我？你就不能去问问你的朋友吗……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_31a8bb4f:

    # l "Look, they already recognise most of us hero squad. But you're the courier... I think they won't try to kill you."
    l "听着，他们已经认得我们英雄小队里的大多数人了。但你是信使……我觉得他们不会试图杀你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_31157a0e:

    # e "But... uhh... the goats already tried to kill me, the huntsmen."
    e "可是……呃……那些山羊的猎人已经试过要杀我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_bb7723f2:

    # l "Uh no..."
    l "呃，不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_2a2feb78:

    # l "I see you and those huntsmen had a lot of fun in the forest, didn't you?"
    l "我看你和那些猎人在森林里玩得挺开心的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_11210b23:

    # l "Not necessarily trying to kill you in anyway..."
    l "他们也未必会想方设法杀你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_4ba09d77:

    # e "...How did you know?"
    e "……你怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_88ea027a:

    # l "Plus, you owed me last time when you sided with the lion."
    l "再说了，上次你站在那头狮子那边，可是欠我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_eaa5441d:

    # l "I just need to know what's going on, the golem hand, and the whole riverside. They're hiding some secrets..."
    l "我只是想知道到底发生了什么，还有那只石魔像的手，以及整片河岸。他们肯定藏着什么秘密……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_d0a62b32:

    # l "And if they're planning for an attack, we need to at least be prepared."
    l "要是他们正计划发动袭击，我们至少得做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ad369d27:

    # e "Lothar, Furkan told me he's not going for a war."
    e "洛萨尔，弗坎跟我说过，他不打算开战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_4a0a5618:

    # l "Hey, maybe he still holds a grudge after I killed his little father."
    l "嘿，说不定我杀了他那个小老爸之后，他到现在还怀恨在心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_50afd1d4:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_20263385:

    # l "Disciple."
    l "徒儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_9e08f8cd:

    # l "You know I, a hero, saved you from the golem, right?"
    l "你知道吧，我这个英雄可是从石魔像手里救过你的命，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_aff331a0:

    # l "It's time you prove yourself as a decent adventurer, you won't be the hero, of course, but an adventurer for sure."
    l "现在该轮到你证明自己是个合格的冒险者了。当然，你成不了英雄，但当个冒险者肯定没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_858027f5:

    # l "And I've heard your little buddy, Chime? That's who you've been chasing this whole time?"
    l "还有，我听说你有个小伙伴叫齐门？你一直追的就是他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_f7b5d53d:

    # e "What's your plan...?"
    e "你的计划是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_6fcbabd3:

    # l "Just get near the tribe, tell them you are lost or something."
    l "你只要靠近他们的部落，告诉他们你迷路了什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_a2a0ce1a:

    # l "And then pretend you are almost going to faint, just ask for some food, or something."
    l "然后假装自己快要晕倒了，开口向他们要点吃的，或者别的什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_350030fc:

    # e "Ehm... should I bring anything there?"
    e "呃……我要带什么东西过去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_fc109675:

    # l "Well, of course you're not bringing your food there, it wouldn't make sense actually."
    l "当然，你不能把自己的食物带过去，那样其实不合情理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_635639be:

    # l "Just get inside, ask around... And that'll do, ask what happened to their magical stone."
    l "只管进去，四处打听一下……这样就行了，问问他们的魔法石出了什么事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_fe8a7c39:

    # l "Or peek into the ram's room if you can. Of course, you'll have to be sneaky enough."
    l "或者，如果可以的话，偷偷看看那只公羊的房间。当然，你得足够小心才行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_c475020e:

    # l "But generally, a quick tour would suffic-"
    l "不过总的来说，快速转一圈就够——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_bd0d91fb:

    # "You senses a figure overshadows you and Lothar from behind, it's Ole. The wolf instantly turns away from you."
    "你感觉身后有个人影笼罩在你和洛萨尔上方，是奥利。那头狼立刻背过身去，不再面对你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_645bc351:

    # o "What the hell do you think you are doing, Lot."
    o "你他妈的到底想干什么，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_4adbfc47:

    # l "Fuck... Hey, Lizard."
    l "操……嘿，蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_d4dba864:

    # o "Lothar?"
    o "洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_938a8651:

    # l "We're talking about training... advanced sword fighting skills- tactics."
    l "我们在讨论训练……更高阶的剑术技巧——战术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_86bb6a4b:

    # o "No. I've heard you say peek inside something... And a tour?"
    o "不对。我听到你说要进去看看什么……还有转一圈？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_0e709bc8:

    # l "Ahem...Disciple?"
    l "咳……徒儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_546704a4:

    # o "What did the wolf say... [e]." nointeract
    o "那头狼说了什么……[e]。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_95493788:

    # e "Uhm... Lothar asked me to get inside the goat tribe."
    e "呃……洛萨尔让我潜入山羊部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_a4fd08d1:

    # l "No... not again."
    l "不……怎么又来这套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_99992238:

    # l "Look, Ole, it's not what you think."
    l "听着，奥利，事情不是你想的那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_2baea66b:

    # o "What do you mean, getting inside the goat Tribe?"
    o "你说潜入山羊部落？什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_9e8ef008:

    # o "Why would you... Lothar."
    o "你怎么能……洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_149f4d9f:

    # o "Did you just ask [e] to do this stuff for you?"
    o "你刚刚是不是让[e]替你做这些事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_f6d9aabe:

    # l "It was an offer, a consensual offer."
    l "那是我提出的提议，是双方自愿的提议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_b9a69c6e:

    # o "...You're lying again."
    o "……你又在撒谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ac102a3f:

    # o "Don't you ask him the same thing again... you hear me? Now go."
    o "不许你再让他做同样的事……听见没有？现在滚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_cfcacba8:

    # l "What... I go?"
    l "什么……我走？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_01d7ea3a:

    # o "Go back to live out your pretend hero fantasy, Lothar. Don't make me tell you twice."
    o "回去继续做你虚假的英雄美梦吧，洛萨尔。别逼我再说第二遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_0ad5bfe4:

    # l "Huh..."
    l "哼……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_6c68d9d9:

    # o "[e]... don't listen to that wolf's bullshit excuse, he's trying to sway you into doing cheap labour for him."
    o "[e]……别听那头狼的鬼话，他是在哄骗你去替他做廉价苦工。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ebbf17cf:

    # e "I am not sure, I wanted to ask the goats about my friend."
    e "我不太确定，我只是想去问山羊关于我朋友的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_090beca5:

    # o "Look, the goat tribe is too dangerous, we don't know what they'll do to you if you get too close."
    o "听着，山羊部落太危险了。你要是靠得太近，我们谁也不知道他们会对你做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_fc66d641:

    # o "So, just stay, go out and do your usual stuff. I suspect Lothar will ask you the same offer again."
    o "所以，你就留下吧，出去做你平常做的事。我估计洛萨尔还会再次向你提出同样的要求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ee10a53b:

    # o "Come on. We'll think of a much safer way for you to look for your friend."
    o "来吧。我们会想出更安全的办法，让你去找朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_cd4ce2bd:

    # e "Yeah, I don't know."
    e "嗯，我也不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_07abc845:

    # o "..."
    o "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_298503a2:

    # o "Trust me, [e]. It's a road you never want to go."
    o "相信我，[e]。那是一条你绝不想踏上的路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_c9baa047:

    # e "I have to think about it."
    e "我得考虑考虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_eed3837e:

    # o "Look, opportunity will come and you will see your friend soon, just don't take shortcut and get into Lothar's stupid hero business."
    o "机会总会来的，你很快就能见到你的朋友；只是别走捷径，别去掺和洛萨尔那场愚蠢的英雄游戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_72a33094_1:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_5ac7bc35:

    # e "Alright, thanks again, Ole."
    e "好吧，再次谢谢你，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_dddee161:

    # o "Yeah. I'll be here."
    o "嗯，我会在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_df4af617:

    # e "Ole, Lothar just told me to peek inside his pants, or something."
    e "奥利，洛萨尔刚才只是叫我偷看他的裤裆，之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_631312d6:

    # e "And the tour is metaphorical, you know, enormou-"
    e "而且这个“参观”是比喻，你懂的，巨——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_fc0705df:

    # o "Oh... [e]. Why do you have to fuck everyone in the village..."
    o "哦……[e]。你非得把村里每个人都操一遍吗……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_ff634259:

    # e "Hey, he asked me."
    e "嘿，是他主动要求的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_c0048254:

    # e "The thing with Seb was a one-time thing, I promise."
    e "我和塞布那次只是一次性的，我发誓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_9b02e620:

    # l "Wait you fucked the lion?"
    l "等等，你操过那头狮子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_257b5385:

    # o "What? Why didn't you tell me you two have been... fucking."
    o "什么？你们已经……干过了，为什么没告诉我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_4a3766e0:

    # e "We're... uhh... just checking."
    e "我们……呃……只是检查一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_70b3ea66:

    # o "You- Alright. I don't want to know. Don't tell me, don't make me think."
    o "你——好吧。我不想知道。别告诉我，别让我胡思乱想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_da6d7dee:

    # l "Well, lizard, asked and answered."
    l "好吧，蜥蜴，你问了，也得到答案了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_92336af7:

    # "Ole looks as uncomfortable as he can."
    "奥利看起来尴尬得不行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_e7dbc042:

    # o "Uhm... I gotta go."
    o "呃……我得走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_50fe6e24:

    # o "Have fun, you two."
    o "你们两个玩得开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_5e7238f3:

    # l "Ahem... so, good job, disciple."
    l "咳咳……那么，干得不错，徒儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_5799a298:

    # l "Impressive almost, if we count the one time that lowly lion dared to ask you to kick me."
    l "差点就令人刮目相看了，要是把那次也算进去的话——那头低贱的狮子竟敢叫你踢我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_a5337e5a:

    # e "Look, Lothar... I'm still not sure about whole getting into the goat Tribe thing..."
    e "不过，洛萨尔……关于加入山羊部落这件事，我还是拿不准……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_158ff825:

    # e "I'll think about it, later."
    e "这事我晚些时候再考虑吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_b4800b6e:

    # l "Hey, disciple, it's your only chance to prove yourself."
    l "嘿，徒弟，这是你证明自己的唯一机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_cd3bbc9d:

    # e "Alright...Lothar, you're pushing me too hard."
    e "好吧……洛萨尔，你把我逼得太紧了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Invasion_Quest_30666182:

    # l "So, let me know if you're read-... when you're ready."
    l "那么，等你准——……等你准备好了，就告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_ecfd17f1:

    # l "Disciple, I've heard back from Jog and Amble about your training."
    l "徒弟，我已经收到乔格和安布关于你训练的回复了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_38f7fab4:

    # e "Did I pass?"
    e "我够格了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_9002e171:

    # l "You have passed by their standards, but by the hero's standards, you still have a long way to go."
    l "按他们的标准，你已经合格了；但以英雄的标准来看，你还有很长的路要走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0a390f53:

    # l "Amble said that you showed good form during his training."
    l "安布说，你在他的训练中展现出了不错的动作姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_39b1f6b7:

    # l "With enough, you should be as large as he is... or at least that's what Amble thinks."
    l "只要下足功夫，你应该能长得和他一样壮……至少安布是这么想的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_37675825:

    # e "Thanks? I'll continue to work hard."
    e "谢谢？我会继续努力的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_9af5ef95:

    # l "Amble also provides some notes here for you on how to tone your muscles."
    l "安布还在这里给你留了些锻炼肌肉的笔记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_4bec1455:

    # "Lothar hands you what appears to be a drawing of yourself."
    "洛萨尔递给你一幅看起来像是你本人的画。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_7bb05f89:

    # e "This is very nice. I shall thank Amble later."
    e "这真不错。我晚些时候再去谢谢安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_60b1c570:

    # l "Amble said you are a bit unsteady at first."
    l "安布说你刚开始时有点不稳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_86aa6ba8:

    # l "But after some lessons, you starts to get it."
    l "但经过几次指导，你开始掌握窍门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_9ecc73c2:

    # e "I learned a lot from Amble."
    e "我从安布那里学到了很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0871d0d8:

    # l "So... he concludes that you have great potential, but will keep his eyes on you."
    l "所以……他认为你很有潜力，不过还会继续留意你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_1ee2ec0a:

    # l "And... for Jog..."
    l "还有……乔格那边……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0b2d15fc:

    # l "He commented that you are quick on your feet."
    l "他夸你腿脚很麻利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_addb5d09:

    # l "Nice job following through with the plan."
    l "把计划贯彻得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_5d0f1bbd:

    # e "All I did was follow his lead."
    e "我只是跟着他的步调走而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_ae62ea9d:

    # l "He observed that you are light on your feet."
    l "他看出你脚步轻盈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0ef3590b:

    # l "But he says you can use some more practice in your landing."
    l "不过他说，你还得多练练落地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_576d3d1f:

    # l "Then, he drew something that looks like a W here."
    l "然后，他在这里画了个看起来像字母 W 的图案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0887788f:

    # "You believe that is a butt but you say nothing."
    "你明明看出那是屁股，却什么也没说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_6e2794e5:

    # l "So disciple, you and Jog have discovered something important."
    l "所以，徒弟，你和乔格发现了重要的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_7266d719:

    # e "But we're not sure what they..."
    e "但我们还不确定他们……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_91b7aef3:

    # l "The goats are clearly up to no good."
    l "那些山羊显然没安什么好心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_15b69183:

    # l "As the hero predicted, the goats are not trustworthy people."
    l "正如本大英雄所预料的那样，山羊们不值得信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_f69bde0e:

    # l "They said they've been outright and are willing to form a truce."
    l "他们说自己已经坦白了，也愿意休战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_62a910ae:

    # l "But they are still plotting something without telling Lusterfield."
    l "但他们仍在背着卢斯特菲尔德谋划着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_7931cd72:

    # e "But it sounds like they're not really trying to harm Lusterfield."
    e "但听起来，他们似乎并不是真的想伤害卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_cd794762:

    # l "You have helped saved one of their own and take down their rampaging golem."
    l "你救了他们中的一个，还打倒了那只横冲直撞的石魔像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0c674126:

    # l "You'd think that will help you earn their trust."
    l "你以为这样就能赢得他们的信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_e0c31ea7:

    # l "Clearly, everything is a front with the goats."
    l "很明显，山羊们的一切都是伪装。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_5191b36e:

    # l "They are not as forthcoming as this Hero."
    l "他们可不像本大英雄这般坦率。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_21f55ede:

    # l "The goats are clearly still wary of outsiders."
    l "显然，山羊们仍然对外来者心存戒备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_3b37e225:

    # l "You've been invited into their tribes, but they didn't really reveal anything to you."
    l "你已经受邀进入他们的部落，但他们并没有真正向你透露任何事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_a70346a2:

    # l "This showcases a lack of trust."
    l "这正是不信任的表现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_cee9579a:

    # "You feel rather guilty that you didn't tell the truth earlier."
    "你为自己之前没有说实话而感到相当内疚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0019737f:

    # l "Something is fishy. Perhaps they have something to do with the golem attack at the river."
    l "这事很蹊跷。也许河边那次石魔像袭击和他们有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_6ebf581b:

    # l "I wouldn't put it past them."
    l "我一点也不会觉得是他们干的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_0d05c3be:

    # l "I know I can count on Jog to infiltrate into the goat tribe."
    l "我知道可以指望乔格潜入山羊部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_1b7451b6:

    # l "You... still have more to learn from him, Disciple."
    l "你……还得多向他学学，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_cdf3ee5c:

    # l "After you dared to argue with me last time. Now I got you to go there either way."
    l "上次你竟敢跟为师顶嘴。现在还不是被我想办法送去了那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_5a81f3de:

    # l "But thanks to you two, now we have this valuable info."
    l "不过，多亏了你们两个，我们现在有了这份宝贵的情报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_be721b65:

    # e "But we don't know what to do with it..."
    e "但我们不知道该拿它怎么办……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_347537b7:

    # l "Either way, it is clear that the goats are up to coming."
    l "不管怎样，很明显山羊们正准备搞事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_a6fb820c:

    # l "The hero will naturally thwart them."
    l "本大英雄自然会挫败他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_5ab30c4e:

    # l "They mention something about the caravan?"
    l "他们提到商队了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_399607c2:

    # e "Yes, I believe so. Something about the attack that doesn't sit right with them."
    e "是的，我想是吧。他们对那场袭击似乎有些疑虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_23d5111c:

    # l "They have so much blood on their hands. Of course, it would never sit right with them."
    l "他们手上沾了那么多血，当然怎么都无法安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_929c75e5:

    # l "So, the Hero will look further into this."
    l "所以，本大英雄会继续调查此事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_b0f341a9:

    # l "Do not worry now... I will handle everything... Heh."
    l "现在不用担心……一切交给我处理……嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_21c94aca:

    # l "And..."
    l "然后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_d4286f7e:

    # "Lothar coughs and then straightens himself."
    "洛萨尔咳了咳，然后挺直身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_79222641:

    # "You believe he is examining your body."
    "你觉得他正在打量你的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_52d929a9:

    # l "Ahem. Both Jog and Amble suggest that you join us for the special training."
    l "咳嗯。安布和乔格都建议你加入我们的特别训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_14abcdb8:

    # l "They think you'll be an interesting asset."
    l "他们觉得你会成为一份有趣的助力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_9c056960:

    # e "What is the special training?"
    e "特别训练是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_4cd0f256:

    # "You believe you see Lothar's cheeks redden slightly."
    "你仿佛看到洛萨尔的脸颊微微泛红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_22b7d9b6:

    # l "It is a group training that is currently between us."
    l "这是目前只在我们之间进行的团体训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_1294872c:

    # l "Jog has specially mentioned that you will have a lot to contribute to the training."
    l "乔格特别提到，你能为这次训练贡献很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_3993c3c6:

    # "Maybe you have imagined it, but there appears to be a stress when Lothar said the word, a lot."
    "也许只是你的错觉，但洛萨尔说到“很多”时，似乎特意加重了语气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_f0c0894f:

    # e "It sounds fun. If the training can help with my adventure, I'm all for it."
    e "听起来挺有意思的。只要这项训练能助我冒险，我当然愿意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_c43d4d70:

    # l "Not so fast, Disciple."
    l "别急，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_ae408075:

    # l "They might have suggested that you can join."
    l "他们或许提过可以让你加入。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_5aa71d2d:

    # l "But my judgement on you is still out."
    l "但我还没有对你下定论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_3728a917:

    # l "You need to prove yourself further."
    l "你还需要进一步证明自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_be1533d7:

    # e "How can I do that?"
    e "我该怎么证明？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_6eee1048:

    # l "I haven't thought about it yet..."
    l "这个嘛……我还没想好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Report_Amble_Jog_76a80ea3:

    # l "Now, leave the hero in front of you to his thoughts."
    l "现在，先让面前的英雄自己想想吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_b8d70634:

    # l "Those two? They are good company."
    l "他俩？是不错的伙伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_4e3bc616:

    # l "Amble can be a bit gullible and Jog sometimes takes thing too lightly."
    l "安布有点容易轻信，乔格有时做事太不当回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_47c8b60e:

    # "You think to yourself. 'They don't sound that reliable'."
    "你心想：“听起来，他们好像不太可靠。”"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_bea7af26:

    # l "However, they are very good at their job."
    l "不过，他们各自都很擅长自己的工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_3c09c96d:

    # l "For example, Amble can crush the training dummy with one direct smash."
    l "比如，安布一记正面猛击就能把训练假人砸碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_557a2e00:

    # l "Jog can shoot through its head from a mile away."
    l "乔格能从一英里外射穿它的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_3e1a05bd:

    # l "However, neither of them is a match for me."
    l "不过，他们俩都不是我的对手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_f7c09558:

    # "Lothar puffs up his chest proudly."
    "洛萨尔得意地挺起胸膛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_a764de8f:

    # l "You're going to be fine because you lost to the hero as well. You're in good company."
    l "你也输给过这位英雄，所以不用担心。至少你还有他们作伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_8e25979f:

    # l "Similar to you, they have not beaten the hero in a battle either."
    l "和你一样，他们也没能在战斗中击败这位英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_bef6165e:

    # l "I doubt you can win either of them, so in a way, you would still have lost to this hero."
    l "我怀疑你也赢不了他们中的任何一个，所以某种意义上，你还是输给了这位英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_70e07659:

    # l "Uhh... They will prove that your win last time is just a lucky coincidence..."
    l "呃……他们会证明你上次的胜利只不过是走运碰巧而已……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_864fa840:

    # l "In any case, since they call me their Boss, I have a responsibility to watch over them."
    l "不管怎么说，既然他们叫我老大，我就有责任照看他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_1376ca92:

    # e "That's very nice of you, Lothar."
    e "你人真不错，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_325beb27:

    # "Lothar's cheeks redden a bit at your compliment. He coughs to cover it."
    "你一夸他，洛萨尔的脸颊微微泛红。他咳嗽几声，想把这掩饰过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_f5eb309e:

    # l "This is nothing, Disciple. It's part of my job as the hero of Lusterfield."
    l "这没什么，徒弟。这是我作为卢斯特菲尔德英雄的职责。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_49738d93:

    # l "Speaking of, Disciple. They seem to have a less-than-favorable view of you."
    l "说起来，徒弟。他们似乎不太看得起你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_a247e6aa:

    # e "Why would they think that?"
    e "他们为什么会这么想？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_4d21639f:

    # l "No idea."
    l "不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_2a5603fb:

    # "Lothar shrugs."
    "洛萨尔耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_a88199e7:

    # l "However, I need you to prove to them that no Disciple of this hero is a weakling."
    l "不过，我需要你向他们证明，这位英雄的徒弟可不是弱者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_9d7658d3:

    # l "So... Go on solo training with each of them."
    l "所以……分别和他们单独训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Amble_Jog_83871318:

    # l "Don't let me down, Disciple."
    l "别让我失望，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_06ccd779:

    # l "Hmm... Ahoy! Little disciple, Don't see you often in the tavern. Down to drink a few beer?"
    l "嗯……嘿！小徒弟，我不常在酒馆见到你。要不要喝几杯啤酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_524f102e:

    # e "Hey... Lothar. I heard you'd go to tavern at night."
    e "嘿……洛萨尔。我听说你晚上会来酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_09d2a1aa:

    # l "You are right. Try some beer, it's the best in the whole continent."
    l "你说得对。尝尝啤酒吧，这是整个大陆最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_119f8b57:

    # l "Hey, Cane. Get some beer, for this little guy here."
    l "嘿，凯恩。给这小家伙来点啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_05643719:

    # c "Aye, Lot. I reckon this lad worked in our tavern before, he probably should be serving ya ass instead."
    c "是啊，洛。我看这小子以前在我们酒馆干过，不如让他来伺候你这家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_13e59131:

    # l "Hmm... A server? And I thought you were an adventurer like me. How disappointing." nointeract
    l "嗯……服务生？我还以为你和我一样是个冒险家。真让人失望。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_be2f8761:

    # e "Hey... I was just working for Cane because I don't have any money on me. I really don't like doing it."
    e "嘿……我只是因为身上没钱，才给凯恩干活。我真的不喜欢这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_a3a7ff58:

    # l "The Cane I know aren't that guy to force someone to work for money, ya seriously trying to fool me or what."
    l "我认识的凯恩可不是会强迫别人为了钱干活的人。你是在认真糊弄我，还是怎么着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_c34abcd0:

    # c "Lot, Ya really should come here on daytime, this thirsty lad is seriously trying to seduce all his customers or something."
    c "洛，你真该白天来。这个饥渴的小子正认真地勾引所有客人什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b8d32fe9:

    # e "No... I didn't."
    e "不……我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_633b90d9:

    # l "Well, I'll take Cane's word for it. Let me know when you come to work again, I'll totally let you serve me."
    l "好吧，我就信凯恩的话。你下次再来干活时告诉我一声，我一定要让你伺候我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_2b68d44f:

    # e "Look, I can go for some side hustle, can't I. Besides, serving people is really fun."
    e "看吧，我做点兼职总没问题吧？再说，招待客人真的挺有意思的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_3e0eab8a:

    # l "I see, I see. You definitely need to hone your serving skill though, because I don't see you serving me here."
    l "我明白了，我明白了。不过你确实得好好磨炼一下服务人的本事，因为我可没见你在这儿伺候过我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_6ccc494e:

    # c "Hah, the apron fit yer ass at least, come here more often, we all need yer sweet ass."
    c "哈哈，至少这围裙挺合你屁股。多来几次吧，大家可都需要你那迷人的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_8fcbc8d4:

    # l "Hey, Cane. You forgot about the beer thing?"
    l "嘿，凯恩。你是不是忘了啤酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_471f70f3:

    # c "Ye, ye. Shut up Lot. I'm brewing the finest stuff here."
    c "行了行了，闭嘴，洛。我正在酿这里最好的酒呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_9054a985:

    # c "Here it is, one for our hero, and one for our lowly server."
    c "来了，一杯给咱们的英雄，一杯给咱们卑微的服务生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_1a8e1587:

    # e "Hey... Why am I lowly."
    e "嘿……为什么我是卑微的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_a0c0d6ce:

    # c "Cause yer not the hero."
    c "因为你不是英雄呗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_a725761e:

    # c "Aye, Lot. Here's yer beer. And here's one for our new proper lad, [e]."
    c "是啊，洛。这是你的啤酒。还有一杯给咱们新来的正经小伙子，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_d54c3f1c:

    # e "Thank you Cane. This tavern is actually really cozy."
    e "谢谢你，凯恩。这家酒馆其实真的很舒适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b958372d:

    # c "Look, I need someone to help me take care of the tavern, [e]. Serving food and drink to our misters and misses."
    c "[e]，我需要个人帮忙打理酒馆。给各位先生女士端酒送餐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_dfe8d92a:

    # e "Hmm... me?"
    e "嗯……我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_ca0a3001:

    # c "Ya look like a proper candidate, real perfect size. Let me know when yer interested."
    c "你看起来就是个合适的人选，身材尺寸也正好。感兴趣就告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_ffb1ef5c:

    # e "A-alright, maybe next time?"
    e "好、好的，也许下次？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_7a8ad778:

    # l "Thanks for the beer anyway, Cane."
    l "不管怎样，啤酒谢了，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_8395d446:

    # c "You are Welcome, let's see. I'm gonna serve the others while you two chit chat. Alright?"
    c "不客气，我去招待其他人，你们俩慢慢聊。行吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_44fbec2c:

    # l "Ya."
    l "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_9936233d:

    # e "See you, Cane."
    e "回头见，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_48c57f87:

    # l "Hmm... Like the beer?"
    l "嗯……啤酒怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bbd7872e:

    # e "A little bitter for my taste, not that I've drank it before."
    e "对我来说有点苦，虽然我以前没喝过啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_1f837df0:

    # l "You'll get used to it, you all do."
    l "你们都会习惯的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e6e5a130:

    # l "Speaking of which, let me introduce my comrade to you. They're coming back right now I believe."
    l "说到这个，我来给你介绍一下我的战友。他们应该马上就回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_1abf65ea:

    # "As you look behind, you see two beefy dudes at the tavern door, walking toward you and Lothar. Lothar waves at them in excitement."
    "你回头一看，只见酒馆门口有两个壮硕的家伙，正朝你和洛萨尔走来。洛萨尔兴奋地向他们挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b15b28db:

    # "One of them seems like a red bear, and the other a hyena. They both hold a few meat in their hands, throwing them on the table."
    "其中一个像头红熊，另一个像只鬣狗。他们手里都拿着几块肉，走过来把肉扔在桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bdc6a726:

    # comrade "Lot, who is this new guy over here."
    comrade "洛哥，这边这个新来的小家伙是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_09172bb3:

    # "Both of them stand behind Lothar, staring at you with suspicion."
    "两人站在洛萨尔身后，满怀戒备地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_f5398a5c:

    # l "He's [e]. This is Jog, and that's Amble."
    l "他叫[e]。这位是乔格，那边的是安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_67e9e342:

    # jog "Oh, Lot you brought a new member or what.. Nice to meet you though, [e]."
    jog "哦，洛萨尔，你这是带了个新人来吗……不过，认识你很高兴，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_626bc394:

    # e "Nice to meet you, Jog. And nice to meet you too, Amble."
    e "很高兴认识你，乔格。也很高兴认识你，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_ebe2b749:

    # amble "Hmm... has he proven himself to be capable enough to join us."
    amble "嗯……他已经证明自己有足够的能力加入我们了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_9bc5a1c2:

    # l "No, he's not joining us. He's still got a long way to go to prove himself."
    l "不，他还没加入我们。他还有很长的路要走，才能证明自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_eceb32db:

    # l "Talking about proof... You got your courier badge yet?" nointeract
    l "说到证明……你的信使徽章拿到了吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_5433d9ff:

    # e "Hmm... Yes."
    e "嗯……拿到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_534287c1:

    # l "Ahhh.... I see that on your chest now. It's got your face in it, isn't it. Ole really did something."
    l "啊……我现在看到你胸口的徽章了。上面有你的脸，对吧？奥利还真有两下子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bd70add0:

    # amble "I'd get his cute little face in my chest, like right now."
    amble "真想现在就把他那张可爱的小脸抱进怀里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_39e746d6:

    # l "Hey, he's mine. Go get your diciple somewhere else."
    l "喂，他是我的。你去别处找你的徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_9b507588:

    # jog "Not gonna lie though, where did you find this little fella."
    jog "不过说真的，这位小家伙是从哪儿来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_4669f86f:

    # l "He's from that lizard, told me he's another outsider or something."
    l "是那只蜥蜴带来的，他说这家伙好像也是个外来者之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_582fb40c:

    # l "Wait... Where's your badge... [e]?"
    l "等等……你的徽章呢……[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b0d87b44:

    # e "Uhh... I forgot about it."
    e "呃……我忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_27276135:

    # l "Are you really lying to me again? You moron..."
    l "你还真敢再骗我？你这个蠢货……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_27c51ad9:

    # e "Hmm... I'm sorry about that Lothar, I think I haven't finished Ole's quest yet."
    e "嗯……抱歉，洛萨尔，我想我还没完成奥利的任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_5c3f7a84:

    # jog "Hey, he's just a kid, Lot. I'm sure he didn't mean it."
    jog "嘿，他只是个孩子，洛哥。我肯定他不是故意的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bfa51bcd:

    # l "Whatever, I'm gonna need more beer after talking with this... kid."
    l "随便吧，跟这个……小鬼头说完话，我得再来几杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_92f1e906:

    # e "Hmmph... I've got to do other things now... I gotta take off, Lothar, and you guys."
    e "嗯……我现在还有别的事要做……我得走了，洛萨尔，还有各位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_a9ebacb2:

    # l "Good, if you stayed for one more minute I'll make sure you get the taste of a real kick in the nuts."
    l "很好，要是你再待一分钟，我保证让你尝尝被狠狠踢中蛋蛋的滋味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_f2aaaa0b:

    # amble "He meant see you later. Good night, [e]."
    amble "他是说回头见。晚安，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_774462ee:

    # e "Good Night."
    e "晚安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_3b6410c2:

    # "Looking at Lothar's annoyed face, you decided it's better for your safety to leave the three drinking their beer in peace."
    "看着洛萨尔那张恼火的脸，你觉得为了自身安全，还是别打扰他们三个喝啤酒为好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_259b479f:

    # l "Ahhh.... it's in your bag now. It's got your face in it, isn't it. Ole really did something."
    l "啊……它现在在你的包里了。上面有你的脸，对吧？奥利还真有两下子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_6345a08f:

    # jog "I'd get his cute little face in my bag, like right now."
    jog "我真想现在就把他那张可爱的小脸装进我的包里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_39e746d6_1:

    # l "Hey, he's mine. Go get your diciple somewhere else."
