    # amble "He meant see you later. Good night, [e]."
    amble "他是说回头见。晚安，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_774462ee_1:

    # e "Good Night."
    e "晚安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e3d14324:

    # amble "Outsider? I thought he was from the Goat, look at his horn."
    amble "外乡人？我还以为他来自山羊部落呢，你看他的犄角。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_183f52d8:

    # l "Surely it's something. The lizard asked me to take care of this guy, teach him some stuff."
    l "肯定有点来头。那只蜥蜴让我照看这家伙，再教他点东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_04071065:

    # e "Hmm... may I say something-"
    e "嗯……我能插句话——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e6d99e85:

    # l "No. Let me finish with you, And I'll let you go, eh?"
    l "不。让我把话跟你说完，之后就放你走，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_835b5c68:

    # e "Alright, Lothar."
    e "好吧，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_4bd2de9c:

    # l "I'm telling you, come here more often. We'll talk about some informal training with you. Get you stronger to fend off your enemy or something."
    l "我说，你应该多来这里。我们可以和你聊聊非正式训练的事，让你变得更强，好对付你的敌人之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_5a0c001f:

    # l "It's not easy watching you managing to lose to a little slime."
    l "看着你居然输给一小只史莱姆，可真不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_24636614:

    # e "How did you.... know."
    e "你怎么……知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_32f7f518:

    # l "I mean, look at those stains of slime on you down there. Gotta wash it off completely tonight, [e]."
    l "我是说，看看你下面还沾着那些史莱姆留下的痕迹。今晚可得把它们彻底洗干净，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_254b2010:

    # e "Lothar, can we not talk about this in front of everyone..."
    e "洛萨尔，能不能别在大家面前说这个……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_c9514aae:

    # e "I'm not sure I want to fight the dummy again, Lothar."
    e "我不太想再和人偶打架了，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_cd59b4af:

    # l "Ahem, I'll make him stronger for your level, alright. Plus, if you're strong enough, you can attempt dueling me."
    l "咳，我会把人偶调到适合你等级的强度，行了吧。另外，等你足够强了，还可以试着和我决斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_987e3d37:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e1a40d4e:

    # jog "Look, [e]. Lot is putting in some precious time for you. You better pay him back when you actually get stronger."
    jog "你看，[e]。洛萨尔可是特意抽出宝贵时间来帮你。等你真正变强了，可得好好回报他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_0da43084:

    # amble "Yeah, you don't even look like a courier right now. Better step up your game before you get eaten by some monster elsewhere."
    amble "是啊，你现在看起来根本不像个信使。最好提升提升实力，免得在别的地方被什么怪物吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bad30a84:

    # e "I guess... Thanks Lothar."
    e "我想是吧……谢谢你，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_98a4eced:

    # l "Good. Now, why not leave me and my guys in peace. We'll catch up later, [e]."
    l "很好。现在，你就别打扰我和我的伙计们了。我们之后再聊，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_3cdf02a7:

    # e "Alright, see you."
    e "好，回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_52c36b9b:

    # e "No... I haven't finished it yet."
    e "不……我还没完成呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_14fa7471:

    # l "[e], that was really a low lie. You have your badge on your chest right now. Who are you even lying to?"
    l "[e]，你这谎撒得也太低级了。你的差客徽章现在就挂在胸口上。你到底是在骗谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_ef32a34c:

    # e "Uh... Sorry I forgot about it."
    e "呃……抱歉，我忘了这回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_c197a0f7:

    # l "It doesn't even make sense, [e]. You're just messing with me now aren't you. Aren't you funny. You feel better about yourself messing with the hero?"
    l "这根本说不通，[e]。你现在是在拿我寻开心，对吧？真有你的。拿英雄开玩笑让你感觉好点了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_d81dcd14:

    # l "Whatever you wish. You're lucky you have that lizard watching your back... Look, he even made the badge out of your face."
    l "随你便。你有那只蜥蜴替你撑腰，算你走运……看，他甚至把你的脸做成了徽章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_3a197778:

    # jog "I'd get his cute little face in my chest, like right now."
    jog "真想现在就把他那张可爱的小脸抱进怀里，就现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b27fe828:

    # l "Hey, he's mine, you flake. Go get your diciple somewhere else."
    l "喂，他是我的，你这呆瓜。去别处找你的徒弟吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_4dc42b5f_1:

    # amble "Not gonna lie though, where did you find this little fella."
    amble "不瞒你说，这小家伙是从哪儿找到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_12db68b7:

    # l "He's from the lizard, told me he's another outsider or something."
    l "他是那只蜥蜴带来的，说他好像也是个外来者之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_476f07d4:

    # l "[e], I can see the courier badge in your messager bag right now. Who are you even lying to?"
    l "[e]，我现在就能看到你信使包里的差役徽章。你到底是在骗谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_ef32a34c_1:

    # e "Uh... Sorry I forgot about it."
    e "呃……抱歉，我忘了这回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_43590ed7:

    # l "It doesn't even make sense, [e]. You're just messing with me now aren't you. Aren't you funny? You feel better about yourself messing with the hero?"
    l "这根本说不通，[e]。你现在是在拿我寻开心，对吧？你很得意吗？拿英雄开玩笑让你感觉好些了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_d81dcd14_1:

    # l "Whatever you wish. You're lucky you have that lizard watching your back... Look, he even made the badge out of your face."
    l "随你怎么说。算你有那只蜥蜴在背后撑腰……看，他甚至还用你的脸做了徽章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_6345a08f_1:

    # jog "I'd get his cute little face in my bag, like right now."
    jog "我现在就想把他那张可爱的小脸装进我的包里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_b27fe828_1:

    # l "Hey, he's mine, you flake. Go get your diciple somewhere else."
    l "嘿，他是我的，你这个呆瓜。去别处找你的徒弟吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_4dc42b5f_2:

    # amble "Not gonna lie though, where did you find this little fella."
    amble "不瞒你说，这小家伙是从哪儿找到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_12db68b7_1:

    # l "He's from the lizard, told me he's another outsider or something."
    l "他是那只蜥蜴带来的，说他好像也是个外来者之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_3c6a12e9:

    # l "Well, you haven't finished my training for you, of course you don't have the badge."
    l "嗯，你还没完成我的训练呢，当然没有徽章了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_1aa7ddf8:

    # l "Hmm... You haven't finished with the others yet?"
    l "唔……你还没完成其他人的训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_0d1c16af:

    # e "I was out adventuring after your training. Lothar."
    e "我完成你的训练后就出去冒险了，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e6d2a4a5:

    # l "Hmm... well then keep up with your training! Don't even think about slacking off."
    l "嗯……那就继续训练！想都别想偷懒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_dc76c27d:

    # jog "So... Lot, where did you find this little fella?"
    jog "所以……洛萨尔，你是从哪儿找到这个小家伙的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_12db68b7_2:

    # l "He's from the lizard, told me he's another outsider or something."
    l "他是那只蜥蜴带来的，说他好像也是个外来者之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e3d14324_1:

    # amble "Outsider? I thought he was from the Goat, look at his horn."
    amble "外来者？我还以为他来自山羊部落呢，你看他的角。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_183f52d8_1:

    # l "Surely it's something. The lizard asked me to take care of this guy, teach him some stuff."
    l "肯定是有点什么。那只蜥蜴让我照顾这个家伙，教他一些东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_04071065_1:

    # e "Hmm... may I say something-"
    e "嗯……我能说句话——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_e6d99e85_1:

    # l "No. Let me finish with you, And I'll let you go, eh?"
    l "不行。让我把你的事说完，我就放你走，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_835b5c68_1:

    # e "Alright, Lothar."
    e "好吧，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_4bd2de9c_1:

    # l "I'm telling you, come here more often. We'll talk about some informal training with you. Get you stronger to fend off your enemy or something."
    l "我说，你得更常来这里。我们可以跟你聊聊非正式训练的事。让你变得更强，好对付你的敌人之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_5a0c001f_1:

    # l "It's not easy watching you managing to lose to a little slime."
    l "看着你居然输给一只小小的史莱姆，可真不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_24636614_1:

    # e "How did you.... know."
    e "你怎么……知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_32f7f518_1:

    # l "I mean, look at those stains of slime on you down there. Gotta wash it off completely tonight, [e]."
    l "我的意思是，看看你下面身上那些史莱姆留下的污渍。今晚得把它们彻底洗掉，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_254b2010_1:

    # e "Lothar, can we not talk about this in front of everyone..."
    e "洛萨尔，能不能别在大家面前谈这个……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_c9514aae_1:

    # e "I'm not sure I want to fight the dummy again, Lothar."
    e "我不太想再和人偶打架了，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_cd59b4af_1:

    # l "Ahem, I'll make him stronger for your level, alright. Plus, if you're strong enough, you can attempt dueling me."
    l "咳，我会把人偶的实力调整到适合你等级的程度，行了吧？而且，只要你足够强，就可以试着和我决斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_987e3d37_1:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_8fafdc8b:

    # jog "Look, [e]. Lot is putting in some precious time for you. You should really pay him back when you get stronger."
    jog "你看，[e]。洛哥可是特意抽出宝贵时间来训练你。等你变强了，真该好好回报他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_0da43084_1:

    # amble "Yeah, you don't even look like a courier right now. Better step up your game before you get eaten by some monster elsewhere."
    amble "对啊，你现在看起来根本不像个信使。最好提升实力，免得在别处被什么怪物吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Night_Greet_bad30a84_1:

