translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_02a26847:

    # e "Wait... I thought our training was us brawling and practicing together?"
    e "等等……我还以为我们的训练是一起切磋、一起练习？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_6589b419:

    # l "Who do you think I am, some kind of low-life who have nothing to do? I have a village to protect."
    l "你以为我是什么人，一个无所事事的下三滥吗？我可是有整个村子要保护的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_1b7cfda3:

    # l "Does this look like a tutorial to you? Do I really need to hold your hand to fight?"
    l "你觉得这是新手教程吗？难道打架还真要我手把手教你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_29f048ed:

    # e "No... but you can teach me something useful?"
    e "不……但你能不能先教我点有用的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_1d3b9ab5:

    # l "Alright, you needy fur lizard."
    l "好吧，你这个缠人的毛蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_02b8df2e:

    # l "We have different types of weapons, sword, axe and bow, all different for different usages."
    l "我们有各种各样的武器，剑、斧头和弓，各自适用于不同的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_c7bc0778:

    # l "For example, you'd be better off shooting bow at things that fly, because you won't get close to them to use your weapon until they kill you and dump you in the middle of the road."
    l "比如，遇到会飞的东西，最好用弓射它们；不然你还没能靠近、拿武器攻击它们，它们就会先杀了你，把你丢在路中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_8820adf7:

    # e "Got it. So I need a sword, axe and bow with me for special occasions."
    e "明白了。所以遇到特殊情况，我得随身带着剑、斧头和弓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_28d2616b:

    # l "Sure. I prefer sword, easy, simple, no mess hanging around."
    l "没错。我更喜欢剑，简单趁手，也不用带着一堆碍事的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_39a282bf:

    # l "Back to the main point, battles. The aim of a battle is of course, defeating your opponents. I'm sure you know that."
    l "回到正题，战斗。战斗的目标当然是击败对手，这点我相信你知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_4c6eb46d:

    # e "Hmm, this I know."
    e "嗯，这个我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_47f1a5f8:

    # l "Stop cutting off, disciple. You normally have two ways to defeat them, make their physical health go down, or make their arousal go up."
    l "别打断我，小徒弟。通常有两种击败他们的方式：让他们的体力下降，或者让他们的性兴奋度上升。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_aac4925a:

    # e "Hmm... what do you mean arousal?"
    e "嗯……你说的性兴奋是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_98959672:

    # l "You know what I mean, something like teasing your opponents, making them flush or something."
    l "你懂的，比如调戏对手，让他们脸红之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_fac725ca:

    # e "But how will this defeat my enemies?"
    e "可这样怎么能打败我的敌人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_1f279920:

    # l "People in this world are easily aroused, outsider. If you're really charming then the enemies will gravitate towards submitting to you."
    l "这个世界的人很容易被挑起情欲，外乡人。只要你足够有魅力，敌人自然会主动向你屈服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_cca62d87:

    # e "Hmmph... what a weird world. Is this how you defeated the goat leader?"
    e "哼……真是个奇怪的世界。难道你就是这样打败山羊头领的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_99a9f456:

    # l "W-what? I'm the hero of lusterfield, a-alright. I don't do dirty tricks."
    l "什、什么？我可是卢斯特菲尔德的英雄，行、行了吧。我才不会耍阴招。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_8feaeffd:

    # "Lothar crosses his arm much harder, you can clearly see him awkwardly trying to shift topic. You can imagine that if it was true, that would be a messed up situation."
    "洛萨尔把双臂交叉得更紧了，你清楚地看出他正尴尬地试图转移话题。你可以想象，要是那是真的，情况可就太糟糕了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_2aa99488:

    # l "Ahem. Anyways, you can try to escape, or if you are tired you can just surrender yourself to the enemy."
    l "咳。总之，你可以试着逃跑；要是累了，也可以直接向敌人投降。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_e15fefdc:

    # l "It probably leads to bad things though, so I won't advice you to do that."
    l "但那样多半会招来麻烦，所以我就不劝你这么做了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_55f4b428:

    # e "Yes... They'd steal all my gold."
    e "是啊……他们会把我的钱全抢走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_66fd0c86:

    # l "Ha, not all of them, but if you make them angry you better be very sorry."
    l "哈，也不至于全都这样，不过要是惹恼了他们，你最好好好赔罪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_eb219ae7:

    # l "Also, Abilities, or spells. Those that requires some amount of magic."
    l "还有技能，或者说法术——那些需要消耗一定魔力的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_71cab8de:

    # e "Yes, I know... hmm... Self Heal and Fortify? Is that it?"
    e "是的，我知道……嗯……“自愈”和“设防”？就这两个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_aaa3fbac:

    # l "You'd probably learn more along your journey anyway, I'm not a magic user so don't think I'll teach you any spells."
    l "反正你在旅途中大概还会学到更多。我不是魔法使用者，所以别指望我教你什么法术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_27051342:

    # l "However, my practice dummy has a little magic to it, it can simulate fighting a battle with you."
    l "不过我的训练人偶带着一点魔法，能模拟和你战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_666bc26c:

    # l "So... I want you to defeat the dummy in the alleyway. If you win, he'll give you a patch."
    l "那么……我要你打败巷子里的训练人偶。赢了的话，它会给你一块布章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_89f1fec1:

    # e "Hmm... can I not? I already know how to fight."
    e "嗯……可以不去吗？我已经知道怎么战斗了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_619228dc:

    # l "Yeah... Sure. How about that, you probably don't know how to fight the other way, if you defeat your dummy, I'll show you what I know about flirting."
    l "好啊……这样吧，你大概还不知道另一种战斗方式。你要是能打败人偶，我就让你见识一下我所知道的调情技巧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_93d1c41d:

    # e "What about flirting?"
    e "调情呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_611ca771:

    # l "Something like this..."
    l "比如这样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_0151ee6f:

    # "Lothar directs his finger on your chest until it barely touches, your heart suddenly jumps as he slides his finger lower. You shudder at his touch."
    "洛萨尔伸出手指，朝你的胸口探去，直到几乎触碰到你；他的手指向下滑时，你的心猛地一跳。你在他的触碰下打了个寒战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_ba477b17:

    # "He seems to be oddly amused by your reaction, looking you up and down."
    "他似乎觉得你的反应格外有趣，目光上下打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_eb615820:

    # l "Look, defeat the dummy, and we'll talk."
    l "听着，先打败人偶，我们再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Training_0dfa31be:

    # e "O-Okay, Lothar."
    e "好、好的，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_3e4287a4:

    # e "Lothar, I'm back from the practice."
    e "洛萨尔，我练完回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_19ad34a8:

    # l "Are you? Let me ask that dummy if you won or lost."
    l "是吗？让我去问问那个人偶你到底赢了还是输了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_9c09e4cc:

    # "Lothar walks into the alleyway, a few seconds later he came back, giggling at your confused look."
    "洛萨尔走进小巷。几秒后，他笑嘻嘻地走了回来，似乎在对你困惑的表情咯咯发笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_3d09b669:

    # l "He told me you got beaten up pretty badly, didn't you?"
    l "它告诉我，你被揍得挺惨的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_3d2a8cab:

    # e "Well I just get closer for the dummy to hit me, I didn't know it'd hurt that much..."
    e "我只是凑得离人偶近了些，没想到它打起来会那么疼……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_017cb340:

    # l "Sure you did. If I was practicing, I won't be letting that dummy touch me anywhere."
    l "你当然会这么说。要是换作我训练，绝不会让那个人偶碰到我半点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_f75721ca:

    # e "That would make it a one-sided fight."
    e "那就成单方面的战斗了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_73254cfe:

    # l "What do you know about fights anyway, [e]. I'm not some beginners at battles, I had been fighting for the majority of my life."
    l "你又懂什么战斗，[e]。我可不是什么战斗初学者，我这辈子大半时间都在战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_f90de23a:

    # l "This dummy, it's getting old. It's been here for like what? 19 years? Almost older than you."
    l "这个人偶，真是越来越老了。它在这儿待了多久来着？19年？都快比你年纪大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_521314e9:

    # e "Woah... it must take a lot of time to maintain the dummy, almost incredible you hadn't beat it to a pulp of cotton yet."
    e "哇……维护这个人偶肯定得花不少时间吧。真难以置信，你居然还没把它打成一团棉花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_23a6a199:

    # l "I would never do it to him."
    l "我绝不会对他做那种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_3b659d67:

    # e "Yeah, but it's just a dummy."
    e "是啊，但它就只是个人偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_b9361b15:

    # l "You don't understand... whatever. You better pay some respect to my dummy if you want to keep training with him."
    l "你不明白……算了。你要是还想和它继续训练，最好对我的人偶放尊重点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_c7b5f685:

    # e "Yes, I will... is there any history between you and the dummy?"
    e "我会的……你和这个人偶之间是不是有什么故事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_a9a5017e:

    # "Strangely Lothar didn't cut you off before you finish asking, instead, he looks back into the alleyway, staring at the dummy."
    "奇怪的是，洛萨尔居然没在你问完之前打断你，反而回头望向巷子深处，盯着那个人偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_1e73f1f7:

    # l "I don't have time for story."
    l "我没时间讲故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_5fd10514:

    # e "Ok..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_263b6688:

    # l "I'll talk to the lizard with your training. It's done now."
    l "我会告诉那只蜥蜴你已经训练完了。现在就到此为止。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_3a6fa982:

    # e "What about teaching me flirting?"
    e "那教我调情呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_51970578:

    # l "Later I will. You will know when the lesson comes."
    l "以后我会教你的。等课程开始时，你自然就知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_b097527c:

    # e "Okay, thanks. See you Lothar."
    e "好吧，谢谢你。回头见，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_2dd9edd6:

    # "Lothar walks into the alleyway, a few seconds later he came back with a strange look on his face."
    "洛萨尔走进巷子，几秒后又走了出来，脸上带着奇怪的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_50fcf88a:

    # l "Did you just lie to me, [e]." nointeract
    l "你刚刚是在骗我吗，[e]？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_7188cbc6:

    # e "I'm sorry Lothar... I thought the dummy wouldn't notice..."
    e "对不起，洛萨尔……我以为那个人偶不会察觉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_ed2a2a1f:

    # l "I, the hero of Lusterfield, treated you give hospitality, giving you practice and such, and this is how you return the favour?"
    l "我可是卢斯特菲尔德的英雄，对你盛情款待，还给你提供训练什么的，你就是这样报答我的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_5e4f4aa6:

    # e "I didn't mean to..."
    e "我不是故意的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_8928837b:

    # l "If you were a lion I would kick you down there so hard you wouldn't need to learn flirting anymore, luckily you aren't."
    l "如果你是头狮子，我就会狠狠踹你下面，踹到你再也不用学调情了。好在你不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_30769e95:

    # e "Hmm... I'll go and fight the dummy now..."
    e "嗯……我现在就去和那个人偶战斗……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_4c5f9f8a:

    # e "I was sure I was fighting the dummy, did he really tell you the truth?"
    e "我明明确定自己是在和那个人偶战斗，他真的把实情告诉你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_743494f4:

    # l "No, are you really trying to get away lying to the hero of the lusterfield?"
    l "不，你真以为自己能靠撒谎骗过卢斯特菲尔德的英雄，然后全身而退吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_d1c260a8:

    # l "You must really want to get punished by the hero then... Luckily I'm not in a mood to beat up a disciple today, maybe later."
    l "你还真是想让这位英雄惩罚你啊……好在我今天没心情揍徒弟，或许晚点再说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_9a238e31:

    # l "Now, go back to the alleyway before I change my mind."
    l "现在，在我改变主意之前，回巷子里去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Postal_Finish_74db1a7f:

    # e "Yes..."
    e "是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_06b17b2b:

    # e "Lothar, what do you think about the village?"
    e "洛萨尔，你觉得这个村子怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_01da349a:

    # l "Hmm? Is this a stupid question?"
    l "嗯？这是个蠢问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_45a5bea4:

    # e "I mean... how are other people in the village doing?"
    e "我是说……村里其他人过得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_689b78a8:

    # l "You should be asking them yourself, goat."
    l "你应该自己去问他们，山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_1db5ce3e:

    # e "I'm a dragon... but ok."
    e "我是龙……不过，行吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_81e8da35:

    # l "I guess I can tell you a few insider scoops..."
    l "我想我可以告诉你几条内幕……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_00419aaf:

    # l "The lizard, Ole. He's just staying in the shop all the time. Except for hunting with the lion sometimes."
    l "那只蜥蜴，奥利。他整天就待在店里，只有偶尔才会和那头狮子一起去打猎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_a1102730:

    # l "You see the lion? Lion is too full of himself, I will not tolerate him making fun of anything related to me. If he gets himself hurt because of his blabbering mouth, that's on him."
    l "你见过那头狮子吧？他太自以为是了，我可不能容忍他拿任何和我有关的事开玩笑。要是他因为那张喋喋不休的嘴受了伤，那也是他自找的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_f1c44980:

    # e "Uhh.... I heard Seb talking about something like this?"
    e "呃……我好像听塞巴斯说过类似的话？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_9bcb14d9:

    # l "Yeah. Tell him next time I'll use my fist... on his face."
    l "对。告诉他，下次我就用拳头……打在他脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_5fd10514:

    # e "Ok..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_f0633cfc:

    # l "Next one, the bat is laidback, I'd bring you to his tavern sometimes if that lizard wouldn't spy on me and you all the time."
    l "下一个，那只蝙蝠挺随和的。要不是那只蜥蜴一直监视着我和你，我有时还真想带你去他的酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_d03ceb80:

    # e "What lizard? Wait... Ole is watching?"
    e "什么蜥蜴？等等……奥利在监视我们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_94e26d37:

    # l "He somehow always knows what I am doing. The lizard must be watching me somewhere."
    l "他不知怎么的，总能知道我在做什么。那只蜥蜴肯定躲在什么地方监视我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_3615d06d:

    # l "And the bull. That bull makes some nice clothes. I used to teach his kids parrying and sword fighting."
    l "还有那头公牛。那头牛做的衣服挺不错。我以前还教过他的孩子们如何格挡和使剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_7c50b2f4:

    # l "But you know, times changed. Now I come over to his house for dinner once in a while."
    l "不过，你懂的，时代变了。现在我偶尔会去他家吃晚饭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_1f059268:

    # e "Ok... Is there anyone else I need to know?"
    e "好吧……还有其他我需要了解的人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Lusterfield_0d715947:

    # l "Not really. No."
    l "不算有。没有了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_ebbb2876:

    # e "Hey, Lothar, how did you become the hero of Lusterfield."
    e "嘿，洛萨尔，你是怎么成为乐斯特菲尔德的英雄的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_0301a476:

    # l "Ha, little goat. Are you planning to build me a statue?"
    l "哈，小山羊。你打算给我立座雕像吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_3b34272e:

    # e "Uhh... yes."
    e "呃……对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_e35c52e1:

    # l "Good, good. Ok. Let's begin. Ok. So, uh... Let me take a look."
    l "很好，很好。行，那我们开始吧。好吧。那么，呃……让我找找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_bdc33bea:

    # "Lothar takes out a notebook from his left pocket, a few pages fly out of the little crumbling book and he hurried to pick them up one by one, reading them out excitedly."
    "洛萨尔从左边口袋里掏出一本笔记本，几页纸从那本破旧的小书里飞了出来。他连忙一页页地把它们捡起来，兴奋地念了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_0062c425:

    # l "So... I was always meant to be a hero, since I was a little pup."
    l "那么……我从还是一只小幼崽的时候起，就注定要成为英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_ceff0fd7:

    # l "My parents were very supportive of me being an adventurer, they taught me hunting and fishing."
    l "我的父母非常支持我成为一名冒险家，他们教会了我打猎和捕鱼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_41f245d2:

    # l "I used sword at like 3 years old. Obviously I was very talented at the art of sword fighting. So I defeated my father in an epic sword battle at only 3."
    l "我大概三岁时就开始用剑了。很明显，我在剑术方面天赋异禀。所以我在年仅三岁时，就和父亲进行了一场史诗般的剑斗，并击败了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_be7dc128:

    # l "One day, when I was still 3. My mother gave me a paper cone and a long sword. I threw the paper cone away, because I was determined."
    l "有一天，那时我还只有三岁。母亲送给我一个纸锥和一把长剑。我把纸锥扔到了一边，因为我心意已决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_3cccf798:

    # l "At the age of 4-"
    l "四岁时——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_d95381b8:

    # e "Hey, Lothar. Can you summarize a little?"
    e "嘿，洛萨尔。你能稍微讲得简短一点吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_346e9f72:

    # l "What do you mean, That story was extremely important for my character development and growth, it will all make sense about my own motivation-"
    l "你什么意思？那段故事对我的人物塑造和成长至关重要，也能解释我自己的动机——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_da0738c2:

    # l "Ok... whatever. Ole taught you about skipping my dialogues as well didn't he."
    l "好吧……随便你。奥利也教过你怎么跳过我的对话，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_d20ee73c:

    # e "What? I didn't ski-"
    e "什么？我没跳——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_f70b348b:

    # l "Anyways, you know how I got the title? I set out on an adventure when I was 23, I brought with myself some water and my old long sword."
    l "不管怎么说，你知道我是怎么得到这个称号的吗？我二十三岁时踏上了冒险之旅，随身带了些水和我的老长剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_8a7f753f:

    # l "I went to the forest for the mysterious potion maker, but I found nothing... So I came back to the village."
    l "我前往森林寻找那位神秘的药剂师，但什么也没找到……于是我回到了村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_027ef1f2:

    # e "Wait... you found nothing? How are you the hero in thi-"
    e "等等……你什么都没找到？就这你还算什么英——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_d1ba155c:

    # l "Stop cutting off my story, [e]. I haven't even been halfway through yet."
    l "别打断我的故事，[e]。我还没讲到一半呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_3bc8b7a6:

    # "The wolf flips through pages of notes, picking up words from different pages."
    "这匹狼翻看着一页页笔记，从不同页面拾取词句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_7ee0ef84:

    # l "So I came back to the village, and I found Lusterfield to be infiltrated by the cult. That goat leader of the cult was ordering his little troops to destroy Lusterfield. And I was hiding in the bush."
    l "于是我回到了村子，却发现卢斯特菲尔德已经被邪教渗透了。那个邪教的山羊首领正命令他手下的小喽啰摧毁卢斯特菲尔德。而我当时正藏在灌木丛里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_51e525a3:

    # l "I was so furious they dare to show their face here, everyone was fighting for their lives, so I sneaked into the cult outpost. They didn't even notice me from behind."
    l "他们竟敢出现在这里，我当时气得要命。所有人都在为性命而战，所以我偷偷潜入了邪教据点。他们从背后根本没注意到我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_03ad2281:

    # e "Were they fighting as well?"
    e "他们也在战斗吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_7b7c9c72:

    # l "No, the higher-ups were just looking, so I infiltrated their camp and found their goat leader. I don't even remember his name. Tel... or something."
    l "不，那些高层只是在旁观，所以我潜入了他们的营地，找到了那个山羊首领。我甚至不记得他的名字了。泰……还是啥来着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_379b4dfa:

    # l "I had the best battle with the goat while everyone was outside. Long story short, I overwhelmed him and knocked him off, he just falls on the ground and rang his bell for help."
    l "所有人都在外面时，我和那只山羊展开了一场精彩绝伦的战斗。长话短说，我压制住了他并把他击倒。他摔在地上，摇响铃铛求救。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_dec18c6b:

    # l "The goat keeps ringing and shaking his bell like it could possibly save him from the inevitable death, but I simply yanked it off from his neck and struck him with my long sword."
    l "那只山羊不停摇晃铃铛，仿佛这样就能让他逃过注定的死亡，但我只是把铃铛从他脖子上扯下来，然后用长剑砍了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_324da70f:

    # e "That's a little crue-"
    e "听起来有点残——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_f9da9c3f:

    # l "He got what he deserved, [e]."
    l "他这是罪有应得，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_9118935c:

    # l "So when all their goat gangs arrived, I've already escaped from the outpost. Soon after the cult retreated from Lusterfield. They were acting like a bunch of headless chicken without their arrogant leader."
    l "所以等那些山羊帮伙赶到时，我早就已经逃离据点了。没过多久，邪教就从卢斯特菲尔德撤退了。没了那个傲慢的首领，他们就像一群没头苍蝇似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_89574f93:

    # e "That's why you are the hero of Lusterfield."
    e "所以这就是你成为卢斯特菲尔德英雄的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_2cbd53d6:

    # l "Of course. The fight was legendary and it takes an immeasurable amount of courage to face the whole faction alone. Everyone in the village loves me after that."
    l "当然。这场战斗堪称传奇，独自面对整个阵营需要无可估量的勇气。从那以后，村里所有人都喜欢我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_c75585fd:

    # e "Wow, that was one hell of a story."
    e "哇，这故事可真不得了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_07e45c94:

    # l "You bet it is. Now you have a role model to learn from, and pray that you can get half as good as me."
    l "你说得没错。现在你有了一个可以学习的榜样，祈祷自己能有我一半优秀吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Hero_f8813d0a:

    # e "...Ok, Lothar."
    e "……好吧，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_a2faa6df:

    # e "How are you doing, Lothar?"
    e "最近怎么样，洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_d417045e:

    # l "I had a few beer, these little bottles of shit are fantastic!"
    l "我喝了几瓶啤酒，这些小破瓶子可真带劲！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_277bafae:

    # e "Hmm... are you here very often?"
    e "嗯……你经常来这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_d330d49d:

    # l "Yes... Every night and then I come around the inn and mess with the bat. That was some good stuff."
    l "是啊……我每晚都会来客栈找那只老蝙蝠闹一闹。那可真够带劲的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_51ca39d9:

    # e "Are you drunk... Lothar? Your face seems pretty red..."
    e "你喝醉了吗……洛萨尔？你的脸好像挺红的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_2e877e9f:

    # l "A-ahem. No. I've been drinking for decades now, you think I'm going to suddenly get beaten up by these tiny glasses?"
    l "咳咳。不。我喝了几十年的酒了，你以为我会突然被这些小杯子放倒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_7d0d1f7f:

    # e "That's good, Lothar. See you next day then."
    e "那就好，洛萨尔。明天见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_9ec597c5:

    # l "Good. Whatever."
    l "好吧，随便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_d8a8fa62:

    # e "How are you doing, Lothar."
    e "洛萨尔，你最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_8fef9f93:

    # l "Good. I'm watching over the village, not a lot of activities here today."
    l "挺好的。我在照看村子，今天没什么事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_a89445d1:

    # e "Is there anything I can help?"
    e "有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_96fd5a8d:

    # l "No. You better keep up with your training."
    l "没有。你最好别落下自己的训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_Himself_bd9e9f2e:

    # e "Ok, Lothar."
    e "好的，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_End_4c28f542:

    # e "That's all I need, thank you, Lothar."
    e "我想知道的就这些了，谢谢你，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_End_f163ce69:

    # l "Hmm..."
    l "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_End_f9012104:

    # l "Ok. I'll continue my hero business then."
    l "好吧。那我继续做我的英雄大业。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Dialogue_End_8b8ddf1b:

    # l "Good, stay safe out there, disciple."
    l "好，徒弟，在外面注意安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_58d8197c:

    # e "Hey..."
    e "嗨……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_47b644fa:

    # patron "Don't you see we're battling among ourselves?"
    patron "你没看见俺们正在互相较量吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_5b94ccd3:

    # e "Yeah. Arm wrestling, right? Who's winning here."
    e "是掰手腕，对吧？现在谁占上风？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_e4157e46:

    # patron "I'd say Vult, the cougar. He has been beating him every time we come here."
    patron "我觉得是山狮沃特。我们每次来，他都能赢下比赛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_3dbd3037:

    # e "Aww... You guys seems pretty strong."
    e "哇……你们看起来都挺强壮的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_e40d136b:

    # patron "Look we're still battling, and I don't want to miss a single second of this exciting match. I'll see you when we're done."
    patron "你看，俺们还在较量呢。这么精彩的比赛，我可不想错过哪怕一秒。等比完了再见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron1_Dialogue_8dd2ff0d:

    # e "Alright. Have fun!"
    e "好吧。玩得开心！"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_ec05c2fe:

    # patron "You see, the stars in the skies are actually monsters, and the sun is probably the most fierce one, that's why my eyes hurt when I look at him."
    patron "你看，天上的星星其实都是怪兽，而太阳大概是其中最凶猛的那个，所以我一看它眼睛就疼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_1d534c56:

    # patron "I think the sun is a wolf... maybe... a dragon. Like a sun dragon monster. You get what I mean. And the moon. He's an elephant... I think, small elephant."
    patron "我觉得太阳是一头狼……也许是龙……就像太阳龙怪兽。你懂我的意思吧。还有月亮，他是一头大象……我想，还是头小象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_5e06e653:

    # patron2 "Yeah... monsters in the skies. You know what I see? I can see there's another huge monster out there though..."
    patron2 "对……天上的怪兽。你知道我看见什么了吗？我能看见外面还有一只更大的怪兽，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_ee49c3a8:

    # patron "Hmm a monster? where?"
    patron "嗯？怪兽？在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_2a3c4b44:

    # patron2 "not in the skies, underneath the table..."
    patron2 "不在天上，在桌子底下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_81c9d756:

    # patron "What? How? I don't see no creatures there..."
    patron "什么？怎么会？我没看见那里有什么生物……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron2_Dialogue_082fccfa:

    # e "'I think I should leave these two alone...'"
    e "“我想，我还是别打扰这两位了……”"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron3_Dialogue_da1a7a72:

    # e "Hello...?"
    e "你好……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron3_Dialogue_414b3281:

    # patron "...He-... {p} wha-... he...hnnngh... so handsome. {p} au-uuugh... hnnnnngh......."
    patron "……他……{p}什、什么……他……嗯嗯……好帅。{p}啊呜……嗯嗯嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron3_Dialogue_25c145d8:

    # patron "h-hmmmph.... hnnnn... o-ohhhhhhh... {p} mine... he... h-hahaha... {p} hmmmm... asssssss..."
    patron "呃……嗯嗯……哦哦哦……{p}我的……他……哈哈哈……{p}嗯嗯……啊啊啊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron3_Dialogue_a83f097b:

    # e "'He's so drunk I don't think I can talk to him now... But I wonder who he is talking about...'"
    e "“他醉得太厉害了，我想现在没法跟他说话……不过真好奇他在说谁……”"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_c6a5c177:

    # e "Hey there..."
    e "嘿，你好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_2a055e4a:

    # "You approach a pair of patrons standing on the edge, they raise their tankards and take a sip before turning their attention to you."
    "你走近站在一旁的两位酒客。他们举起手中的大酒杯抿了一口，然后把注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_b88e39a1:

    # e "How's it going?"
    e "最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_c19b7643:

    # patron2 "The bard's good, I tell ye."
    patron2 "我跟你说，那吟游诗人可真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_f6ac164a:

    # patron "Aye, he's got a voice that could charm a dragon. And his skills with that lute of his, simply mesmerizing."
    patron "没错，他的嗓音足以迷住一条龙。他弹那把鲁特琴的本事也叫人着迷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_e133c8b0:

    # patron2 "I've seen my fair share of bards, but this one's got a unique flair. There's something about his performances that draws you in, makes you forget all your worries."
    patron2 "我见过不少吟游诗人，但这位自有一番独特的风采。他的演出仿佛有种魔力，能把你吸引进去，让你忘掉所有烦恼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_468b5186:

    # e "He's a talented songsinger indeed."
    e "他确实是个有才华的吟唱诗人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_6eb80c97:

    # patron "Remember that one tale about the hero? I wonder if it'd actually happen, the way he tells the stories almost feels as if I was there."
    patron "还记得那个英雄的故事吗？我真想知道那种事会不会真的发生。他讲故事的样子，简直让我觉得自己亲临其境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_c574f939:

    # patron2 "Are you serious, of course no. That's nothing but a mere ghost tale to scare kids."
    patron2 "你认真的？当然不可能。那不过是用来吓唬孩子的无聊鬼故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_e38565e6:

    # patron2 "But still, credit's where credit's due, there's been more than a crowd paid to be here, just to listen to his songs and dance."
    patron2 "不过话说回来，该给的肯定还是得给：已经不止一群人花钱来到这里，就为了听他的歌跳舞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_2bc23d29:

    # patron "I've heard he's a travelling one, gonna miss him while he's gone."
    patron "我听说他是个四处旅行的吟游诗人，他离开后我们肯定会想念他的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_1a8fda2d:

    # patron2 "Cane's gonna pay him huge to stay, I tell ye. There's no way he'll be gone anytime soon considering the patrons he's brought."
    patron2 "我跟你说，凯恩肯定会出大价钱让他留下。考虑到他带来的这些酒客，他短时间内绝不可能离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_c51e25cd:

    # patron "Yeah right..."
    patron "哈，得了吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_aac1a24c:

    # patron "Good, server. Cane just redecorated this floor, finally feels like we're breathing now."
    patron "好，伙计。凯恩刚把这一层重新布置了一番，现在总算感觉能喘口气了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_bf1955c0:

    # patron2 "Yea, I do get why he stopped opening the second floor since after that lad was gone, but the tavern's been too busy for casual dwellers like us."
    patron2 "是啊，我也明白，自从那个小伙子离开后，他为什么不再开放二楼了。但酒馆对我们这种随便住住的人来说，还是太忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_0153c11d:

    # e "Ah, is this floor any different?"
    e "啊？这一层有什么不一样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_66888412:

    # patron "Well, incase you're still getting used to here, we've been one of the most loyal regulars here, so Cane lets us go up with a proper discount."
    patron "嗯，要是你还没习惯这里，我们可是这里最忠实的常客之一，所以凯恩会让我们打折上楼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_59462e81:

    # patron "We just have to get food and drinks by ourselves, and we're more than capable to do that. Plus, this place is so much more quiet and cozy than downstairs."
    patron "我们只需要自己去拿食物和饮料，这点事我们完全应付得来。而且，这里比楼下安静舒适多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_41d35ea1:

    # patron2 "He's right, server. Sorry to say but you'd better appeal to the newcomers of the tavern. Not saying I won't get my hand on you if ye want though."
    patron2 "他说得对，伙计。虽然不太好听，但你最好多招揽些酒馆里的新客人。不过嘛，要是你愿意，我也不是不能对你动手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_1b5aed61:

    # "You blush profusely."
    "你满脸通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Patron4_Dialogue_5227365d:

    # patron2 "Eh, that wasn't flirting, just saying you've gotta have to stay here for a while, else Cane's gonna close this floor down again."
    patron2 "呃，我可不是在调情，只是说你得在这里待上一阵，不然凯恩又要把这一层关了。"
